window.__LITE_PARTS__=window.__LITE_PARTS__||[];window.__LITE_PARTS__.push([{"t":"重构诱导的双层非晶-晶体混合NiOOH基阳极用于超稳定海水电解","b":"ABSTRACT Direct seawater electrolysis represents a critical pathway for large‐scale utilization of renewable energy in coastal and island regions without potential impacts on freshwater supply, yet being severely hindered by the corrosion of electrode materials in seawater. Conventional anion‐based protection strategies often suffer from lattice degradation during activation or anion desorption in operation. Herein, we report a facile electrodeposition‐anodization synthesized amorphous–crystalline hybrid NiFeCoCr anode featuring a vertically bilayered architecture, enabling ultrastable seawater oxidation for over 15 000 h at 500 mA cm −2 . During anodization, the partial sacrificial leaching of Cr forms an amorphous β‐NiOOH phase surface layer, exposing abundant active sites to enhance OER activity. Concurrently, in situ generated CrO 4 2– anions stably adsorb and intercalate within the dense crystalline Fe/Co‐doped γ‐NiOOH underneath layer. The electrolyzer assembled with the NiFeCoCr anode delivers stable operation for over 2500 h in alkaline natural seawater and for 240 h in alkaline saturated NaCl electrolyte at 80°C.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75084","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水电解稳定阳极","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对直接海水电解中电极腐蚀及传统阴离子保护策略在活化过程晶格退化或运行中阴离子脱附的问题，研究通过电沉积-阳极氧化法合成了非晶-晶体混合NiFeCoCr阳极，具有垂直双层结构。阳极氧化过程中Cr的部分牺牲性浸出形成非晶β-NiOOH相表层，暴露丰富活性位点增强OER性能。该阳极在500 mA cm⁻²电流密度下实现超过15000小时的超稳定海水氧化，为沿海和岛屿地区可再生能源大规模利用提供方案。","kp":["电极[NiOOH基阳极]: 双层非晶-晶体混合结构","制备工艺: 电沉积-阳极化法","应用[海水电解]: 超稳定性，克服阴离子保护策略的晶格降解/脱附问题"]},{"t":"空间协同调控中空纤维的连续转变用于水驱动能源","b":"ABSTRACT The growing demand for efficient water energy and resource management presents critical challenges to address pollution, energy, and resource extraction, as current methods suffer from high energy consumption, inefficiencies and environmental impact. The key lies in the development of coregulated materials structure and associated physical‐chemical properties, enabling efficient fluid management and molecular interactions crucial for advancing water‐power technologies. Herein, we develop hydrogel hollow filaments using a sustainable continuous‐assembly metamorphic (CAM) approach that achieves nonequilibrium hierarchical assembly, delivering control over conformational structure and attributes for integral water‐power innovations. This design principle of self‐organization transformation underpins collective properties and addresses prevalent fluidic perturbation and breakup issues in filament manufacturing. CAM hollow filaments demonstrate auto‐pumping differentiated ionic interaction, with key advancements including ∼1000% improvement in thermopower for energy harvesting, ∼90% efficiency in trace‐lithium ions collection. This work marks a new methodology of clean energy transition and resource sustainability, while aligning with the broader goals of clean energy and economic sustainability.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75088","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/其他发电技术","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中空纤维水驱动能源","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"针对水处理与资源提取方法能耗高、效率低和环境影响的挑战，研究开发了基于可持续连续组装变形(CAM)方法制备的水凝胶中空纤维。该方法实现非平衡分级组装，可对构象结构及物理化学属性进行协同调控，从而有效管理流体和分子相互作用。这种自组织设计原则为水驱动能源技术提供了整体性创新路径，应对污染治理、能源和资源提取等关键需求。","kp":["中空纤维[水驱动能源]: 结构与物理化学性质空间协同调控，实现高效流体管理与分子相互作用"]},{"t":"通过电荷极化解锁金属光催化剂上的高效近红外CO₂光还原","b":"ABSTRACT Metallic photocatalysts provide a promising route for utilizing low‐energy near‐infrared (NIR) photons in CO 2 conversion because they bypass the bandgap constraints of conventional semiconductors. However, their intrinsically uniform electrostatic potential limits charge separation and CO 2 adsorption/activation, thereby restricting their photocatalytic performance. Here, we report a charge polarization strategy that addresses this bottleneck through the synergistic incorporation of sulfur vacancies ( S v ) and Au single atoms (Au SAs) in metallic NiCo 2 S 4 . The optimized Au SA / S v ‐NiCo 2 S 4 photocatalyst exhibits a 64‐fold enhancement in activity relative to pristine NiCo 2 S 4 under NIR irradiation without sacrificial agents, delivering CO and CH 4 production rates of 1020 and 150 µmol g −1 h −1 , respectively. Notably, it achieves a benchmark apparent quantum efficiency (AQE) of 1.24% at 800 nm and a solar‐to‐chemical energy conversion (STC) efficiency of 0.86% at room temperature. Mechanistic investigations reveal that charge redistribution reshapes the photocatalytic behavior of the metallic system in two complementary ways: it induces local polarization that suppresses charge recombination, and favors the formation of bimetallic Co 3+ ⋯Ni 2+ frustrated Lewis pair (FLP) sites for CO 2 adsorption, activation, and *COOH generation. This work demonstrates charge polarization as an effective strategy for designing metallic photocatalysts, opening new opportunities for efficient solar‐driven CO 2 valorization.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75065","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外CO2光还原","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"金属光催化剂可绕过半导体带隙限制利用低能近红外(NIR)光子进行CO₂转化，但其均匀静电势限制电荷分离与CO₂吸附活化。研究提出电荷极化策略：在金属相NiCo₂S₄中协同引入硫空位(Sv)与Au单原子。优化后的AuSA/Sv-NiCo₂S₄光催化剂在无牺牲剂条件下，NIR光照下活性较原始NiCo₂S₄提升64倍，CO和CH₄生成速率分别达102等高水平，实现高效近红外CO₂光还原。","kp":["光催化策略[金属光催化剂]: 电荷极化(表面物种协同掺杂)突破均匀静电势限制，实现高效近红外CO₂光还原","优势: 绕过传统半导体带隙限制，利用低能NIR光子"]},{"t":"几何介导的微凝胶结构-力学性能用于肠道区域特异性益生菌递送","b":"ABSTRACT The physiological efficacy of functional food ingredients, particularly probiotics is highly dependent on their spatial localization within the intestine. The non‐specific delivery of probiotics severely restricts their therapeutic efficacy. Herein, we developed a sustainable, food‐grade microgel delivery platform assembled from corncob nanocellulose building blocks with distinct geometries for programmable intestinal probiotic release. Owing to their distinct topological structures and mechanical properties, spherical nanocellulose‐based microgels (CNSM) were found to disintegrate in the ileum, while rod‐like nanocellulose‐based microgels (CNRM) retained intact until reaching the colon, where they subsequently ruptured. Molecular dynamics simulations supported the superior structural stability of CNRM against osmotic swelling, revealing a structure‐mechanics driven mechanism for the controlled release pattern. Both microgels significantly enhanced probiotic survival, as well as nanocoating‐mediated mucoadhesion and colonization. To maximize functionality, bile salt hydrolase‐producing L. plantarum WCFS1 and immunomodulatory L. rhamnosus GG were embedded into CNSM and CNRM, respectively. Consequently, ileum‐targeted WCFS1@CNSM significantly ameliorated hypercholesterolemia, accompanied by increased fecal cholesterol excretion and potential modulation of the gut‐liver signaling axis whereas colon‐targeted LGG@CNRM profoundly alleviated DSS‐induced colitis through epithelial barrier restoration and inflammation suppression. This work provides a region‐specific delivery strategy for next‐generation probiotic therapeutics.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75011","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微凝胶肠道益生菌递送","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"益生菌的功能效果高度依赖其在肠道内的空间定位。研究开发了一种食品级微凝胶递送平台，以不同几何形状的玉米芯纳米纤维素为构筑单元，实现益生菌的可编程肠道释放。由于拓扑结构和力学性能差异，球形纳米纤维素微凝胶(CNSM)在回肠崩解，而棒状微凝胶(CNRM)则保持完整直至到达结肠后破裂释放。分子动力学模拟支持了两种微凝胶结构稳定性的差异，实现了肠道区域特异性益生菌递送。","kp":["微凝胶递送平台[肠道益生菌]: 玉米芯纳米纤维素构建，不同几何形貌实现肠道区域特异性程序化释放","属性: 可持续、食品级"]},{"t":"电刺激相变介导的强粘附水凝胶","b":"ABSTRACT Adhesive hydrogels are crucial for interfacing wearable electronics with substrates, yet the inherent trade‐off between interfacial adhesion and cohesive strength always limits their application performance. Here, we present an adhesive hydrogel based on lignin‐mediated catechol chemistry and salt hydrate phase‐transition, which achieves synergistic enhancement of interfacial adhesion and cohesive strength upon 1 V electrostimulated crystallization. The hydrogel is soft and exhibits mild adhesion to various substrates in amorphous state. Electrostimulus‐induced phase‐transition realizes a significant increment of cohesive strength and boosts interfacial adhesion by up to 8–40 times (exceeding 3000 J m −2 ) on skin. The adhesion‐enhancement mechanisms on different substrates are elucidated via multi‐scale experimental designs and molecular simulations. When the hydrogel is applied as the adhesive layer, the assembled elastomer sensing devices inherit the electrostimulus adhesion‐enhancement and shape‐memory properties, significantly improving signal transmission stability and motion‐interference resistance. This study offers a simple and versatile strategy for stimuli‐enhanced adhesives, deepens the understanding of phase‐transition regulated adhesion behaviors, and supports the development of large‐area flexible devices for intelligent robotics and human‐computer interactions.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75100","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电刺激粘附水凝胶","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"粘附水凝胶面临界面粘附与内聚强度此消彼长的固有矛盾。研究提出一种基于木质素介导儿茶酚化学和水合盐相变的粘附水凝胶，在1 V电刺激诱导结晶下实现界面粘附与内聚强度的协同增强。非晶态时水凝胶柔软且对多种基底呈温和粘附；电刺激诱导相变使内聚强度显著提升，皮肤表面界面粘附提高8–40倍，超过3000 J m⁻²。研究阐明了不同基底上的粘附增强机制，适用于可穿戴电子器件界面。","kp":["电刺激[水凝胶结晶]: 1 V触发相变结晶","机制: 木质素介导儿茶酚化学+盐水合物相变，界面粘附与内聚强度协同增强"]},{"t":"通过四层逻辑门控钌纳米复合材料顺序解锁RNS/ROS风暴用于耐缺氧光动力癌症免疫治疗","b":"ABSTRACT Tumor hypoxia, an immunosuppressive microenvironment, and the lack of spatiotemporally precise therapeutic activation collectively limit current cancer treatments. Here, we report a smart nanocomposite ( G&Ru@CuS ) that produces a localized reactive nitrogen species (RNS)/reactive oxygen species (ROS) storm controlled by four sequential logic gates. (i) Intracellular ROS degrade a thioketal‐crosslinked polymer gatekeeper, exposing the hollow CuS core. (ii) Acidic tumor pH (6.5–6.8) and high glutathione (GSH) trigger release of Cu 2+ , the NO donor S‐Nitrosoglutathione (GSNO), and a NO‐responsive mitochondria‐targeted prodrug photosensitizer Ru1 from the a degradable CuS scaffold. (iii) Cu 2+ catalyzes NO generation from GSNO. (iv) NO reacts with Ru1 to form Ru2 . Ru2 is an NO‐responsive prodrug photosensitizer that, upon activation, displays dual Type I/II photodynamic activity. It retains efficacy under hypoxia, rapidly depletes GSH, oxidizes NADH, and shows photocatalytic peroxidase activity, making it a powerful agent for triggering an RNS/ROS storm that drives tumor cell mitochondrial damage, necroptosis and ferroptosis, resulting in immunogenic cell death that promotes dendritic cell maturation and systemic antitumor immunity. In murine models, intravenous G&Ru@CuS achieves potent tumor inhibition with excellent immunotherapy and no systemic toxicity. This work is the first quadruple logic‐gated nanoplatform that overcomes hypoxia, enables spatiotemporal precision, and minimizes off‐target effects.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75092","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钌纳米逻辑门控治疗","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"肿瘤缺氧、免疫抑制微环境及缺乏时空精准激活共同限制当前癌症治疗。研究报道了智能纳米复合材料G&Ru@CuS，通过四重顺序逻辑门控产生局部RNS/ROS风暴：(i)胞内ROS降解缩酮交联聚合物门卫，暴露中空CuS核；(ii)肿瘤酸性pH(6.5–6.8)和高GSH触发Cu²⁺、NO供体GSNO及NO响应线粒体靶向光敏剂前药Ru1从可降解CuS支架释放；(iii)Cu²⁺催化GSNO产NO；(iv)NO与Ru1反应生成Ru2，实现耐缺氧光动力癌症免疫治疗。","kp":["纳米复合材料: G&Ru@CuS（四层顺序逻辑门控RNS/ROS风暴）","逻辑门控机制: 细胞内ROS降解巯基酮交联聚合物门卫，暴露中空CuS核","肿瘤酸性pH触发: 6.5–6.8"]},{"t":"跨非共线反铁磁体Mn₃Sn界面的自旋输运","b":"ABSTRACT Non‐collinear antiferromagnets such as are promising materials for ultrafast spintronic applications due to their peculiar electronic structure and efficient spin‐dependent transport phenomena. Here, we investigate magnetic ordering and ultrafast spin transport in c ‐axis oriented thin films and ‐based heterostructures with Pt and . Temperature‐dependent magneto‐optical Kerr effect measurements confirm thermally activated switching of the cluster octupole moment near the Néel temperature, while preserving predominantly in‐plane magnetic order. In heterostructures, however, pronounced room‐temperature ferromagnetic signatures are observed, including enhanced Kerr rotation and out‐of‐plane magnetization. Systematic magnetometry studies reveal the formation of an intermixed interfacial phase upon annealing. Ultrafast transport measurements using a sample with optimized interfaces show that optical excitation of generates predominantly anomalous Nernst currents, with no detectable evidence of efficient spin–current injection into Pt. In contrast, exhibits a significant inverse spin Hall conversion when driven by spin currents injected from , reaching approximately of the efficiency of Pt‐based reference structures. The conversion efficiency is found to be independent of the relative orientation between ferromagnetic magnetization and antiferromagnetic octupole moment. Our results emphasize the importance of interface engineering for spintronic devices.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75024","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/磁性材料","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反铁磁体自旋输运","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究考察了c轴取向Mn₃Sn薄膜及其与Pt等构成的异质结中的磁有序与超快自旋输运。温度依赖的磁光克尔效应测量证实，在奈尔温度附近簇八极矩发生热激活翻转，同时保持以面内为主的磁有序。但在异质结结构中观察到明显的室温铁磁特征，包括增强的克尔旋转和面外磁化。系统磁强测量研究揭示了界面处形成混合界面层，为理解非共线反铁磁体界面自旋输运及其在超快自旋电子学中的应用提供依据。","kp":["材料体系: 非共线反铁磁体Mn₃Sn薄膜及与Pt异质结构","c轴取向薄膜: 热激活八极矩开关发生在奈尔温度附近"]},{"t":"两性离子二肽的生物启发分子筛选用于稳定安时级锌碘电池","b":"ABSTRACT Aqueous zinc–iodine (Zn─I 2 ) batteries are attractive for large‐scale energy storage yet remain limited by two coupled failure mechanisms: unstable zinc interface at the anode and polyiodide shuttling at the cathode. To address both challenges with a single additive, we systematically screened 44 amino acids and dipeptides using molecular dipole moment and LUMO energy as key descriptors. L‐Carnosine (LC) emerged as a unique candidate exhibiting both the highest dipole moment and a moderate LUMO energy across the screened library. Experimentally, LC's zwitterionic, multicenter charge distribution drives persistent multidentate adsorption at the zinc interface, suppressing HER, directing (101)‐oriented crystallographic deposition through facet‐selective passivation, and enabling formation of a vertically graded organic‐inorganic hybrid solid electrolyte interphase. Concurrently, the electron‐rich imidazole group rapidly quenches polyiodide intermediates through a rapid redox reaction. This synergistic regulation enables Zn||Zn symmetric cells to operate stably for 4980 h, Zn||Cu cells to achieve 99.76% average Coulombic efficiency (CE) over 1400 cycles, and Zn||I 2 full cells to sustain over 18 000 cycles with nearly 100% capacity retention. Furthermore, the practical viability is demonstrated in Ah‐level pouch cells with 85% capacity retention after 500 cycles. This work establishes a unique molecular transformation strategy for stabilizing high‐energy aqueous energy systems.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75095","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池添加剂","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"水性锌碘电池受锌负极界面不稳定和多碘化物穿梭两种耦合失效机制限制。研究以分子偶极矩和LUMO能级为关键描述符，系统筛选44种氨基酸和二肽，发现L-肌肽(LC)兼具最高偶极矩和适中LUMO能级。LC的两性离子多中心电荷分布驱动其在锌界面的持久多齿吸附，抑制析氢反应，通过晶面选择性钝化引导(101)取向沉积，形成无枝晶锌负极，实现安时级稳定锌碘电池。","kp":["电池体系: 水系锌碘(Zn─I₂)电池","筛选范围: 44种氨基酸和二肽，以分子偶极矩和LUMO能量为描述符","最优添加剂: L-肌肽（LC），兼具最高偶极矩与双功能抑制机制"]},{"t":"基于忆阻器的饱和约束信息容量框架用于时序信息处理","b":"ABSTRACT Physical reservoir computing (PRC) has emerged as a highly energy‐efficient paradigm for processing high‐dimensional spatiotemporal data in edge‐intelligent systems. However, the deployment of PRC is often limited by the quantization mismatch between continuous input signals and the finite dynamic range of hardware substrates. Conventional binary time‐multiplexing ensures high noise immunity but necessitates protracted pulse sequences that induce high latency and premature physical saturation. Conversely, multi‐valued analog encoding enhances information density but frequently induces state overlap, operating devoid of physical quantization boundaries. To resolve this physical‐information trade‐off, we propose a saturation‐constrained information capacity (SCIC) framework. This framework considers task‐specific encoding variables and substrate‐intrinsic constraints, enabling device‐informed optimization of input mapping. We experimentally demonstrate this framework on a highly uniform, selector‐free 32 × 32 crossbar array, utilizing the volatile dynamics of memristors. Under the experimentally selected encoding conditions, the SCIC‐guided RC achieves exceptional performance in temporal prediction (NRMSE of 0.019), speech recognition (free‐spoken digit dataset (FSDD) subset accuracy of ∼94.5%), and real‐time obstacle avoidance. Our approach links encoding constraints to solid‐state device physics, providing a device‐informed method for PRC parameterization at the edge.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.75096","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻器储备池计算","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"物理储备计算（PRC）是边缘智能系统中处理高维时空数据的高能效范式，但连续输入信号与硬件有限动态范围之间的量化失配限制了其部署。传统二进制时分复用抗噪性强，但需要冗长脉冲序列，导致高延迟和过早物理饱和；多值模拟编码提升信息密度，却易引起状态重叠、缺乏物理量化边界。针对这一物理-信息权衡问题，研究提出了饱和约束信息容量（SCIC）框架，以忆阻器为基础，在信息密度与物理饱和约束之间取得平衡，用于时序信息处理。","kp":["技术范式: 基于忆阻器的物理储备池计算（PRC）","提出框架: 饱和约束信息容量框架，解决连续输入信号与硬件有限动态范围的量化失配问题"]},{"t":"重新思考数据中心规划","b":"The rapid expansion of data centres is challenging power systems and planning processes to keep pace.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02146-y","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"Nature Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论","tp":"数据中心规划挑战","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该文关注数据中心的快速扩张对电力系统和规划流程带来的挑战。随着数据中心规模迅速增长，其用电需求对电网运行构成压力，现有规划过程难以跟上扩张速度。文章指出需要在电力系统与数据中心规划之间加强协调，以应对这一快速发展带来的基础设施与能源供给问题。"},{"t":"提高气候科学中LGBTQIA+群体的包容性","b":"LGBTQIA+ climate scientists have long encountered oppression and discrimination across society and in the workplace. We suggest specific actions, which need to be supported by more data, to make climate science more inclusive.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-026-02748-0","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Nature Climate Change","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论","tp":"气候科学包容性","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":4.0},"as":"LGBTQIA+气候科学家长期以来在社会和工作场所遭遇压迫与歧视。文章指出气候科学领域存在包容性不足的问题，并提出了一系列具体行动建议以提升气候科学的包容性。作者强调这些建议需要更多数据支撑，以推动性别与性少数群体在气候科学领域的公平参与。"},{"t":"闪发能源干旱使电网承压","b":"Rapid declines in wind or solar generation may leave electricity systems little time to respond. Now a study maps these events globally and projects that their duration may increase under climate change.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-026-02760-4","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量分配与运输/电网相关技术","a":"Nature Climate Change","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论","tp":"闪发能源干旱风险","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"风速或太阳能发电量的快速下降可能使电力系统来不及做出响应。相关研究在全球范围内对这些事件进行了制图分析，并预测在气候变化背景下，此类事件（闪发能源干旱）的持续时间可能增加。这一发现凸显了电力系统面对可再生能源出力骤降时的脆弱性，对电网调度和应对策略具有重要警示意义。"},{"t":"气候变化下太阳能与风能资源的闪发能源干旱","b":"Flash energy droughts, rapid drops followed by sustained low wind and solar production, could pose potential challenges to power system operations. Here researchers find that climate change may intensify such events across wind, solar and compound forms.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-026-02753-3","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/风电","a":"Nature Climate Change","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光能源干旱","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"闪发能源干旱指风能和太阳能发电快速下降并随后持续处于低水平的现象，可能对电力系统运行构成潜在挑战。研究人员发现，气候变化可能加剧此类事件，包括风力、太阳能以及两者复合形式。研究强调了气候变化背景下可再生能源出力剧烈波动风险的增加，对电力系统规划和运行具有重要意义。","kp":["关键结论: 气候变化可能加剧风电、光伏及复合型闪发能源干旱事件"]},{"t":"简单逻辑警告可跨信念与党派立场改善气候论证评估","b":"Climate discourse is often misjudged, yet the mechanisms remain unclear. Using orthogonally manipulated experiments, this study isolates the effects of prior beliefs, partisanship and argument quality, showing that evaluations of climate arguments are context sensitive and can be improved by minimal logic warnings.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-026-02754-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Climate Change","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"堵塞与连通","b":"Jammed and connected","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00448-2","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"堵塞与连通","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":4.0},"as":"一篇题为《堵塞与连通》的报道，探讨堵塞与连通（Jammed and connected）相关的主题，正文内容简短未提供更多细节。"},{"t":"用于瞬态可摄入生物电子器件的生物可吸收电池","b":"This study presents a bioresorbable magnesium–molybdenum trioxide paper battery that delivers 1.84 V under physiological conditions and degrades after use. Validated in swine models, the platform powers battery-assisted RFID medication adherence tracking and capsule-based gastric electrical stimulation, establishing a foundation for retrieval-free bioelectronic medicine.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00443-7","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可吸收生物电池","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种可生物吸收的镁-三氧化钼纸基电池，在生理条件下可输出1.84 V电压，使用后可自行降解。该平台在猪模型中得到验证，可为电池辅助的RFID药物依从性追踪和基于胶囊的胃电刺激提供电力。该成果为免取出的生物电子医学器件奠定了基础，适用于瞬态可摄入生物电子器件。","kp":["电池类型: 可生物吸收镁-三氧化钼纸基电池","输出电压[生理条件]: 1.84 V","降解特性: 使用后可降解，无需回收","验证模型: 猪模型，用于RFID用药依从性追踪和胶囊式胃电刺激"]},{"t":"碱基间隙开关通过感应疾病相关DNA控制蛋白质表达","b":"Linking protein production to the presence of specific DNA targets provides a powerful tool for sensing disease. Base gap switches are new sensors that exploit engineered gaps in genes to regulate their transcription, and therefore protein expression, as a function of target DNA concentration.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44460-026-00137-w","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Nature Sensors","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"DNA碱基间隙开关","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"碱基间隙开关是一类新型生物传感器，利用基因中工程化的间隙来调控转录过程，从而使蛋白质表达依赖于目标DNA的浓度。这一机制将蛋白质生产与特定DNA目标的存在直接关联，为疾病感知提供了强大工具，可用于检测疾病相关DNA并据此调控蛋白表达。","kp":["碱基间隙开关[工作机制]: 通过基因工程间隙调控转录，蛋白质表达随靶DNA浓度变化"]},{"t":"单个Pt纳米颗粒中的原位单原子追踪检测到Langmuir与Taylor活性位点的共存","b":"Understanding heterogeneous catalysis has been limited by the inability to directly observe atomic-scale structural changes under operando conditions. Now operando electron microscopy and quantitative image analysis are combined to quantitatively track with atomic resolution the three-dimensional evolution of individual Pt nanoparticles during CO oxidation, revealing the coexistence and dynamic interplay of Taylor- and Langmuir-type active sites.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41929-026-01612-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Nature Catalysis","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Pt纳米颗粒催化位点","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"多相催化研究长期受限于无法在工作条件下直接观测原子尺度结构变化。该研究结合工作条件电子显微镜与定量图像分析，以原子分辨率定量追踪了单个铂纳米颗粒在CO氧化过程中的三维结构演变，揭示了Taylor型与Langmuir型活性位点的共存及其动态相互作用，为深入理解多相催化机理提供了直接观测证据。","kp":["operando电镜[Pt纳米颗粒CO氧化]: 原子分辨率追踪三维结构演化","活性位点[单个Pt纳米颗粒]: Taylor型与Langmuir型位点共存并动态相互作用"]},{"t":"维持城市绿色雨洪基础设施的持续采用","b":"Widespread adoption of green stormwater infrastructure is critical for realizing citywide stormwater resilience, but adoption remains highly uneven. The study shows how neighborhood visibility, conversion capacity and social capital interact to drive or constrain widespread uptake.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44284-026-00520-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Cities","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"通过集成多种归纳偏置模型实现符合化学家习惯的逆合成","b":"Chemist-aligned retrosynthesis by ensembling diverse inductive bias models","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11160-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/AI4S","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI逆合成模型","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出通过集成多种归纳偏置模型来实现符合化学家习惯的逆合成预测。方法核心在于融合具有不同归纳偏置的多样化模型，以提升逆合成路线预测的效果，使其更贴近化学家的实际思维方式。","kp":["逆合成预测[方法]: 集成多种归纳偏置模型实现符合化学家习惯的逆合成"]},{"t":"支持大学学术自由的六项原则","b":"Many academics are concerned about threats to independent enquiry in higher education. Here’s how it can be protected while taking legitimate concerns into account.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02932-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"因气候变化失去生活方式至关重要——我们需要一种衡量方法","b":"Climate losses extend beyond property and income. Policymakers need ways to assess what people value, experience and ultimately stand to lose.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02928-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"可食用电池为体内医疗设备供电","b":"The tiny power sources, tested in pigs, dissolve inside the digestive tract after several months.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02987-3","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可食用体内电池","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":7.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队开发了一种微型可食用电池，已在猪体内完成测试。该电池可为体内医疗设备供电，并在数月后在消化道内自行溶解，无需手术取出，为可降解的体内供电方案提供了新的可能。","kp":["可食用电池[猪体内测试]: 在消化道内数月后降解溶解"]},{"t":"科研打假者曝光后，中国惩处知名学者","b":"Several scientists investigated for research-integrity violations by video-blogger ‘Student Geng’ have now faced disciplinary measures. The penalties are part of a misconduct crackdown on 31 research teams.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02890-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"AI共同科学家正在革新研究方式","b":"Artificial-intelligence systems can generate hypotheses, design experiments and analyse data — but humans still need to decide what makes sense.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02931-5","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/AI4S","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI共同科学家","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"人工智能系统已能生成科学假设、设计实验并分析数据，正在革新研究方式。但文章强调，人类仍需判断哪些结果真正有意义，AI共同科学家无法替代人在科学价值判断中的关键作用。","kp":["AI共同科学家[能力]: 可生成假设、设计实验和分析数据，人类仍需决策合理性"]},{"t":"读博期间如何优雅地更换实验室？","b":"A scientist in training seeks help in finding a new adviser without damaging existing working relationships.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02441-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"'表观遗传'编辑技术问世：基因标记技术清除乙型肝炎病毒","b":"Technique uses chemical tags to shut down viral DNA lurking in host’s genome.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02981-9","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Nature","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"表观遗传编辑","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"一种新型表观遗传编辑技术问世，利用化学标签标记并关闭潜伏在宿主基因组中的乙型肝炎病毒DNA，从而清除病毒。该基因标记技术通过表观遗传手段抑制病毒基因，而并非直接切割DNA，为慢性乙肝治疗提供了新思路。","kp":["表观遗传编辑[乙肝病毒]: 利用化学标记沉默宿主基因组中的病毒DNA"]},{"t":"用于热管理的相变材料","b":"Phase-change materials can store a large amount of latent heat within nearly isothermal phase transitions, making them ideal for thermal management. To enable system-level integration, this Review presents a multiscale design framework for optimizing the thermal properties of phase-change materials from the molecular and material levels to the module and device levels.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00959-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/导热/耐热材料","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"相变储热材料","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"相变材料可在近等温相变过程中存储大量潜热，是理想的热管理材料。为实现系统级集成，该综述提出了一个多尺度设计框架，从分子和材料层面到模块和器件层面，对相变材料的热性能进行优化设计，为热管理系统开发提供指导。","kp":["相变材料[热管理]: 近等温相变中储存大量潜热","设计框架[相变材料]: 从分子、材料到模块、器件级别的多尺度热性能优化"]},{"t":"面向可持续发展的单一材质塑料设计的进展与技术挑战","b":"Mono-material products, which are made up of one polymer type derived from a single monomer or comonomer combination, may help to solve the sustainability problems associated with multimaterial plastic products. This Review discusses advances in engineering processes towards mono-materials and the remaining technical challenges surrounding mono-materialization.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00961-z","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源加工/有机物/大宗化工产品/塑料","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单一材质塑料","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"单一材质塑料产品由单一单体或共聚单体组合衍生的一种聚合物构成，有助于解决多材质塑料产品带来的可持续性问题。该综述讨论了面向单一材质化的工程工艺进展，以及单一材质化仍面临的技术挑战，为塑料可持续发展方向提供了系统梳理。","kp":["单一材质塑料[组成]: 由单一单体或共聚单体组合衍生的单一聚合物类型"]},{"t":"普鲁士蓝类似物中结晶水的理解与调控","b":"Prussian blue analogues suffer from lattice-water-induced capacity decay and safety concerns. This review elucidates water–electrochemistry interactions, summarizes removal and blocking strategies, and discusses scale-up challenges.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cs00430j","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/水系","a":"Chemical Society Reviews","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"普鲁士蓝结晶水","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"普鲁士蓝类似物存在由晶格水引起的容量衰减和安全隐患。该综述阐明了水与电化学之间的相互作用机制，总结了去除和阻断水分的策略，并讨论了该类材料规模化面临的挑战，为理解和调控普鲁士蓝类似物中的结晶水提供了系统性参考。","kp":["普鲁士蓝类似物[问题]: 晶格水导致容量衰减和安全隐患"]},{"t":"石墨化碳膜打破PEMFC阴极催化剂的活性-耐久性权衡","b":"Proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs) require cathode catalysts that combine high Pt utilization, efficient mass transport and long-term durability under demanding practical operation. However, recent developed Pt-based catalysts with...","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ee03962f","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/二次能源利用/燃料电池","a":"Energy & Environmental Science","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEMFC阴极催化剂","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"质子交换膜燃料电池（PEMFC）要求阴极催化剂兼具高铂利用率、高效传质和在严苛实际运行条件下的长期耐久性。然而，近期开发的铂基催化剂往往难以兼顾活性与耐久性。该研究通过石墨化碳膜打破了PEMFC阴极催化剂的活性-耐久性权衡，为高性能燃料电池催化剂设计提供新途径。","kp":["石墨化碳膜[PEMFC阴极催化剂]: 打破Pt基催化剂活性-耐久性权衡"]},{"t":"钠金属负极：基础认识、稳定化策略与前景","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matt.2026.102994","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/钠电","a":"Matter","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠金属负极","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"综述钠金属负极的基础认识、稳定化策略与未来发展前景，涉及钠离子电池负极技术方向。"},{"t":"在连续二维Mw–Ð空间中导航以实现分子量分布的确定性逆向设计","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matt.2026.103029","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子量分布逆设计","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"提出在分子量-分散度二维连续空间中导航的方法，实现聚合物分子量分布的确定性逆向设计。","kp":["设计方法[分子量-分散度二维空间]: 确定性逆向设计"]},{"t":"通过阳离子电荷锚定屏蔽表面氧以稳定富锂层状氧化物中的可逆阴离子氧化还原","b":"Abstract Lattice oxygen (O2–) redox holds immense promise for maximizing the capacity of lithium-rich layered oxides, yet harvesting this potential is bottlenecked by the chemical instability of undercoordinated surface oxygen. Under high-voltage driving, the low symmetry and dangling bonds of these surface sites elevate the O 2p band center closer to the Fermi level, triggering premature electron extraction and irreversible gas evolution. Because these electron-rich surface oxygen species act as strong Lewis bases, quenching their excessive reactivity requires a localized charge-density countermeasure. Here, we introduce highly polarizable, large-radius cesium ions (Cs+) to construct a localized charge-shielding layer via specific cationic anchorage. Driven by ion–ion interactions, the highly diffuse electron clouds of Cs+ undergo charge polarization atop the dangling-bond oxygen sites, securely locking the surface electron density within the Mn–O framework. This polarization shield not only electrostatically arrests electron extraction from the lattice but also blocks solvent aggregation at the interface.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c02183","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/锂电","a":"ACS Energy Letters","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂正极氧氧化还原","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"富锂层状氧化物中的晶格氧氧化还原反应有望最大化电池容量，但受限于欠配位表面氧的化学不稳定性。在高电压驱动下，低对称性和悬挂键使表面氧O 2p带中心上移靠近费米能级，引发过早电子提取和不可逆产气。由于这些富电子表面氧是强路易斯碱，研究引入高极化率的大半径铯离子（Cs+），通过特定阳离子锚定构建局部电荷屏蔽层，淬灭其过度反应性，实现可逆阴离子氧化还原的稳定。","kp":["稳定化策略[富锂层状氧化物]: 阳离子电荷锚定屏蔽表面氧以稳定可逆阴离子氧化还原","失效机制[高压下欠配位表面氧]: O 2p带中心靠近费米能级，引发过早电子提取和不可逆产气"]},{"t":"通过晶体场工程激活NASICON型混合磷酸盐正极中的反常Jahn–Teller效应","b":"Abstract High-voltage Mn3+/Mn2+ redox reactions in polyanionic cathodes offer the potential to increase energy density while reducing the cost of batteries. However, its practical application is hindered by sluggish reaction kinetics and asymmetric Jahn–Teller distortion. Herein, we report a NASICON-type cathode, Na3.85□0.15Mn1.35Fe1.5V0.15(PO4)2(P2O7) (□ denotes Na vacancy, NFMPP-V), in which vanadium substitution reconfigures the Mn3+-induced Jahn–Teller distortion and couples it with multivalent redox processes, achieving enhanced energy density and reaction kinetics. Remarkably, the Na+ mobility increases with the Jahn–Teller distortion, exhibiting an anomalous behavior opposite to that of conventional Mn-based cathodes, which is associated with an ordered anisotropic distortion of the [MnO6] octahedra. As a result, NFMPP-V delivers a high reversible capacity of 120.2 mAh g–1 and achieves a capacity retention of 82.3% for 500 cycles at 5C. This work demonstrates that Jahn–Teller distortion can be rationally re-engineered into a kinetic advantage and provides new insights into the design of high-energy-density NASICON-type cathodes for batteries.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c12732","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/钠电","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"NASICON钠电正极","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"聚阴离子正极中的高压Mn3+/Mn2+氧化还原反应有潜力提升电池能量密度并降低成本，但受制于缓慢的反应动力学和不对称Jahn-Teller畸变。研究报道了一种NASICON型正极Na3.85□0.15Mn1.35Fe1.5V0.15(PO4)2(P2O7)（NFMPP-V），通过钒取代重构Mn3+诱导的Jahn-Teller畸变，并将其与多价氧化还原过程耦合，实现了更高的能量密度和更快的反应动力学。值得注意的是，Na+迁移率随Jahn-Teller畸变增强而提高，与传统锰基正极相反，这源于有序的各向异性畸变。","kp":["正极材料[NASICON型混合磷酸盐]: Na3.85□0.15Mn1.35Fe1.5V0.15(PO4)2(P2O7)","改性策略[Jahn-Teller畸变]: 钒取代重构Mn3+诱导的Jahn-Teller畸变","氧化还原机制[高压]: Mn3+/Mn2+提升能量密度并降低成本"]},{"t":"负曲率纳米环：碳环面体与Schwarzite的切片","b":"Abstract Nanographenes with negative curvature are often considered as cutouts of proposed new carbon allotropes such as toroids and schwarzites. While the synthesis of cutouts of such structures to date has been limited to smaller areas, here we present the synthesis of negatively curved nanohoops with 152, 228, and 304 toroid or schwarzite resembling carbons. Structural elucidation of two nanohoops by single-crystal X-ray diffraction analysis as well as supramolecular interactions with fullerenes in solution and their structural comparison to the corresponding macrostructures is presented.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c13192","c":"通用技术/材料工程/纳米工程","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"负曲率纳米环合成","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"as":"负曲率纳米石墨烯常被视为环面体和schwarzite等新碳同素异形体的切片。该研究合成了包含152、228和304个碳原子、形似环面体或schwarzite的负曲率纳米环，并利用单晶X射线衍射解析了其中两个纳米环的结构，研究了它们与富勒烯在溶液中的超分子相互作用，并与相应宏观结构进行了比较。","kp":["负曲率纳米环合成规模: 152、228、304个环状/schwarzite类碳原子","结构表征[两种纳米环]: 单晶X射线衍射解析"]},{"t":"手性晶格畸变使无铅金属卤化物实现明亮近红外圆偏振发光","b":"Abstract Near-infrared circularly polarized luminescence (NIR CPL) materials are of growing interest for emerging photonic technologies, yet the simultaneous realization of high emission efficiency and strong chiroptical activity remains challenging. Here, we report a lattice-distortion strategy to integrate excitonic and chiroptical functionalities in lead-free zero-dimensional hybrid metal halides. Single-crystal analysis combined with theoretical calculations reveals pronounced chiral lattice distortion, characterized by large continuous chirality measure (CCM) values, substantial off-centering, and bond-length distortion of the isolated metal halide octahedra. Such distorted lattices strengthen electron–phonon coupling and promote substantial excited-state structural reorganization, facilitating efficient self-trapped exciton formation and leading to bright NIR emission centered at 728 nm with a photoluminescence quantum yield of up to 84.9%. Meanwhile, the chiral lattice environment gives rise to pronounced chiroptical activity, affording a large luminescence dissymmetry factor (|glum|) of 2.21 × 10–2. The dynamic lattice further enables an NIR to orange phase transformation accompanied by emission-color switching and CPL inversion, while the chirality of the orange phase can be generated through spontaneous symmetry breaking or biased by external chiral induction depending on the crystallization pathway. Circularly polarized NIR light-emitting devices are further demonstrated with preserved chiroptical output. More broadly, this work highlights chiral lattice distortion as a promising structural strategy for developing efficient CPL-active lead-free metal halides across the NIR spectral region.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c11064","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅卤化物圆偏振发光","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"as":"近红外圆偏振发光（NIR CPL）材料在新兴光子技术中备受关注，但同时实现高发光效率和强手性光学活性仍具挑战。研究报道了一种晶格畸变策略，在无铅零维杂化金属卤化物中整合激子与手性光学功能。单晶分析与理论计算揭示了显著的手性晶格畸变，表现为大的连续手性度量（CCM）值、明显的偏心位移和孤立金属卤化物八面体的键长畸变。这种畸变晶格增强了电子-声子耦合，促进激发态结构重组，从而实现明亮的近红外圆偏振发光。","kp":["发光性能[无铅零维金属卤化物]: 亮近红外圆偏振发光","实现策略: 手性晶格畸变整合激子与手性光学功能"]},{"t":"熔盐中合成的蓝光胶体In1–xGaxP量子点：迈向稳定性更优的蓝光QLED","b":"Abstract Colloidal quantum dots (QDs) are being actively explored for QD light-emitting diode (QD-LED) displays with high color purity and wide color gamut, high brightness, and low-cost, solution-based manufacturing. Heavy metal-free InP QDs have enabled red- and green-emitting QD LEDs with excellent device characteristics. However, the performance of blue QD-LEDs, required for completing the red, green, and blue (RGB) full color gamut, is lagging behind, which prompts searches for novel blue-emitting QDs. Here, we report the synthesis, computational modeling, and structural and spectroscopic studies of heavy metal-free blue-emitting core-shell QDs featuring 2.1 nm In1–xGaxP cores, colloidally synthesized in a molten inorganic salt, epitaxially coated with ZnS shells, and optimized surface treatments. The computational study suggests that the introduction of a ZnS shell induces mixing between core and shell electronic states, enhancing the direct-gap character of In1–xGaxP/ZnS QDs. The resulting In1–xGaxP/ZnS QDs show blue band-edge photo- and electroluminescence that can be fine-tuned around the technologically important region of 470 nm. This material holds strong promise for filling the blue gap in full-gamut QD-LED displays.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c12687","c":"通用技术/材料工程/纳米工程","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蓝光InGaN P量子点","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究人员在熔融无机盐中合成出无重金属的蓝光核壳胶体量子点，核心为2.1 nm的In1–xGaxP，外延包覆ZnS壳层并进行表面优化。通过计算模拟、结构和光谱研究对该材料进行了系统表征。该工作旨在解决蓝光QD-LED性能落后于红光和绿光器件的问题，为实现RGB全彩显示提供新型蓝光量子点材料，有望用于高色纯度、宽色域、高亮度和低成本溶液法制备的QLED显示。","kp":["量子点合成方法: 熔盐中合成胶体In1–xGaxP量子点","应用目标: 稳定性更优的蓝光QLED"]},{"t":"三元离子电池","b":"Abstract The advancement of rechargeable batteries has long been dominated by two principal paradigms: single-ion and dual-ion mechanisms. The single-ion mechanism, operating via the shuttling of monovalent cations, offers high energy density yet suffers from inherent kinetic limitations in multivalent systems. In contrast, the dual-ion mechanism enhances kinetics at the expense of energy density, as it continuously consumes electrolyte components. To overcome this fundamental trade-off, we herein propose a ternary-ion mechanism that orchestrates the cooperative reactions of three distinct ionic species through mutually matched redox reactions and coordinated multivalent-metal ion exchange at the cathode and anode. As a proof-of-concept, we construct an Al/eGr-PTO battery in which, under the same operating voltages, the cathode concurrently accommodates the intercalation of two monovalent AlCl2+ species into pyrene-4,5,9,10-tetraone (PTO) and the compensating deintercalation of one monovalent AlCl4– from expanded graphite (eGr). This ensures that the eGr-PTO composite cathode as a whole intercalates only one aluminum for each complete redox cycle, with the chlorine content within the cathode remaining unchanged, while the anode undergoes the reversible aluminum stripping of an equivalent amount. Throughout cycling, the composition of the ionic liquid electrolyte remains macroscopically invariant. Accordingly, the prototype of Al/eGr-PTO pouch cells with a high capacity of ∼18 mAh and minimal electrolyte uptake achieve fast kinetics, stable long-term cycling, and a high cell-level specific energy of 84 Wh kg–1, outperforming previously reported OEM- and Gr-based dual-ion Al batteries. Our proposed ternary-ion batteries transcend the constraints of conventional single-ion and dual-ion systems, establishing a transformative framework for next-generation electrochemical energy storage.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c05741","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三元离子电池机制","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"传统可充电电池依赖单离子或双离子机制：前者能量密度高但多价体系动力学受限，后者动力学好但持续消耗电解质而牺牲能量密度。本研究提出三元离子机制，通过三种离子物种的氧化还原反应相互匹配，并在正负极进行协调的多价金属离子交换，实现协同反应，克服能量密度与动力学之间的根本权衡。作为概念验证，作者构建了Al/eGr-PTO电池体系验证该机制的可行性。","kp":["电池机制: 三元离子机制，突破单离子(高能量密度/动力学受限)与双离子(动力学快/耗电解质)权衡"]},{"t":"液态金属诱导的金属-载体相互作用用于CO2加氢","b":"Abstract Metal–support interaction (MSI) is central to numerous industrial heterogeneous catalytic processes yet its classical realization typically requires high-temperature treatment (typically >500 °C), which often induces metal sintering and excessive encapsulation. Herein, we demonstrate that metals in liquid state can enable MSI on reducible transition-metal oxides at room temperature and down to −41 °C. In an In/NiO model system, room-temperature contact with metallic In extracts lattice oxygen from NiO, generating oxygen-deficient interfacial Ni sites that enhance CO2 activation and further fundamentally alter the reaction pathway of CO2 hydrogenation. Instead of methane formation typically observed on Ni-based oxides, the liquid–metal-derived interface selectively promotes CO formation with over 99% selectivity and a 5-fold higher CO yield at 350 °C. Comparable behavior is observed across a range of liquid-metal/oxide combinations (In/[Fe2O3, Co3O4, CuO, ZnO], [Sn, Bi]/NiO), indicating that the effect is chemically transferable. The catalytic activity exceeds that of benchmark commercial catalysts and reported noble-metal-based catalysts. This liquid–metal-induced low-temperature MSI reveals a new regime of oxide–metal interfacial chemistry.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c15497","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态金属CO2加氢催化","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"经典金属-载体相互作用（MSI）通常需要高于500°C的高温处理，易导致金属烧结和过度包埋。本研究发现液态金属可在室温甚至低至-41°C下与可还原过渡金属氧化物实现MSI。在In/NiO模型体系中，室温接触下金属铟夺取NiO晶格氧，产生缺氧界面镍位点，增强CO2活化并从根本上改变CO2加氢反应路径——不同于镍基氧化物通常生成甲烷，液态金属衍生界面选择性促进CO生成。","kp":["金属-载体相互作用温度[液态金属]: 室温至-41 °C","模型体系: In/NiO","传统MSI实现温度: >500 °C"]},{"t":"配体壳层实现金纳米簇上的银催化：由炔烃直接合成β-萘酚醚","b":"Abstract The use of gold chlorides alongside cationic silver is widely regarded as a standard approach for generating cationic gold in π-acid-mediated organic reactions; however, in many cases, presynthesized cationic gold alone is insufficient to catalyze such transformations. Herein, we present a rare example of employing chloride-containing gold nanoclusters to form Au–Cl–Ag reactive intermediates within protective ligand shells, enabling the isomerization/cyclization of alkynes to directly construct naphthalene rings. Notably, this tandem reaction occurs at the silver active site and is initiated by an unusual alkyne-to-allene isomerization. Beyond providing an efficient synthetic route to multisubstituted β-naphthol derivatives, these findings shed new light on the fundamental mechanisms underlying homogeneous gold/silver dual catalysis and open fresh avenues for designing catalytic applications with metal nanoclusters.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c16373","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金纳米簇银催化","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"as":"氯化金与阳离子银联用是π酸介导有机反应中产生阳离子金的常用策略，但预合成的阳离子金往往不足以催化此类转化。本研究报道了含氯金纳米簇在保护配体壳层内形成Au–Cl–Ag反应活性中间体的罕见案例，实现炔烃的异构化/环化直接构建萘环。该串联反应发生在银活性位点上，并由罕见的炔烃向丙二烯异构化引发，为多取代β-萘酚衍生物提供了高效合成路线，也深化了对相关催化机理的认识。","kp":["催化策略[金纳米簇]: 含氯金纳米簇在配体壳层内形成Au–Cl–Ag活性中间体","应用[炔烃]: 直接合成β-萘酚醚"]},{"t":"通过长程离子位移在中心对称晶体中实现多方向巨大极化","b":"Abstract Ferroelectrics exhibit spontaneous polarization and are highly functional materials that are widely used in various devices. However, the design of conventional ferroelectric compounds is largely limited to noncentrosymmetric, polar structures. Herein, we demonstrate that colossal polarization occurs by long-range ion displacement even in the nonpolar proton conductor Na2MnN(CN)4·3.25H2O (1·H2O). This compound crystallized in the nonpolar I2/a space group but exhibited extremely large polarization owing to conducting protons, as confirmed by ferroelectric hysteresis and thermally stimulated depolarization current measurements. A remanent polarization of 438 mC cm–2 was achieved along the [010] direction of single crystals at 298 K under 80% relative humidity at 0.01 Hz. The polarization values are associated with proton conduction, largely depending on the frequency, temperature, and humidity. Single-crystal characterization revealed that polarization emerges in multiple directions and that the polarization magnitude and frequency-response vary depending on the crystallographic axis. These results indicate that the polarization phenomena, driven by long-range ion displacements, are strongly governed by the anisotropic one-dimensional framework of 1·H2O. Moreover, the functionality of this system is underpinned by hydrogen bonds between the inorganic skeleton and water, as confirmed by experiments employing H2O and D2O. This study demonstrates that ionic conductors can exhibit polar functionalities without breaking the inversion symmetry.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c12413","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中心对称晶体巨极化","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"传统铁电化合物设计通常局限于非中心对称的极性结构。本研究发现，即使在非极性质子导体Na2MnN(CN)4·3.25H2O中，长程离子位移也能产生巨大极化。该化合物结晶于非极性I2/a空间群，但铁电滞回和热刺激去极化电流测量证实其因传导质子而表现出极大极化。在298 K、80%相对湿度、0.01 Hz条件下，单晶沿[010]方向实现了438 mC cm–2的剩余极化，拓展了铁电材料设计的结构边界。","kp":["晶体结构[Na2MnN(CN)4·3.25H2O]: 非极性I2/a空间群","极化机制[非极性质子导体]: 长程离子位移产生巨大极化"]},{"t":"PAmCherry1荧光蛋白发色团成熟过程中氢过氧中间体的直接可视化","b":"Abstract Despite the widespread use of fluorescent proteins in bioimaging, the mechanism of oxidative chromophore maturation to form the tyrosine Cα═Cβ double bond remains unclear. In the photoactivatable fluorescent protein PAmCherry1, this double bond has not yet been formed prior to photoactivation. Here, serial femtosecond crystallography (SFX) using an X-ray-free electron laser (XFEL) enabled us to capture the radiation damage-free structure of non-photoactivated PAmCherry1. This structure displayed a covalently bound hydroperoxy moiety (73% occupancy) at the sp3-hybridized Cα atom of the chromophore tyrosine residue within the imidazolinone ring. A unique hydrogen-bonding network surrounding the hydroperoxy moiety stabilizes this highly reactive chromophore species. Electrospray ionization mass spectrometry (ESI-MS) supported the coexistence of hydroperoxy and enolate chromophore forms. According to spectroscopic analysis, these species exist in dynamic equilibrium. MS analysis further demonstrated that photoactivation is accompanied by the formation of the mature chromophore containing a Cα═Cβ double bond together with Kolbe decarboxylation. Time-resolved SFX (TR-SFX) using a femtosecond pump laser further revealed decreasing electron density at 800 ps after photoexcitation, consistent with rapid oxidation and decarboxylation. Collectively, these results support a hydroperoxy intermediate as a key species in oxidative chromophore maturation, which is stabilized in non-photoactivated PAmCherry1.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c13605","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光蛋白发色团成熟","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"荧光蛋白氧化型发色团成熟形成酪氨酸Cα═Cβ双键的机理尚不清楚。在光激活荧光蛋白PAmCherry1中，光激活前该双键尚未形成。研究利用X射线自由电子激光的串飞秒晶体学（SFX）捕获了未光激活PAmCherry1的无辐射损伤结构，显示咪唑啉酮环内发色团酪氨酸残基的sp3杂化Cα原子上共价结合一个氢过氧基团（占据率73%），周围独特的氢键网络稳定了这一高活性中间体，为揭示发色团成熟机理提供了直接结构证据。","kp":["成像技术[PAmCherry1结构解析]: 无X射线自由电子激光的串飞秒晶体学(SFX)","结构特征[光激活前PAmCherry1]: 酪氨酸Cα═Cβ双键尚未形成，捕获无辐射损伤结构"]},{"t":"螺旋同步诱导的动力学稳定化对抗钉合肽中的螺旋翻转：310/α嵌段序列与双钉合拓扑的影响","b":"Abstract Communication between neighboring helical domains is central to biological function, yet dynamic interactions between distinct peptide helices remain poorly understood. Herein, we report a series of nonoverlapping doubly stapled block-type peptides composed entirely of achiral components and containing α-α, 310-310, α-310, and 310-α helical architectures. Despite their distinct geometries and hydrogen-bonding patterns, neighboring helical segments were found to communicate efficiently, resulting in exclusive formation of homochiral (P,P)- and (M,M)-helices. Reversing the order of the α- and 310-helical blocks produced a 5.5-fold difference in helix inversion rate, demonstrating that block sequence controls P/M interconversion kinetics. The nonoverlapping α-α architecture underwent P/M interconversion approximately 1600 times faster than the previously reported overlapping doubly stapled analogue, in which the staples partially overlap within a single helical domain, underscoring the importance of double-stapling topology. Nevertheless, tandem linkage of two dynamic helical domains also markedly enhanced kinetic stability; notably, the half-life of the α-α architecture was approximately 800 times longer than that of the corresponding singly stapled analogue. In addition, selected doubly stapled architectures exhibited pronounced self-induced diastereomeric anisochronicity (SIDAC), enabling direct real-time monitoring of molecular helicity and helix inversion by 1H NMR spectroscopy without external additives. These results demonstrate how communication between distinct peptide helices gives rise to emergent dynamic behavior and provide a general strategy for programming helical dynamics in abiotic peptide systems.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c14108","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钉合肽螺旋稳定化","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"本研究报道了一系列完全由非手性组分构成的非重叠双钉合嵌段型肽，包含α-α、310-310、α-310和310-α螺旋结构。尽管几何构型和氢键模式各异，相邻螺旋片段能高效通信，导致 exclusively 形成同手性(P,P)-和(M,M)-螺旋。颠倒α与310螺旋嵌段顺序使螺旋翻转速率产生5.5倍差异，表明嵌段序列控制P/M互变动力学，其中非重叠α-α结构表现出动力学稳定化效应，深化了对肽螺旋间动态相互作用的理解。","kp":["肽设计[双钉合嵌段肽]: 全部由非手性组分构成，含α-α、310-310、α-310、310-α螺旋架构","关键结论[相邻螺旋段]: 尽管几何与氢键模式不同仍能高效通讯，实现动力学稳定化对抗螺旋翻转"]},{"t":"利用N-芳基胺引发剂实现芳炔与醛的交替共聚","b":"Abstract Here, we report the direct alternating copolymerization of arynes and aldehydes initiated by a simple N-arylamine. The N-arylamine framework is critical for suppressing competing aryne homopolymerization and promotes selective alternating polymerization through a Smiles-type rearrangement pathway. Regeneration of a neutral N-arylamine chain end during each propagation cycle enables complex polymer architectures, including block copolymers and cyclic polymers, through ring-expansion alternating copolymerization. The resulting polymers contain embedded ether linkages that impart an acid-triggered degradability.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c13641","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"芳炔醛交替共聚","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"本研究报道了以简单N-芳基胺引发剂实现芳炔与醛的直接交替共聚。N-芳基胺框架对抑制芳炔均聚竞争反应至关重要，并通过Smiles型重排路径促进选择性交替聚合。每个增长循环中中性N-芳基胺链端的再生，使通过扩环交替共聚制备嵌段共聚物和环状聚合物等复杂拓扑成为可能。所得聚合物中嵌入的醚键赋予其酸触发的可降解性。","kp":["聚合方式[芳炔与醛]: N-芳基胺引发的直接交替共聚","催化机制[N-芳基胺框架]: 通过Smiles型重排途径抑制芳炔均聚，促进选择性交替聚合","链端特征[每个增长循环]: 中性N-芳基胺链端再生，可通过扩环交替聚合构建嵌段和环状聚合物"]},{"t":"利用数据科学工具探索镍催化烷基与芳基卤化物(Cl、Br)在三齿单阴离子配体下的交叉亲电偶联中的速率匹配","b":"Abstract Nickel-catalyzed cross-electrophile coupling (XEC) between aryl and alkyl electrophiles has emerged as an enabling synthetic method, yet predicting the outcomes of specific electrophile pairs is difficult due to the complexity of the mechanistic pathways. It has been proposed that “rate matching” between the oxidative addition of the aryl halide and the rate of formation of the alkyl radical, in addition to the stability of the Ni(II)–Ar complex, dictates the yield of the cross-coupling product. To probe this quantitatively, we developed a new tridentate monoanionic ligand that activatesalkyl and aryl chlorides and exhibits well-behaved electrochemistry, allowing the measurement of relative rate constants. This provides a framework to interrogate the rate-matching concept using both aryl and alkyl bromides and chlorides in cross-electrophile coupling. By combining an electroanalytical workflow with machine learning, the prediction of activation rate constants for all aryl/alkyl chlorides and bromides was achieved and correlated with reaction yields. We found that productive coupling occurs in a specific rate regime, and the synthetic performance could be predictably modulated by choosing the “matched” halide (either chloride or bromide) for each coupling partner.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c10810","c":"通用技术/工艺和工程","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化交叉偶联","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"镍催化芳基与烷基亲电体的交叉亲电偶联（XEC）是重要的合成方法，但机理路径复杂，难以预测特定亲电体组合的结果。已有假说认为芳基卤化物氧化加成速率与烷基自由基生成速率的\"速率匹配\"以及Ni(II)–Ar配合物的稳定性决定偶联产率。为定量探究，研究者开发了一种新型三齿单阴离子配体，可活化烷基和芳基氯化物并具有良好电化学行为，从而可测量相对速率常数，为用数据科学工具检验速率匹配概念提供了框架。","kp":["关键结论[镍催化交叉亲电偶联]: 芳基卤化物氧化加成速率与烷基自由基生成速率的匹配及Ni(II)–Ar配合物稳定性决定偶联产率"]},{"t":"负载于Ta掺杂TiO2上的Pt纳米颗粒用于耐久性质子交换膜电解水","b":"Abstract Platinum (Pt) is more earth-abundant and corrosion-resistant than iridium (Ir), yet its deployment as an acidic oxygen anode has been abandoned due to the formation of a self-passivating, insulating PtO2 film. Here, we show that this century-old bottleneck can be alleviated by an electron-shuttling junction in which Pt nanoparticles are anchored to a tantalum (Ta)-doped titanium dioxide support, with Fermi level higher than Pt. The built-in contact potential injects electrons into Pt via Pt–O–Ta/Ti bridges and continuously bleeds the bypass oxygen evolution electrons to Pt at high bias, thereby suppressing the formation of a passivating α–PtO2 layer. In situ spectroscopies reveal the successful preservation of Pt 5d occupancy, along with strengthened surficial water adsorption (alleviated reversed Stark effect of νOH). The assembled electrolyzer, with a Pt loading of only 350 μgPt cm–2, achieves 3 A cm–2 at 2.262 V and operates for 1500 h under 1 A cm–2 without noticeable passivation. Life cycle cost analysis estimates a green hydrogen price of US$1.56 kg–1, below both the US DOE 2026 target and the costs of contemporary alkaline electrolyzers. This concept relocates the stability problem from the noble metal to a tunable oxide, providing a general blueprint for passivation-free, platinum-based acid water-splitting catalysts.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c13577","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/二次能源利用/燃料电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解水阳极催化","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"铂比铱更丰富且耐腐蚀，但因自钝化绝缘PtO2膜的形成而未被用作酸性氧阳极。本研究通过将Pt纳米颗粒锚定在费米能级高于Pt的钽掺杂二氧化钛载体上，构建电子穿梭结缓解这一瓶颈。内置接触电势经Pt–O–Ta/Ti桥向Pt注入电子，并在高偏压下持续将析氧旁路电子引入Pt，抑制钝化α-PtO2层的形成。原位光谱证实Pt 5d占据得以保持，表面水吸附增强，实现耐酸性PEM电解水阳极。","kp":["阳极催化剂[酸性OER]: Pt纳米颗粒负载于Ta掺杂TiO2载体","设计机制[Pt/Ta-TiO2结]: 费米能级高于Pt的载体通过内置接触电势向Pt注入电子，缓解PtO2绝缘自钝化"]},{"t":"相界面工程实现多能谷激活以提升ZrCoSb Half-Heusler热电材料性能","b":"Abstract P-type ZrCoSb-based half-Heusler compounds are promising thermoelectric materials for high-temperature power generation because of their excellent thermal stability and mechanical robustness. However, their performance still lags behind that of state-of-the-art p-type ZrCoBi systems, mainly due to the limited doping efficiency of conventional aliovalent doping strategies, which hinders the realization of highly degenerate carrier transport and consequently restricts power factor optimization. This study highlights the pivotal role of phase diagram engineering in maximizing the thermoelectric performance of ZrCoSb-based half-Heusler materials. Through precisely tuning the Co content guided by experimental phase diagrams, simultaneous enhancement of electronic transport properties and suppression of lattice thermal conductivity have been realized. Under Co-deficient conditions, the Sn doping efficiency approaches 100%, increasing the hole concentration to 3.8 × 1021 cm–3 and activating the secondary Γ valence-band valley in addition to the primary L valleys. The resulting multivalley transport increases the effective valley degeneracy from 8 to 10 and yields a peak power factor of 40.4 μW cm–1 K–2 and an average power factor of 37.6 μW cm–1 K–2 over 300–973 K, representing the high reported value to date among p-type ZrCoSb-based half-Heuslers. The synergistic effect of Co vacancy engineering and Hf alloying suppresses thermal transport, culminating in a peak zT of 1.2 at 973 K. Finally, a single-stage thermoelectric module was fabricated using the optimized material, demonstrating a conversion efficiency of ∼11% at a temperature difference of 673 K, overperforming all previously reported ZrCoSb-based single-stage thermoelectric devices. This work establishes phase diagram engineering as a powerful and universal strategy for developing high-performance thermoelectric materials and devices.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c12433","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/导热/耐热材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Half-Heusler热电材料","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"p型ZrCoSb基half-Heusler化合物因优异热稳定性和机械强度，是高温发电的候选热电材料，但传统变价掺杂效率有限，难以实现高简并载流子输运，功率因子受限，性能落后于p型ZrCoBi体系。本研究强调相图工程对提升其热电性能的关键作用，在实验相图指导下精确调控Co含量，同时增强了电子输运性能，为ZrCoSb基材料性能优化提供了组分设计策略。","kp":["材料体系[p型高温热电]: ZrCoSb基Half-Heusler化合物","性能瓶颈[传统异价掺杂]: 掺杂效率受限，阻碍高简并载流子输运与功率因子优化","改进策略[相界面工程]: 实现多能谷激活以提升热电性能"]},{"t":"通过动态Ni–Ga协同实现催化C(sp2)–F键的镓化反应","b":"Abstract Bimetallic cooperative catalysis has overcome many of the established mechanistic limitations of monometallic reactivity in activating and transforming strong element–element bonds. However, the common need for supporting ligands enforces bimetallic catalyst speciation, potentially impeding reactivity. Here, we report an unsupported Ni–Ga heterometallic system for the conversion of C(sp2)–F into C(sp2)–Ga bonds, capable of dynamically switching between bimetallic and trimetallic catalytic regimes to achieve key steps along the catalytic cycle. Spectroscopic, kinetic, and computational studies together with the targeted isolation of key intermediates identify a bimetallic Ni–Ga bis(olefin) complex as the catalytic resting state and reveal a turnover-limiting transition state for C(sp2)–F activation. This cooperative approach unlocks reactions of electron-rich fluoroarene substrates previously inaccessible to C(sp2)–F bond gallylation in the absence of dynamic heterometallic catalysis.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c16732","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Ni-Ga双金属催化","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"双金属协同催化可突破单金属反应性的机理限制，但通常需要支撑配体，限制了催化剂形态与反应性。本研究报道了无配体支撑的Ni–Ga异金属体系，可将C(sp2)–F键转化为C(sp2)–Ga键，并能在双金属与三金属催化模式间动态切换以完成催化循环关键步骤。光谱、动力学、计算研究及关键中间体的定向分离表明，双金属Ni–Ga双烯烃配合物为催化静息态，并揭示了C–F活化相关的 turnover 限制过渡态。","kp":["催化体系[C(sp2)–F键镓化]: 无配体支撑的Ni–Ga异金属体系","机制特征[Ni–Ga体系]: 可在双金属与三金属催化物种间动态切换"]},{"t":"通过螺旋芳香低聚物的分子长度调控自旋过滤","b":"Abstract Chiral 8-amino-2-carboxylic acid quinoline-based aromatic oligoamide foldamers with lengths up to circa 5 nm were synthesized to investigate their spin filtering properties. A thiolated quinoline monomer was designed and incorporated at one extremity of the chiral helices to enable their immobilization on gold substrates. Scratching atomic force microscopy (AFM) and polarization modulation infrared reflection absorption spectroscopy (PM-IRRAS) measurements confirmed the formation of the organic monolayers, with thicknesses ranging from approximately 1.1 to 5.4 nm depending on oligomer length. Spin filtering behavior was evaluated using magnetic conductive AFM, revealing that the spin-selective signal increases with helix length, achieving values up to ∼85%. Notably, increasing the oligomer length did not result in a decrease in conductivity along the helix axis. Magnetoresistance measurements performed using a dedicated device showed a temperature-dependent response, with the magnetoresistance signal increasing as the temperature rises.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13457","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋过滤寡聚物","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究者合成了一系列基于手性8-氨基喹啉-2-羧酸的芳香低聚酰胺折叠体，长度最高约5 nm，并在螺旋一端引入巯基化喹啉单体以便固定于金基底。划痕原子力显微镜和偏振调制红外反射吸收光谱证实单层膜形成，厚度约1.1至5.4 nm，取决于低聚物长度。磁性导电原子力显微镜评估显示自旋选择信号随螺旋长度增加而增大，最高达约85%，表明可通过分子长度调控螺旋芳族低聚物的自旋过滤性能。","kp":["分子长度[手性螺旋芳酰胺低聚物]: 最长约5 nm","结构特征[螺旋体一端]: 引入硫醇化喹啉单体以固定于金基底","表征方法[自旋过滤性能]: 划痕AFM与PM-IRRAS确认组装"]},{"t":"通过强/弱共溶剂平衡溶剂化结构与界面化学改善锂金属电池的循环性能","b":"Abstract The cycling performance of lithium (Li)-metal batteries (LMBs) is improved by incorporating co-solvents that strongly and weakly coordinate with Li ions in localized high-concentration electrolytes. The synergistic interactions of these solvents facilitate the inclusion of contact ion pairs within the primary solvation sheath and promote the development of fluorine-rich interphase layers on both the Li-metal anode and the LiNi0.8Mn0.1Co0.1O2 (NMC811) cathode surfaces. The optimized electrolyte comprises Li bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide dissolved in a co-solvent mixture consisting of the strongly coordinating solvent 1,2-dimethoxyethane (DME) and the weakly coordinating solvent 1,2-bis(2,2,2-trifluoroethoxy)ethane (F6DEE), along with the diluent 1,1,2,2-tetrafluoroethyl-2,2,3,3-tetrafluoropropyl ether at a molar ratio of 1.0:(1.0:0.2):3.0. The Li||NMC811 cells with this electrolyte can retain 80% of the initial capacity after 375 cycles at elevated charge/discharge rates of 0.2C/0.5C and 260 cycles at 0.33C/1C. Combined molecular dynamics simulations, nuclear magnetic resonance measurements, microscopy, and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy indicate that partial replacement of DME with F6DEE increases anion participation in the local Li+ coordination environment and promotes more inorganic-rich interphases on both electrodes. As a result, interphase chemistry and cycling stability in LMBs can be largely improved. Similar approaches can also be used to improve the performance of other alkali-metal batteries.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c08663","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/锂电","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池电解液","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"本研究在局域高浓度电解质中引入与锂离子强、弱配位的共溶剂以改善锂金属电池循环性能。两类溶剂的协同相互作用促进接触离子对进入初级溶剂化壳层，并在锂金属负极和NMC811正极表面形成富氟界面层。优化电解质由双氟磺酰亚胺锂溶于强配位溶剂DME、弱配位溶剂F6DEE及稀释剂四氟乙基四氟丙基醚组成，通过调控溶剂化结构与界面化学提升电池循环稳定性。","kp":["电解液体系[锂金属电池]: 含强/弱配位共溶剂的局域高浓度电解液","正极材料: LiNi0.8Mn0.1Co0.1O2 (NMC811)","界面特征[Li负极与NMC811正极]: 溶剂化鞘中接触离子对促进富氟界面层形成"]},{"t":"锰基无序岩盐的组分工程用于理解电极退化行为","b":"Abstract Cation-disordered rocksalt (DRX) cathodes have emerged as promising candidates owing to their high theoretical capacity and use of earth-abundant transition metals (TMs), such as Mn, Ti, and Fe. Li+ transport occurs through a three-dimensional percolation network of 0-TM diffusion pathways. However, the practical application of Mn-based DRX cathodes is often hindered by structural instability and irreversible oxygen redox during cycling. In this study, we investigate the role of the stoichiometric Li/TM ratio on the electrochemical performance and degradation behavior of Li0.9+xMn1.1–2xTixO2 (x = 0.2, 0.3, 0.4) cathodes. The stoichiometric balance among Li, Mn, and Ti determines the dominant redox reactions and the subsequent structural evolution. The Mn-rich and Li-deficient Li1.1Mn0.7Ti0.2O2 delivers an activation-induced discharge capacity of 250.1 mAh g–1 at 10 mA g–1 with superior cycling stability, which is attributed to a facilitated bulk spinel-like phase transformation. In contrast, the Li-excess and Mn-deficient Li1.3Mn0.3Ti0.4O2 exhibit pronounced capacity fading due to severe irreversible oxygen redox. To elucidate the origin of these differences, a multi-scale analysis was conducted to resolve structural evolution across different probing depths. Ex situ XRD, Raman, and XPS analyses reveal that Mn-rich and Li-deficient cathodes maintain structural integrity through stable bulk transformation. In contrast, excessive Li content promotes detrimental surface reconstruction characterized by thick cathode–electrolyte interface (CEI) formation. These results indicate that the specific composition of Li and TM is a primary factor affecting cyclic stability and surface degradations induced by the CEI.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c16379","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基DRX正极","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"阳离子无序岩盐（DRX）正极因高理论容量和丰富过渡金属（Mn、Ti、Fe）储量而备受关注，Li+经三维0-TM扩散通道网络传输，但锰基DRX正极常受结构不稳定和不可逆氧氧化困扰。本研究系统考察Li/TM化学计量比对Li0.9+xMn1.1–2xTixO2（x=0.2、0.3、0.4）正极电化学性能与退化行为的影响，发现Li、Mn、Ti间的化学计量平衡决定了主导氧化还原反应及后续结构演化。","kp":["正极类型: 锰基阳离子无序岩盐(DRX)","扩散机制: 三维0-TM渗流网络","挑战[循环过程]: 结构不稳定与不可逆氧氧化还原"]},{"t":"面向高效柔性钙钛矿室内光伏的阳极缓冲层选择","b":"Abstract Flexible carbon-electrode perovskite solar cells (PSCs) could be one of the applicable photovoltaic technologies for weak-light application that is featured with low cost, fast renewability, and facile device integration. The performance of this photovoltaic lags behind that of PSCs with metal electrodes, which is primarily ascribed to the lack of an efficient buffer layer/carbon combination. Here, in this work, we systematically researched two typical anode structures, including polythiophene/nickel oxide (P3HT/NiOx) and 2,2′,7,7′-tetrakis-(N,N-di-4-methoxyphenylamino)-9,9′-spirobifluorene (Spiro-OMeTAD) as hole-transporting layers (HTLs) and blade-coated carbon (B-C) or a pressed self-standing carbon film (P-C) as the anode. Comprehensive characterizations reveal that pressing carbon on the P3HT/NiOx HTL resulted in weak physical and electrical contacts, while blade-coated carbon on Spiro caused damage to the electrical properties of the organic HTL during the required annealing of the carbon film. However, the P3HT/NiOx/B-C and Spiro-OMeTAD/P-C anode structures enabled remarkable photovoltaic performance under indoor weak light, with the champion efficiencies reaching 40.5 and 42.5%, respectively, for these two flexible PSCs. Through the systematic design and comparison of anode buffer layers, our work offers referential choice on the device structure for efficient flexible carbon-electrode PSCs that are promising for indoor photovoltaic application.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c10376","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性钙钛矿室内光伏","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"柔性碳电极钙钛矿太阳能电池低成本、可快速更新且易于集成，是弱光应用的候选技术，但其性能落后于金属电极器件，主要归因于缺乏高效的缓冲层/碳组合。本研究系统研究了两种典型阳极结构：以P3HT/NiOx或Spiro-OMeTAD作为空穴传输层，配合刮涂碳（B-C）或压制自支撑碳膜（P-C）阳极。综合表征表明，压制碳电极与空穴传输层的组合可改善界面接触，为高效柔性室内光伏器件的阳极缓冲层选择提供依据。","kp":["器件结构: 碳电极柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池","应用场景: 弱光室内光伏","性能瓶颈: 缓冲层/碳电极组合效率不足"]},{"t":"具有亚60 mV/dec亚阈值摆幅的BSb/InSe范德华晶体管的无掺杂冷源接触","b":"Abstract The relentless scaling of transistors has intensified power dissipation challenges in modern integrated circuits, necessitating devices that operate below the fundamental Boltzmann limit of 60 mV/dec subthreshold swing (SS). Here, we propose a cold-source field-effect transistor (CS-FET) based on a van der Waals (vdW) heterostructure, comprising theoretically proposed monolayer boron antimonide (BSb) as the source electrode and indium selenide (InSe) as the channel. Through first-principles density functional theory (DFT) and quantum transport simulations, we demonstrate that the BSb/InSe FET intrinsically enables cold-source operation without intentional source doping. Specifically, the unique electronic band structure of the BSb electrode acts as a natural energy filter, truncating the high-energy tail of the Fermi–Dirac distribution and effectively suppressing the injection of thermally excited hot electrons into the channel. Driven by this carrier-cooling mechanism, the device achieves an ultralow SS of 38.14 mV/dec at room temperature, outperforming conventional metal–oxide–semiconductor field-effect transistors (MOSFETs) and state-of-the-art graphene-based CS-FETs (68.74 mV/dec). Furthermore, it delivers outstanding on-state currents of 1295.33 nA/nm for high-performance and 907.42 nA/nm for low-power applications, fully satisfying the International Roadmap for Devices and Systems (IRDS) 2028 targets. This work establishes BSb as a compelling, doping-free alternative to graphene for next-generation cold-source electrodes, providing a theoretical framework for ultralow-power 2D logic electronics.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13925","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"冷源场效应晶体管","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"晶体管尺寸微缩加剧了集成电路功耗挑战，需要突破60 mV/dec热玻尔兹曼极限亚阈值摆幅的器件。本研究提出基于范德华异质结的冷源场效应晶体管，以单层硼锑化物（BSb）为源电极、硒化铟（InSe）为沟道。通过第一性原理DFT与量子输运模拟证明，该FET无需特意源掺杂即可实现本征冷源工作——BSb电极独特的能带结构充当天然能量过滤器，截断高能载流子注入，实现亚60 mV/dec的亚阈值摆幅。","kp":["亚阈值摆幅: 亚60 mV/dec","器件结构[BSb/InSe范德华异质结]: 冷源场效应晶体管(CS-FET)","沟道材料: 硒化铟(InSe)","源极材料: 单层硼锑(BSb)"]},{"t":"面向高度均匀GeTe基CBRAM及无选通器Hopfield型联想网络中并行Hebbian学习的电解质键合工程","b":"Abstract Hopfield networks offer a hardware-friendly framework for energy-efficient associative memory, yet their practical realization in memristor crossbar arrays is critically hindered by device-to-device (D2D) variability, which prevents reliable parallel programming. Here, we address this bottleneck through systematic composition engineering of the Ge–Te solid electrolyte in conductive bridge random access memory (CBRAM) devices. By varying the Ge:Te ratio, we identify Ge3.5Te1 as an optimal composition, exhibiting the smallest average coefficient of variation in characteristic parameters compared to GeSe-based devices. Raman spectroscopy reveals that this improvement is associated with a narrower distribution of Ge-centered tetrahedral coordination environments, which we propose narrows the spread of Cu+ migration barriers and thereby renders filament formation more reproducible. Combining this electrolyte optimization with pore-size scaling to 200 nm, we fabricate a selector-free 16 × 16 Cu/Ge3.5Te1 CBRAM crossbar array and demonstrate a 4 × 4 Hopfield-type associative network capable of learning and recalling binary pattern pairs via fully parallel programming using a half-selection scheme. Successful pattern recall is achieved for up to two stored associations despite the absence of selector elements, establishing a proof-of-concept for selector-free hardware implementations of associative memory. These results highlight the critical role of electrolyte bonding structure in determining memristor uniformity and provide a materials-driven pathway toward scalable, parallel neuromorphic computing systems.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c11473","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CBRAM神经形态器件","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"Hopfield网络为高能效联想存储提供了硬件友好框架，但器件间（D2D）变异性阻碍其在忆阻器交叉阵列中的可靠并行编程。本研究通过系统调控导电桥式随机存储器（CBRAM）中Ge–Te固体电解质的组分解决该瓶颈，确定Ge3.5Te1为最优组成，其特征参数的平均变异系数相比GeSe基器件最小。拉曼光谱显示该改善与以Ge为中心的四面体配位环境分布更窄相关，实现了高度均匀的GeTe基CBRAM及无选通器Hopfield联想网络中的并行Hebbian学习。","kp":["器件类型: GeTe基导电桥随机存取存储器(CBRAM)","最优电解质组分: Ge3.5Te1","应用架构: 无选通器Hopfield型联想网络","关键特征: 电解质键合工程降低器件间(D2D)变异性"]},{"t":"具有相依赖活性的压力调控类酶氧化锶钙钛矿\"Perovzymes\"","b":"Abstract Enzymes exhibit remarkable structural adaptability, often exhibiting structure-dependent catalytic performance. Despite the emergence of perovskite-based inorganic oxides as promising enzyme-like catalysts, the effect of crystal structure modulation on their catalytic activity remains unknown. In this context, we demonstrate the SrCoO3–δ (δ = 0.3–0.5) perovskite system as an enzyme mimic that possesses a rich phase landscape spanning hexagonal to cubic structures. Herein, we investigated the effect of pressure-controlled phase transformations between the oxygen-deficient orthorhombic phase (SCO-1) and oxygen-rich tetragonal phase (SCO-16) of SrCoO3–δ on enzyme-like activity. The oxidase enzyme-like activity showed a distinct dependence on the crystal structure transition from orthorhombic to tetragonal, resulting in nearly fivefold higher activity in the tetragonal phase compared to its orthorhombic counterpart. Owing to the excellent scalability, heterogeneous nature, and superior operational stability, we utilized our system in phenolic pollutant detection. Notably, compared to natural laccase enzyme, which typically suffers from poor durability, limited tolerance to harsh conditions, and limited recyclability, SCO-16 exhibits sustained catalytic efficiency, enhanced robustness, and excellent reusability over multiple cycles, making it suitable for environmental remediation. In all, the distinct phase-dependent enzyme-like activity of pressure-regulated perovskite phases establishes a new direction in enzyme-like materials design.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13249","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿类酶催化","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究将SrCoO3–δ（δ=0.3–0.5）钙钛矿体系作为酶模拟物\"Perovzymes\"，其具有从六方到立方结构的丰富相图。研究考察了压力控制的缺氧正交相（SCO-1）与富氧四方相（SCO-16）之间相变对类酶活性的影响，发现氧化酶样活性对晶体结构转变呈现明显依赖性，证明晶体结构调控可影响类酶催化性能，为压力调控的相依赖活性无机酶模拟催化剂提供了范例。","kp":["催化材料: SrCoO3–δ (δ = 0.3–0.5)钙钛矿类酶催化剂","结构特征: 六方至立方相依赖催化活性","调控手段: 压力调控晶体结构"]},{"t":"蒽醌共价有机框架的互变异构态工程实现从水和氧高效光合成H2O2","b":"Abstract Hydrogen peroxide photosynthesis from water and oxygen represents a sustainable route toward decentralized chemical manufacturing, yet its efficiency is severely restricted by sluggish water oxidation reaction. Herein, we report an alkaline-triggered keto-form reconstruction strategy in an anthraquinone-based covalent organic framework (TpAQ) to promote H2O2 photosynthesis. Under strongly alkaline conditions (pH = 13), hydroxide ions induce spontaneous enol-to-keto tautomerization, generating a keto-dominant framework with reconstructed electronic structures and interfacial catalytic microenvironments. The resulting keto-form-rich TpAQ exhibits broadened visible-light absorption, positively shifted valence band positions, accelerated charge separation, and substantially enhanced water adsorption and activation capability. Benefiting from the synergistic enhancement of water oxidation and two-electron oxygen reduction kinetics, the optimized photocatalyst achieves an H2O2 production rate of 678 μM h–1 under visible-light irradiation, which is 3.12-fold higher than that under neutral conditions. Isotope-labeling experiments combined with in situ spectroscopy reveal that the promoted water oxidation continuously supplies O2 for subsequent H2O2 generation via a one-step two-electron oxygen reduction pathway. This work establishes tautomeric-state engineering as an effective strategy for regulating charge dynamics and water oxidation kinetics in covalent organic framework photocatalysts toward efficient H2O2 photosynthesis.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13764","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光合成H2O2","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用水和氧光合成过氧化氢是分散式化学品制造的可持续途径，但受缓慢的水氧化反应限制。本研究报道蒽醌基共价有机框架（TpAQ）的碱触发酮式重构策略：在强碱性条件（pH=13）下，氢氧根离子诱导自发的烯醇-酮互变异构，生成酮式主导的框架，其电子结构和界面催化微环境得以重构。所得富酮式TpAQ可见光吸收拓宽、价带位置正移、电荷分离加速，显著增强水氧化动力学，实现从水和氧高效光合成H2O2。","kp":["催化材料: 蒽醌基共价有机框架(TpAQ)","反应条件: 强碱性 pH = 13","策略[水和氧光合成H2O2]: 碱触发烯醇-酮互变异构重构","限速因素: 缓慢的水氧化反应"]},{"t":"通过晶格平整化与缺陷工程协同提升L-DED打印p型Bi2Te3的热电性能","b":"Abstract While laser 3D printing offers unique advantages for fabricating complex architectures, its broader application is hindered by the stringent requirements for high-quality powder precursors and the inferior thermoelectric properties of the printed bulk materials. Herein, irregularly shaped p-type Bi0.5Sb1.5Te3 powders were successfully printed into polycrystalline bulks using the laser-directed energy deposition (L-DED) method via the optimization of printing parameters. The incorporation of excess Te and Sb atoms not only facilitates lattice plainification to enhance carrier transport, but also unexpectedly intensifies phonon scattering via the in situ formation of multiple defects. This synergistic enhancement enables the printed p-type bulks to reach a remarkable zT of 1.42 at 317 K. We assembled a 127-pair thermoelectric device using L-DED-fabricated p-type Bi0.5Sb1.5Te3 and SLM-fabricated n-type Bi2Te2.7Se0.3, which achieved an experimental efficiency of ∼5.6% at a temperature difference of 200 K. The findings of this work lay an important foundation for the application of emerging laser-based 3D printing technologies in the field of thermoelectrics.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c15026","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/导热/耐热材料","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"3D打印热电材料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对激光3D打印对高质量粉末依赖且打印块体热电性能差的问题，研究采用激光定向能量沉积（L-DED）方法，通过优化打印参数，将不规则形状的p型Bi0.5Sb1.5Te3粉末成功打印成多晶块体。通过引入过量Te和Sb原子，一方面促进晶格平整化以增强载流子输运，另一方面通过原位形成多重缺陷加强声子散射，实现电输运与热输运的协同优化。该协同增强使打印的p型块体在高温下达到1.42的显著zT值，为复杂热电器件的增材制造提供了可行途径。","kp":["打印方法: 激光定向能量沉积(L-DED)","材料体系: p型Bi0.5Sb1.5Te3多晶块体","策略: 晶格平整化与缺陷工程协同提升热电性能"]},{"t":"使用体外肤色模型测量防晒霜的反射率与白痕","b":"Abstract Sunscreen white cast is a visible whitening on skin caused by light scattering from sunscreen films and is one of the primary reasons consumers underapply sunscreen below the 2 mg/cm2 thickness required to achieve labeled SPF. Existing methods for quantifying white cast rely on in vivo scoring by human participants, and standard in vitro SPF measurements consider only the transmission of UV light, therefore conflating absorption and reflectance. Using integrating-sphere reflectance spectroscopy, we measure three organic-filter and three inorganic-filter sunscreens with similar UV-filter compositions. We find that reflectance accounts for up to 30% of UV light partitioning away from the skin, a contribution that is not explicitly captured by standard transmission-based SPF measurements. We then design a quartz skin construct (QSC) that approximates Fitzpatrick Phototype (FP) II and V skin tones that enables contextual colorimetric analysis. We show that white cast is twice as perceptible on QSC-FPV than on QSC-FPII, which is directly attributable to the increase in diffuse reflectance in the visible region. By comparing sunscreens with similar UV filter compositions, we attribute differences in reflectance in the visible region to formulation variables, in addition to the UV filters. In this work, we establish reflectance as a key contributor to sun protection and offer a translational in vitro method for evaluating cosmetic outcomes across skin tones.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c12471","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"防晒霜白痕测量","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"防晒霜的白痕是由防晒膜光散射引起的皮肤可见泛白，是消费者涂抹量低于标注SPF所需的2 mg/cm²的主要原因。现有白痕量化方法依赖人体体内评分，标准体外SPF测量仅考虑紫外透射，无法区分吸收与反射。研究采用积分球反射光谱，测量了三种有机过滤型和三种无机过滤型防晒霜（UV过滤成分相近），发现反射可占离开皮肤的紫外光的30%，这一贡献未被基于透射的标准SPF测量明确捕捉，为防晒霜表征提供了新方法。","kp":["防晒霜标准厚度: 2 mg/cm2","测量方法: 积分球反射光谱","方法局限[传统体外SPF]: 仅测UV透射，混淆吸收与反射"]},{"t":"三组分难题：解析电解质各组分在溶剂化结构与硅日历老化中的作用","b":"Abstract In this work, we deconvolute the roles of LiPF6, ethyl methyl carbonate (EMC), and vinylene carbonate (VC) in the electrolyte solvation structure and silicon anode calendar aging. By varying the mole fractions of the electrolyte constituents and utilizing a voltage hold protocol, we extract the roles of each component in the silicon anode calendar lifetime. Interestingly, the LiPF6 concentration does not affect calendar aging, whereas increasing and decreasing the EMC and VC mole fractions, respectively, lowers the electrode surface passivity. The calendar lifetime results align with EMC coordination numbers derived from MD simulations, which indicate the inner solvation sheath’s role in calendar aging mechanisms. X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy data show that the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) species can be tuned through the electrolyte formulation and solvation structure. Li+-EMC coordination structures decompose to form insoluble alkanes, C−O species, and lithium carbonate (Li2CO3), while the anion coordination complex decomposes into LiF and LixPOyFz. Postaging, the surface lithium content of the SEI is partially replaced by C−O species from preferential decomposition of noncoordinated VC. However, the inorganic lithium species (LiF, LixPOyFz, and Li2CO3) remain constant, suggesting the dissolution of nonpolar organolithium species due to EMC’s low dielectric constant and high coordination number. This triggers continuous electrolyte decomposition to reform the SEI, which lowers the silicon anode’s calendar lifetime.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c23255","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/锂电","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极电解质老化","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究解耦了LiPF6、碳酸甲乙酯（EMC）和碳酸亚乙烯酯（VC）三种电解质组分在溶剂化结构及硅负极日历老化中的作用。通过改变各组分的摩尔分数并采用电压保持协议，提取了每种组分对硅负极日历寿命的贡献。结果显示，LiPF6浓度不影响日历老化，而增加EMC摩尔分数和降低VC摩尔分数会降低电极表面钝化性。日历寿命结果与分子动力学模拟得出的EMC配位数一致，表明内溶剂化壳层在日历老化机制中起作用；X射线光电子能谱数据进一步揭示了固体电解质界面的变化。","kp":["锂盐: LiPF6","溶剂: 甲基乙基碳酸酯(EMC)","添加剂: 碳酸亚乙烯酯(VC)","结论[硅负极日历老化]: LiPF6浓度不影响老化，EMC与VC摩尔分数分别起正向与负向作用"]},{"t":"兼具抗氧化、成骨与抗菌生物活性的静电-配位耦合交联富勒醇-Ga纳米粒子：一种有望用于骨科植入物改性的添加剂","b":"Abstract The antibacterial property of fullerenes and their derivatives is highly dependent on light irradiation, which limits their biomedical applications. In this work, we report a novel type of nanoparticle composed of Fullerenol and gallium (Ga). The morphological features and chemical structures of the nanoparticles were characterized, and their assembly mechanism was further elucidated. Moreover, the antioxidant activity, osteogenic performance, and antibacterial effect of the Fullerenol-Ga under dark conditions were systematically investigated. The results show that the average diameter of individual Fullerenol-Ga nanoparticles is 10–30 nm. The assembly process between Fullerenol molecules and Ga3+ proceeds through a coupled mechanism of electrostatic adsorption and coordination crosslinking. The obtained Fullerenol-Ga exhibit remarkable scavenging ability against both DPPH and ABTS radicals, and effectively reduces the overall intracellular ROS level as well. Furthermore, high concentrations of nanoparticles can significantly promote the proliferation of MC3T3-E1 cells, enhance ALP activity, and upregulate the expression of early osteogenic related genes. Due to the unique “Trojan horse” antibacterial mechanism of Ga3+, the Fullerenol-Ga achieves an antibacterial rate of over 95% against both Escherichia coli and Staphylococcus aureus at a concentration of 150 μg/mL. Based on the multifaceted performance described above, this Fullerenol-Ga synergistic therapeutic system shows great potential as an additive for the surface modification of orthopedic implant materials.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c11972","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"骨科植入纳米粒子","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"富勒烯及其衍生物的抗菌性能高度依赖光照，限制了其生物医学应用。研究报道了一种由富勒醇与镓（Ga）组成的新型纳米粒子，对其形貌、化学结构进行了表征并阐明了组装机制。单个Fullerenol-Ga纳米粒子的平均直径为10–30 nm，富勒醇分子与Ga³⁺的组装过程通过静电吸附与配位交联的耦合机制实现。研究还系统考察了该纳米粒子在避光条件下的抗氧化活性、成骨性能和抗菌效果，表明其无需光照即可发挥多功能生物活性，是一种有前景的骨科植入物改性添加剂。","kp":["材料体系: 富勒醇-镓(Fullerenol-Ga)纳米粒子","组装机制: 静电-配位耦合交联","功能特性: 兼具抗氧化、成骨与抗菌活性","应用方向: 骨科植入物改性添加剂"]},{"t":"用于氮化镓高电子迁移率晶体管近结热管理的复合晶体氮化铝钝化","b":"Abstract In this work, we demonstrate a composite crystalline aluminum nitride (AlN) passivation layer for near-junction thermal management in aluminum gallium nitride/gallium nitride (AlGaN/GaN) high-electron-mobility transistors (HEMTs). The 120-nm-thick AlN film consists of an ordered interfacial AlN region together with an upper polycrystalline overlayer. Time-domain thermoreflectance (TDTR) measurements yield an effective cross-plane thermal conductivity of 47.2 W/m·K for the composite AlN, much higher than 2.58 W/m·K for the silicon nitride (SiNx) reference, together with a lower interfacial thermal resistance of 10.0 m2·K/GW compared with 29.6 m2·K/GW for the SiNx-passivated interface. Spatially resolved vibrational electron energy-loss spectroscopy (EELS) further indicates more continuous interfacial vibrational evolution at the AlN/nitride interface. At the device level, steady-state thermoreflectance measurements reveal that the channel-proximal peak temperature is markedly reduced under comparable power densities, accompanied by a more uniform temperature distribution in the gate-to-drain region. In addition to the thermal benefit, the composite AlN layer maintains favorable direct-current (DC) output characteristics relative to the SiNx reference device. These results show that composite crystalline AlN is an effective passivation and near-junction heat-spreading layer for GaN HEMTs.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c12341","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/导热/耐热材料","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"GaN晶体管热管理","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究展示了一种用于AlGaN/GaN高电子迁移率晶体管（HEMT）近结热管理的复合晶体氮化铝（AlN）钝化层。120 nm厚的AlN薄膜由有序界面AlN区域和上部多晶覆盖层构成。时域热反射（TDTR）测量显示，复合AlN的有效跨面热导率为47.2 W/m·K，远高于氮化硅（SiNx）参考的2.58 W/m·K；其界面热阻为10.0 m²·K/GW，低于SiNx钝化界面的29.6 m²·K/GW。空间分辨振动电子能量损失谱（EELS）进一步表明界面处连接更紧密，证实该钝化层可显著提升GaN器件的散热性能。","kp":["复合氮化铝钝化层厚度: 120 nm","复合AlN有效跨面热导率[TDTR测量]: 47.2 W/m·K","AlN薄膜结构: 界面有序AlN区+上部多晶覆盖层","应用对象[AlGaN/GaN HEMT]: 近结热管理钝化层"]},{"t":"基于先进量子点的智能手机AI赋能侧流免疫分析平台用于智能定量诊断","b":"Abstract Lateral flow immunoassays (LFIAs) are widely used in point-of-care diagnostics for their low cost and simplicity, but conventional formats rely on subjective visual readout and lack quantitative accuracy and sensitivity. Here, we present a smartphone-guided, artificial-intelligence-enhanced LFIA platform that unites a rationally engineered dual-modal nanoprobe with on-device machine learning, demonstrated for quantitative detection of Rift Valley fever virus (RVFV). The platform combines three synergistic principles: advanced magnetic quantum dot nanoparticles (AQDs) that integrate a magnetic core and a quantum dot shell in a single label to provide both colorimetric and fluorescence signals while enabling magnetic preconcentration of the target antigen; multi-illumination imaging that turns an ordinary smartphone camera into a quantitative reader; and a machine-learning model that extracts illumination-robust features to convert signal into concentration, removing user subjectivity and lighting sensitivity. This design markedly improves sensitivity over conventional gold-nanosphere LFIA in both modes, enables reliable quantification directly in serum without any pretreatment, and outperforms naked-eye interpretation in blind testing. By coupling dual-modal amplification and magnetic enrichment with AI-driven analysis on widely available hardware, the AQD-LFIA platform offers a scalable route toward next-generation point-of-care and at-home diagnostics.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c10769","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI免疫诊断平台","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"侧流免疫分析（LFIA）因低成本和简便性广泛用于即时诊断，但传统形式依赖主观目视判读，缺乏定量准确性和灵敏度。研究提出一个智能手机引导、人工智能增强的LFIA平台，结合合理设计的双模态纳米探针与设备端机器学习，用于裂谷热病毒（RVFV）的定量检测。该平台整合三项协同原则：先进磁性量子点纳米粒子（AQDs）将磁性内核与量子点壳层集成于单一标记中，同时提供比色和荧光信号并实现目标抗原的磁性预富集；多光源照明成像；以及设备端机器学习，实现智能定量诊断。","kp":["平台架构: 智能手机引导+AI增强的侧流免疫分析","探针: 双模态纳米探针+端侧机器学习","应用目标: RVFV定量检测"]},{"t":"通过As-/Te-free Ge2Se3中Sb诱导的陷阱态调制实现可靠低能耗仅选通器存储操作","b":"Abstract Selector-only memory (SOM) integrates memory and selector functions within a single volatile threshold-switching layer, offering a compact architecture for high-density cross-point arrays. However, its practical performance depends strongly on the introduction and distribution of trap states in the chalcogenide network. Conventional SOM materials often rely on As- or Te-containing chalcogenides to achieve effective trap-state engineering, but their toxicity, limited stability, and integration challenges motivate the development of safer alternatives. Here, we report Sb-doped Ge2Se3 (Sb(x):GS, where x denotes the Sb atomic fraction) as an As-/Te-free SOM material and investigate the effects of Sb-induced trap-state modulation on low-energy and reliable operation. Pure Ge2Se3 (GS) offers a robust Ge–Se network but insufficient effective trap states for energy-efficient SOM operation; thus, Sb was incorporated to tune the trap distribution and enhance SOM performance. The optimized Sb(0.16):GS device exhibits polarity-dependent threshold voltage (Vth) states of Vth1 ≈ 2.1 V and Vth2 ≈ 4.5 V, corresponding to a large memory window (MW) of approximately 2.4 V, while maintaining a low off-state current of ∼5 nA. Compared to pure GS, Sb(0.16):GS reaches a saturated MW at approximately 33% lower write energy under identical programming conditions and exhibits reliable state separation during repeated switching and drift evaluation. X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy, Raman spectroscopy, optical absorption analysis, and temperature-dependent transport measurements indicate that moderate Sb incorporation preserves the Ge–Se network while introducing Sb–Se-associated trap states that increase the separation between the trap depth and activation energy of the two programmed states. In contrast, excessive Sb incorporation promotes Sb-rich homopolar bonding and broadens the trap distribution, degrading switching performance. The findings provide practical design guidelines for engineering trap states in chalcogenide selectors and advance the development of energy-efficient, reliable, and high-density SOM technologies.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13623","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"选通器存储器件","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"仅选通器存储（SOM）在单一易失性阈值开关层中集成存储与选通功能，为高密度交叉阵列提供紧凑架构，其性能强烈依赖于硫系化合物网络中陷阱态的引入与分布。传统SOM材料常依赖含As或Te的硫系化合物进行陷阱态工程，但存在毒性、稳定性和集成挑战。研究报道了Sb掺杂Ge2Se3作为无As/无Te的SOM材料，考察了Sb诱导的陷阱态调制对低能耗和可靠运行的影响。纯Ge2Se3性能受限，Sb掺杂通过调制陷阱态实现了可靠的低能耗阈值开关与存储操作。","kp":["存储架构: 仅选通器存储","开关机制: 易失性阈值开关层","材料体系: 无As/Te的Ge2Se3","关键工艺: Sb诱导陷阱态调制"]},{"t":"基于光生自由基的双波长响应光致变色离子氢键有机框架用于多形态先进信息存储与加密","b":"Abstract Dual-wavelength response photochromic materials have attracted considerable attention due to their unique responsive characteristics and the synergistic enhancement of information security enabled by dual-dimensional (time-wavelength) control. We report a pair of chiral ionic hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (R/S-iHOF-68) that exhibit dual-wavelength response photochromism through charge-assisted interaction. A two-dimensional supramolecular framework is co-constructed through mutual interactions between the electron donor (1R/S,2R/S)−1,2-diphenylethylenediamine (R/S-DPEN) and the electron-acceptor NDI derivatives (o-H2BSNDI). Upon irradiation with 275 nm and 365 nm, the crystal powder of R/S-iHOF-68 exhibits distinct photochromism, characterized by different rates of the photogenerated radical. This is attributed to the high sensitivity of the designed donor−acceptor (D−A) structure to the excitation energy of the different excitation wavelengths. To further explore the photophysical kinetic mechanism, we prepared suspensions (NMP, DMF, DMA), as well as R-iHOF-68@PVA membrane with different mass ratios. Upon 365 nm irradiation, the R/S-iHOF-68 suspensions exhibited a pronounced solvatochromic effect. The R-iHOF-68@PVA membrane demonstrated efficient photochromism, arising from the synergy between photogenerated radicals and Förster resonance energy transfer (FRET). A digital encoding strategy that integrates the binary code with the Morse code was developed to enhance the security of information storage. This multiform molecular encryption platform holds significant potential for high-security information encryption and real-time identity authentication in high-value applications.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c15435","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致变色信息存储","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"双波长响应光致变色材料因时间-波长双重维度控制对信息安全的协同增强而备受关注。研究报道了一对手性离子氢键有机框架（R/S-iHOF-68），通过电荷辅助相互作用实现双波长响应光致变色。电子供体(1R/S,2R/S)-1,2-二苯基乙二胺与电子受体NDI衍生物相互作用，共同构筑二维超分子框架。在275 nm和365 nm照射下，R/S-iHOF-68晶体粉末表现出不同的光致变色行为，光生产色物种速率不同，可实现多形态先进信息存储与加密应用。","kp":["材料体系: 手性离子氢键有机框架R/S-iHOF-68","光致变色特性: 双波长响应","框架结构: 二维超分子框架","应用: 多形态先进信息存储与加密"]},{"t":"探索Aza-BODIPY衍生物作为声敏剂用于乳腺癌深组织声动力诊疗","b":"Abstract Sonodynamic therapy (SDT) is an emerging noninvasive treatment for tumors with the advantage of deep tissue penetration. However, it is still challenging to develop effective organic sonosensitizers with good stability for imaging and SDT. In this work, in order to reveal the structure–activity relationship of sonosensitizers, we designed and synthesized a series of aza-BODIPY derivatives (AB1–AB5) with different substituents (methoxy, octyloxy, anthracene, and iodine atom) to systematically evaluate the influence of electron-donating effect and heavy atom effect on the sonodynamic efficacy. Among them, the iodine-substituted aza-BODIPY (AB5) demonstrated superior sonodynamic performance and exhibited enhanced reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation. Subsequently, we encapsulated AB5 with the hydrophilic polymer DSPE-mPEG2000 to create nanoparticles referred to as iodinated aza-BODIPY nanoparticles (IABNPs). In vitro cellular assays and in vivo animal experiments showed that IABNPs had excellent stability, biocompatibility, and pronounced sonodynamic effect, which resulted in significant inhibition of tumor growth. Moreover, the fluorescent emission characteristics of AB5 enabled fluorescence-guided imaging and real-time monitoring during tumor treatment. This study systematically explored the influence of substituents on the sonodynamic effect of aza-BODIPY, providing important theoretical foundations and perspectives for future research in related fields.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c14426","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"声动力诊疗敏化剂","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"声动力治疗（SDT）是一种具有深组织穿透优势的无创肿瘤治疗方法，但开发兼具良好稳定性的高效有机声敏剂仍具挑战。研究设计合成了含不同取代基（甲氧基、辛氧基、蒽和碘原子）的一系列aza-BODIPY衍生物（AB1–AB5），系统评估电子给体效应和重原子效应对声动力疗效的影响，以揭示构效关系。其中碘取代的aza-BODIPY（AB5）表现出最优的声动力性能，活性氧（ROS）生成能力增强。研究随后对其进行了封装，用于乳腺癌深组织声动力诊疗。","kp":["声敏剂: aza-BODIPY衍生物AB1–AB5","取代基设计: 甲氧基/辛氧基/蒽/碘原子","应用: 乳腺癌深组织声动力诊疗"]},{"t":"基于多酸纳米酶构建具有优异抗菌活性的光致变色隐形眼镜","b":"Abstract Contact lenses exhibit outstanding practicality in vision correction and visual optimization owing to their inherent advantages, such as unobstructed clear vision, comfortable conformal fitting, aesthetic invisibility, and compatibility with daily activities. However, conventional contact lenses are prone to bacterial colonization, which can cause ocular infections and further induce keratitis. Herein, we designed and fabricated color-changing contact lenses based on polyoxometalate nanozymes for antibacterial and anti-inflammatory ocular therapy. In these contact lenses, polyoxometalate nanozymes can effectively achieve the catalytic decomposition of excessive reactive oxygen species to alleviate oxidative stress, while simultaneously inhibiting bacterial growth and proliferation. The immobilization of spiropyran imparts reversible photochromic properties to the contact lenses, which can effectively protect the eyes from ultraviolet damage. This design overcomes the drawback that conventional contact lenses easily induce ocular infections; more importantly, it constructs a multifunctional eye-protective system integrating antibacterial, anti-inflammatory and ultraviolet-protective functions.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c14012","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗菌变色隐形眼镜","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"隐形眼镜因视野清晰、贴合舒适、美观隐形及兼容日常活动而在视力矫正中应用广泛，但传统镜片易被细菌定植，可引发眼部感染和角膜炎。研究设计并制备了基于多酸纳米酶的变色隐形眼镜，用于抗菌抗炎眼部治疗。镜片中的多酸纳米酶可有效催化分解过量活性氧，缓解氧化应激，同时抑制细菌生长繁殖。该镜片兼具光致变色和抗菌功能，为预防和治疗隐形眼镜相关的眼部感染提供了新策略。","kp":["隐形眼镜功能基元: 多酸纳米酶","功能: 光致变色+优异抗菌活性","应用: 预防细菌定植引起的眼部感染"]},{"t":"穿梭催化策略结合3D导电支架实现超快长寿命MnO2/Mn2+转化化学","b":"Abstract Aqueous rechargeable batteries relying on the two-electron MnO2/Mn2+ deposition/dissolution chemistry offer a high theoretical capacity (616 mAh g−1). However, their practicality is hampered by the disproportionation of Mn3+ intermediates and the irreversible buildup of electrochemically inert MnO2 deposits, which severely compromise the reversibility of the MnO2/Mn2+ conversion process and undermine long-term cycling stability. To overcome these issues, we propose an Fe2+-induced shuttle-catalysis strategy with a rationally designed three-dimensional (3D) conductive carbon scaffold. Specifically, Fe2+ was introduced as a redox mediator to catalytically accelerate MnO2 dissolution via MnO2 + 2Fe2+ + 4H+ → Mn2+ + 2Fe3+ + 2H2O, enabling high MnO2/Mn2+ conversion efficiency. Simultaneously, a carbon nanotube‑decorated carbon cloth serves as the conductive current collector, offering abundant disproportionation sites for the diffused Mn3+ and sufficient electron‑transport pathways to guide uniform MnO2 growth. As a result, the optimized MnO2/Mn2+ cathode achieves exceptional stability over 7000 cycles at 3 mAh cm−2 and remarkable rate capability with negligible capacity loss at 60 mA cm−2. When paired with a Sn anode in a full‑cell configuration, the battery exhibits stable cycling for more than 1800 cycles, and practical functionality demonstrated by powering a light-emitting diode.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13050","c":"未分类","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基水系电池"},{"t":"0 °C下NiMnCu-LDH正极与混合负极间混合阴离子促进的水系储能","b":"Abstract Aqueous anion energy storage systems (AAEs) represent a promising class of energy technologies that combine high safety, environmental sustainability, and potential for green energy demands. In this work, low-cost NiMnCu-LDH is demonstrated for the first time as a high-performance cathode for AAEs based on Cl–/CO32– storage. As paired with the inexpensive hybrid anode of FeO(OH)/CNT and Bi2O2CO3 in a pouch battery, the AAEs deliver remarkable capacities at 25 and 0 °C, with ∼155 and ∼121 mAh g–1 at 300 mA g–1, respectively, sufficient to power light-emitting diode devices. Dynamic analysis illustrates mixed kinetics in concert: diffusion-controlled and pseudocapacitive processes. The cost-effectiveness of the AAEs derives from the scalable synthesis of both the NiMnCu-LDH cathode and hybrid anode. The outstanding battery performance is attributed to two-dimensional diffusion channels of LDH facilitating reversible intercalation/deintercalation of Cl–/CO32– within interlayers, along with valence transitions of Ni/Mn during charge/discharge cycles. The synergistic effects from mixed anions and the hybrid anode collectively enhance electrochemical performance, in which Cl– and FeO(OH)/CNT provide high capacity, while CO32– and Bi2O2CO3 stabilize cyclicality. These findings highlight the feasibility of the NiMnCu-LDH cathode coupled with the FeO(OH)/CNT and Bi2O2CO3 anode for AAEs to store Cl–/CO32–, offering research insights and development opportunities toward sustainable energy storage technologies.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c10960","c":"未分类","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"混合阴离子水系储能"},{"t":"超声激活的FeSnO(OH)5/Cu2S异质结微针协调氧化还原催化与金属离子稳态失调用于局部肿瘤治疗","b":"Abstract An ultrasound-activated microneedle patch (FCSP-MN) was developed for localized tumor therapy by integrating FeSnO(OH)5/Cu2S heterojunction nanoparticles (FCS) and phloretin into pH-responsive poly(acrylic acid)/poly(vinylpyrrolidone) microneedle tips. Heterojunction formation promoted interfacial charge redistribution, with approximately 1.942 electrons transferred from Cu2S to FeSnO(OH)5, and reduced the calculated energy barrier of the rate-determining peroxidase-like step from 2.38 to 2.03 eV. Consequently, FCS enhanced ultrasound-triggered singlet oxygen and hydroxyl radical generation, peroxidase-like catalysis, and glutathione depletion, thereby amplifying oxidative stress. The microneedles enabled efficient skin penetration and acidity-responsive delivery, releasing approximately 80% of phloretin at pH 5.4 vs 40% at pH 7.4 within 80 min, while ultrasound accelerated tip dissolution. In 4T1 cells, FCS and phloretin (FCSP) combined with ultrasound induced pronounced oxidative and mitochondrial damage accompanied by ferroptosis- and cuproptosis-associated responses, including lipid peroxidation, glutathione peroxidase 4 suppression, and dihydrolipoamide S-acetyltransferase oligomerization. In 4T1 tumor-bearing mice, FCSP-MN plus ultrasound achieved the strongest tumor-growth suppression among the tested treatments, with stable body weight and no obvious histological injury to major organs. This platform couples heterointerface-enhanced redox catalysis, responsive local delivery, and Fe/Cu dyshomeostasis for multimodal tumor therapy.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c16298","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超声微针肿瘤治疗","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了超声激活的微针贴片（FCSP-MN），将FeSnO(OH)5/Cu2S异质结纳米粒子（FCS）与根皮素集成于pH响应的聚丙烯酸/聚乙烯吡咯烷酮微针尖端，用于局部肿瘤治疗。异质结形成促进界面电荷再分布，约1.942个电子从Cu2S转移至FeSnO(OH)5，并将速率决定步骤（类过氧化物酶）的能垒从2.38降至2.03 eV。由此，FCS增强了超声触发的单线态氧和羟基自由基生成、类过氧化物酶催化及谷胱甘肽耗竭，放大氧化应激。微针可高效穿透皮肤并响应酸性环境释药。","kp":["体系: 超声激活FeSnO(OH)5/Cu2S异质结微针贴片(FCSP-MN)","界面电荷转移[Cu2S→FeSnO(OH)5]: 约1.942个电子","限速类过氧化物酶步骤能垒: 由2.38降低(异质结形成)","载体: pH响应聚丙烯酸/聚乙烯吡咯烷酮微针"]},{"t":"用于线粒体靶向光热-化学治疗乳腺肿瘤的分级Fe3O4-DOX-TPP@HA超粒子","b":"Abstract Nanodrug delivery systems have shown great potential for tumor therapy but still meet the challenge of precise and efficient targeting. In this work, we demonstrate a hierarchical approach for mitochondria-targeted photothermo-chemotherapy of a breast tumor by fabricating hyaluronic acid (HA)-coated Fe3O4 superparticles (SPs) that are co-loaded with doxorubicin (DOX) and triphenylphosphine (TPP) (Fe3O4-DOX-TPP@HA SPs). As assemblies of Fe3O4 nanoparticles (NPs), the SPs exhibit superparamagnetism and primary tumor tissue targeting with the assistance of an external magnetic field. Meanwhile, the coated HA affords secondary targeting by binding with CD44 high-expressed breast tumor cells. The high level of hyaluronidase in the tumor cell further leads to the degradation of HA and exposure of TPP, thus achieving TPP-mediated tertiary targeting toward mitochondria. In addition, the assembled Fe3O4 NPs endow the SPs with strong photothermal performance, which combines with the loaded DOX to achieve mitochondria-targeted photothermo-chemotherapy of breast tumor models efficiently in vivo. Furthermore, leveraging the superparamagnetism and strong near-infrared absorption of Fe3O4 SPs, multimodal monitoring in tumor therapy by magnetic resonance and photoacoustic imaging is allowed.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c15499","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"靶向纳米载药颗粒","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究构建了用于乳腺肿瘤线粒体靶向光热-化学联合治疗的分级超粒子：以透明质酸（HA）包覆Fe3O4超粒子，并共载阿霉素（DOX）与三苯基膦（TPP），即Fe3O4-DOX-TPP@HA SPs。作为Fe3O4纳米粒子的组装体，超粒子具有超顺磁性，可借助外加磁场实现初级肿瘤组织靶向；HA涂层通过结合CD44高表达的乳腺肿瘤细胞实现二级靶向。肿瘤细胞中高含量透明质酸酶进一步降解HA，释放药物至线粒体，实现光热与化疗协同治疗。","kp":["体系: HA包覆Fe3O4-DOX-TPP@HA超粒子","靶向性: 线粒体靶向(TPP)","疗法: 光热-化学联合治疗乳腺肿瘤","超粒子特性: Fe3O4纳米粒组装的超顺磁性"]},{"t":"pH响应的二氧化铈负载铱簇酶用于糖尿病伤口愈合的抗菌抗炎联合治疗","b":"Abstract The treatment of diabetic wounds is hindered by multiple factors, including Staphylococcus aureus (S. aureus) biofilms (the predominant pathogen in diabetic wound infections), dysregulated immune responses, and insufficient angiogenesis. The complex interactions among these local pathological factors have been insufficiently addressed in the development of existing therapeutic approaches. This study reports a hybrid biocatalytic platform consisting of abundant iridium (Ir) clusters supported on ceria (Ir-CeO2). This architectural configuration enables pH-responsive reactive oxygen species (ROS) catalysis, allowing the biocatalyst to exert concurrent antimicrobial and anti-inflammatory effects, which collectively promote healing of diabetic wounds. Ir-CeO2 displays dual pH-dependent ROS modulation: ROS generation under acidic conditions and ROS scavenging under neutral pH. In S. aureus-infected environments, the biocatalyst exerts potent antibacterial effects via catalytic ROS production. Following pathogen clearance, Ir-CeO2 continues to play a bifunctional role by alleviating oxidative stress in inflamed wounds, promoting the polarization of macrophages toward the M2 phenotype—a critical event for accelerating wound healing. Collectively, these results highlight the multifaceted therapeutic efficacy of Ir-CeO2, which seamlessly integrates potent antibacterial activity against S. aureus infections with anti-inflammatory and pro-angiogenic functions. This synergistic profile establishes Ir-CeO2 as a highly promising agent for the holistic management of complicated diabetic ulcers, thereby addressing key shortcomings of existing treatment modalities.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c12902","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱簇酶伤口愈合","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"糖尿病伤口治疗受多重因素阻碍，包括金黄色葡萄球菌生物膜（糖尿病伤口感染的主要病原体）、免疫反应失调和血管生成不足，而现有疗法未充分应对这些局部病理因素的复杂相互作用。研究报道了一种由氧化铈负载铱簇（Ir-CeO2）构成的杂化生物催化平台。该结构实现pH响应的活性氧（ROS）催化，使生物催化剂同时发挥抗菌和抗炎作用，共同促进糖尿病伤口愈合。Ir-CeO2表现出双重pH依赖的催化行为，在感染酸性微环境中协同对抗感染与炎症。","kp":["平台: 二氧化铈负载铱簇酶杂化生物催化体系","响应特性: pH响应","功能: 抗菌抗炎联合治疗糖尿病伤口"]},{"t":"通过改进的配体辅助再沉淀法合成的苯丙胺封端CsPbBr3钙钛矿纳米晶体发光二极管的界面调控实现28 mm2有源区高亮度","b":"Abstract Processing-induced interfacial losses limit perovskite nanocrystal light-emitting diodes (PeLEDs) at display-relevant device areas, yet the steps responsible are rarely identified with statistical confidence beyond champion-device reporting. Here, we combine an all-inorganic CsPbBr3 emitter with a replicated factorial study at 28 mm2 active area. Nanocrystals capped with phenylpropylamine (PPA) by a room-temperature modified ligand-assisted reprecipitation (MLARP) route are deposited as two sequential films separated by a ∼2.8 nm polyvinylpyrrolidone (PVP) interlayer, with mild vacuum conditioning before the top layer. Seven of thirteen architectures were replicated over two fabrication sessions, giving 71 functional devices from 84 (84.5% yield). A matched 2 × 2 factorial ANOVA identifies vacuum conditioning as the dominant factor for EQE (partial η2 = 0.90), with a smaller but significant PVP contribution (p = 0.006) and a significant PVP × vacuum interaction for maximum luminance (p","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c13884","c":"通用技术/材料工程/纳米工程","a":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿纳米LED","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"加工引起的界面损耗限制了钙钛矿纳米晶发光二极管（PeLEDs）在显示相关器件面积上的性能，但相关工艺步骤很少在冠军器件报道之外获得统计置信的识别。研究将全无机CsPbBr3发光层与28 mm²有源区的重复因子设计研究相结合。采用苯丙胺（PPA）封端的纳米晶经室温改进配体辅助再沉淀法（MLARP）合成，以两步旋涂成膜并用约2.8 nm聚乙烯吡咯烷酮（PVP）中间层分隔，顶层沉积前进行温和真空处理。十三个架构中七个在两次制备中重复，获得84个器件中71个功能器件（84.5%良率），并通过2×2因子方差分析识别关键工艺因素，实现大面积高亮度。","kp":["有源区面积: 28 mm2","发光层: 全无机CsPbBr3钙钛矿纳米晶","配体: 苯丙胺(PPA)封端","合成方法: 室温改进配体辅助再沉淀法(MLARP)","研究方法: 复制因子设计统计研究"]},{"t":"催化分子内SNAr合成大尺寸与中等尺寸杂联芳基阻转异构环及阻转肽","b":"ABSTRACT We report the first examples of catalytic, intramolecular N‐heterocycle arylation by nucleophilic aromatic substitution (S N Ar), a general method for synthesis of highly strained macrocycles and medium‐sized heterobiaryl atropisomeric rings. Key to the approach is the ability to generate a strong base catalytically, as the desired cyclizations can be problematic under non‐catalytic conditions. Substitution reactions catalyzed by Brønsted bases often suffer from poor turnover because leaving groups are poorly basic. We put forth a process in which base regeneration does not depend on p K a considerations, but on reaction of a fluoride catalyst (Lewis base) with an organosilane (base‐embedding electrophile). Our protocol is amenable to an unprecedented broad range of heterocycles and highly functionalized and sterically hindered fluoroarenes. Despite ring strain, direct formation of C─N stereogenic axis can be carried out with linear substrates unbiased for cyclization and with tryptophan‐containing peptides. We provide synthesis of drug‐like cyclic and atropisomeric molecules which are elusive in medicinal chemistry screenings, as well as a direct macrocyclization route toward stereochemically and structurally diverse atropopeptides, molecules inspired by bioactive and naturally occurring ribosomally synthesized post‐translationally modified peptides (RiPPs). This work establishes a unique disconnection toward cyclic heterobiaryl molecules and catalysis that is to unlock other transformations.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.8290035","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"SNAr催化合成","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究首次报道了通过分子内SNAr（芳香亲核取代）实现催化N-杂环芳基化的通用方法，可用于合成高张力大环和中等尺寸杂联芳基阻转异构环及阻转肽。方法关键在于催化生成强碱，因为在非催化条件下所需环化反应存在困难。布朗斯特碱催化的取代反应常因离去基团碱性差导致转化率低，该方案中碱的再生不依赖pKa，而是依靠氟离子催化剂（路易斯碱）与有机硅烷（载碱亲电体）的反应。该协议适用范围广泛，涵盖多种杂环底物。","kp":["合成方法[大环与中环杂联芳基阻转异构体]: 首例催化分子内N-杂环芳基化SNAr反应","反应关键[催化体系]: 催化生成强碱以实现高张力环化"]},{"t":"将NifEN支架功能增益工程化为自组装固氮酶","b":"ABSTRACT Biological nitrogen fixation by Mo‐nitrogenase is a complex process requiring coordinated electron transfer through specialized metal clusters. NifEN, an α 2 β 2 heterotetrameric homolog of the nitrogenase catalytic component NifDK, naturally serves as a maturation scaffold but exhibits only trace catalytic activity due to its “imperfect” cluster environments. In this study, we systematically engineered NifEN to reconstruct the structural features of NifDK, specifically targeting the P→M cluster electron relay and the active‐site M‐cluster environment. Specifically, we developed a series of variants, culminating in NifEN P/M_S2B , which incorporates a restored P‐cluster species and a refined M‐cluster coordination site and S2B‐associated belt region. Spectroscopic analysis confirmed the successful installation of the target clusters. Moreover, activity assays and nanoSIMS analysis demonstrated that NifEN P/M_S2B supported ATP‐dependent N 2 reduction both in vitro and in vivo. Structural modeling further identified remaining catalytic bottlenecks, particularly those in the S3A and S5A regions, highlighting the importance of precise cofactor belt organization for substrate reduction. Together, these findings establish NifEN as a self‐assembling, catalytically competent nitrogenase scaffold that bypasses the need for complex cofactor transfer steps, providing a streamlined platform for mechanistic studies and engineering efforts of biological nitrogen fixation.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.8683437","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固氮酶工程","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Mo-固氮酶的生物固氮是需要通过特化金属簇协调电子转移的复杂过程。NifEN是固氮酶催化组分NifDK的α2β2异源四聚体同源物，通常作为成熟支架，但因簇环境不完善仅表现出微量催化活性。研究系统改造NifEN以重建NifDK的结构特征，针对P→M簇电子传递链和活性位点M簇环境，构建了一系列变体，最终获得NifEN P/M_S2B，其恢复了P簇物种并优化了M簇配位位点及S2B相关带区。光谱分析证实了簇结构的重建，实现自组装固氮酶的功能增益。","kp":["NifEN催化活性[天然状态]: 仅痕量","NifEN结构[与NifDK关系]: α2β2四聚体同源物、成熟支架","工程策略[自组装固氮酶]: 重构NifDK结构特征，靶向P簇位点"]},{"t":"双齿膦酸酯桥接实现埋底界面重构，打造热机械稳健的Sn–Pb钙钛矿太阳能电池","b":"ABSTRACT Tin–lead (Sn–Pb) mixed perovskite solar cells (PSCs) are promising for high‐efficiency tandem photovoltaics. However, substantial temperature fluctuations during device operation generate mechanical stresses that, coupled with insufficient adhesion at the perovskite/hole transport layer (HTL) interface, induce perovskite cracking and interfacial delamination. These structural degradations hinder efficient hole extraction and compromise long‐term device stability. In this study, we introduce 1,2‐ethylenediphosphonic acid (EDPA) as an interfacial molecular bridge to reconstruct the contact interface between the perovskite and HTL. The terminal phosphonic acid groups of EDPA simultaneously anchored to poly(3,4‐ethylenedioxythiophene)(styrenesulfonate) (PEDOT:PSS) and coordinated with B‐site metal ions in the perovskite, enhancing interfacial adhesion and generating pre‐compressive stress during film formation, effectively counteracting thermally induced tensile stress during device operation. Concurrently, EDPA disrupts the intrinsic electrostatic interactions within HTL via hydrogen‐bonding interactions, facilitating the segregation of insulating PSS chains, exposing the conductive PEDOT network, and reconstructing a more efficient hole‑extraction interface. Given these synergistic mechanical and electrical enhancements, the optimized PSC achieves a 23.96% power conversion efficiency (PCE), retaining 90.4% of its initial efficiency after 1200 h of thermal cycling (25°C–85°C). This study establishes a buried‐interface reconstruction strategy for realizing thermomechanically robust Sn–Pb perovskite photovoltaics under practical operating conditions.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7907592","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池界面稳定","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"锡铅（Sn-Pb）混合钙钛矿太阳能电池在高效率叠层光伏中前景广阔，但器件运行中的大幅温度波动产生机械应力，叠加钙钛矿/空穴传输层（HTL）界面粘附不足，导致钙钛矿开裂和界面分层，阻碍空穴提取并损害长期稳定性。研究引入1,2-乙二膦酸（EDPA）作为界面分子桥重构钙钛矿与HTL的接触界面。EDPA末端膦酸基团同时锚定PEDOT:PSS并与钙钛矿配位，实现埋底界面重构，提升热机械稳健性，改善空穴提取并延长器件寿命。","kp":["界面工程方法[Sn–Pb钙钛矿/HTL埋底界面]: 双齿膦酸酯桥接重构","目标特性[Sn–Pb PSC]: 热机械稳健、抗裂纹与界面分层"]},{"t":"糖肽癌症疫苗中糖苷键的单原子O/S/Se取代揭示差异化性能","b":"ABSTRACT Single‐atom substitution provides an exceptionally subtle means of editing molecular structure, yet how such minimal atom‐level modifications propagate into biological function remains poorly understood. Here, we report streamlined access to Se ‐linked Tn glycopeptides which, together with their O ‐ and S ‐linked counterparts, enable systematic atom‐level editing at the glycosidic linkage of MUC1 glycopeptide antigens. Surface plasmon resonance established a clear hierarchy of antigen recognition that was rationalized by molecular dynamics simulations and independently validated by STD‐NMR epitope mapping, revealing that O→S→Se substitution subtly remodels glycopeptide presentation while preserving the overall 5E5 recognition epitope. Translation of these structurally defined antigens into CRM 197 glycoconjugate vaccines with comparable antigen loading showed that neither antigen‐binding affinity nor antibody levels alone predict therapeutic efficacy. Instead, the results demonstrate that minimal atom‐level editing propagates from molecular recognition to biological function through a nonlinear structure–function relationship, highlighting that therapeutic efficacy cannot be inferred directly from antigen affinity alone.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.8540595","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"糖肽癌症疫苗设计","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"单原子取代是编辑分子结构的极精细手段，但此类微小原子级修饰如何传递到生物功能尚不清楚。研究建立了硒连接Tn糖肽的高效合成路线，与O连接和S连接对应物一起，实现MUC1糖肽抗原糖苷键处的系统性原子级编辑。表面等离子共振建立了清晰的抗原识别层级，并通过分子动力学模拟合理解释，经STD-NMR表位作图独立验证：O→S→Se取代微妙地重塑糖肽构象展示，同时保留5E5抗体的整体识别表位。这些结构明确的抗体进一步展示了差异化功能。","kp":["修饰策略[MUC1糖肽疫苗糖苷键]: 单原子O/S/Se取代编辑","表征手段[抗原结合]: 表面等离子体共振建立抗原识别等级差异"]},{"t":"原位时间分辨研究揭示氧化石墨烯在金纳米颗粒成核与生长中的作用","b":"ABSTRACT Understanding nanoparticle growth in complex composite systems remains a central challenge in materials chemistry. Herein, we elucidate the stepwise formation mechanism of gold nanoparticles (AuNPs) in graphene oxide (GO) aqueous systems under well‐defined reductive conditions. Pulse radiolysis reveals that GO significantly accelerates AuCl 4 − reduction by hydrated electrons ( e aq − ), thereby altering early‐stage kinetics. Operando synchrotron small‐angle x‐ray scattering (SAXS) and time‐resolved UV–vis absorption spectroscopy enable direct observation of AuNP nucleation and growth. Au(III) reduction precedes GO reduction, and nascent Au clusters preferentially anchor at GO edges through interactions with carboxyl groups, resulting in anisotropic, size‐constrained growth. As GO becomes progressively reduced, depletion of oxygen‐containing functional groups weakens interfacial stabilization and promotes nanoparticle coalescence. This stepwise mechanism integrates kinetic, spectroscopic, structural, and theoretical evidence, identifying GO as both a kinetic modulator and a spatial growth regulator. The insights provide general design principles for size‐controlled nanoparticle growth in graphene‐based composite systems.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.6455772","c":"通用技术/材料工程/纳米工程","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金纳米颗粒成核生长","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究阐明了在明确还原条件下氧化石墨烯（GO）水体系中金纳米粒子（AuNPs）的逐步形成机制。脉冲辐解揭示GO通过水合电子显著加速AuCl4⁻的还原，改变早期动力学；原位同步辐射小角X射线散射（SAXS）和时间分辨紫外-可见吸收光谱直接观察了AuNPs的成核与生长。Au(III)的还原先于GO的还原，新生Au簇通过与羧基的相互作用优先锚定在GO边缘，导致各向异性、尺寸受限的生长。研究揭示了GO在金纳米颗粒成核与生长中的关键作用。","kp":["生长机制[AuNPs/氧化石墨烯水体系]: GO加速水合电子还原AuCl4−，改变成核早期动力学","表征手段[AuNP形成过程]: 脉冲辐解+原位同步辐射SAXS"]},{"t":"具有宏观定向载流子迁移的Janus共价有机框架薄膜用于可切换气体传感","b":"ABSTRACT Macroscopic directional migration of photogenerated carriers in covalent organic framework (COF)‐based heterojunction films is typically hindered by random carrier diffusion and interfacial structural disorder. In this study, we report for the first time the construction of sequence‐controlled Janus COF films from lattice‐matched isoreticular COFs (COF‐366/COF‐366‐OH). The intimate interfacial assembly and the energy‐level offset induce a built‐in electric field that drives electrons and holes to migrate directionally toward opposite sides across the entire film. This asymmetric charge distribution endows the two sides of the film with distinct redox activities, enabling switchable and highly sensitive detection of both oxidizing and reducing gases by simply flipping the film. Such a unique feature is unprecedented for a single film. Moreover, the response of Janus COF film surpasses that of single‐component counterparts by 5.2‐fold for NO 2 and 5.3‐fold for NH 3 . This work offers a general strategy for macroscopic directional carrier migration in COF films and paves a new route for advanced sensing materials.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2808034","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/传感器","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF薄膜气体传感","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"COF异质结薄膜中光生载流子的宏观定向迁移通常受载流子随机扩散和界面结构无序的阻碍。研究首次报道了由晶格匹配的同网状COF（COF-366/COF-366-OH）构筑的序列可控Janus COF薄膜。紧密的界面组装与能级偏移诱导内建电场，驱动电子和空穴在整个薄膜内定向迁移至相对两侧。这种不对称电荷分布赋予薄膜两侧不同的氧化还原活性，通过简单翻转薄膜即可实现对氧化性和还原性气体的可切换、高灵敏检测，展示了Janus COF薄膜在气体传感中的应用潜力。","kp":["薄膜结构[Janus COF]: 首次由晶格匹配COF-366/COF-366-OH序列控制构筑","载流子迁移机制[异质结薄膜]: 能级差诱导内建电场驱动定向迁移","应用[COF薄膜]: 可切换气体传感"]},{"t":"超越物理保护范式：表面键合分子集成实现耐用高电压LiCoO2","b":"ABSTRACT High‐voltage LiCoO 2 (LCO) is promising for high‐energy lithium metal batteries, yet raising charge cut‐off voltage above 4.5 V is essential to fully unlocking its high‐specific‐energy potential. However, deep delithiation triggers irreversible phase transitions and detrimental interfacial side reactions that originate from intrinsically vulnerable LCO surface. Herein, we propose the surface‐bonded molecular integration (SMI) paradigm to reconstruct LCO surface through multi‐site interactions, endowing it with exceptional electrochemical activity and structural robustness. A rational optimization scheme identifies mono‐lithiated creatinol phosphate (CPLi) as the optimal molecule. Driven by Lewis acid‐base interactions, CPLi precisely anchors onto coordinatively unsaturated Co 3+ sites through phosphate O and guanidine N, forming a chemically bonded, structurally dense interfacial integration featuring Co−O−P and Co−N linkages. Unique spatial configuration and modulated electronic structure of surface‐bonded CPLi ensure rapid Li + transport and desirable cathode electrolyte interphase. Consequently, Li||LCO‐CPLi cells deliver outstanding durability and reversibility at 4.6 V, retaining 84.5% capacity after 1000 cycles (2 C), with 85.6% capacity recovery upon switching back to 0.2 C following 2000 cycles (2 C). Encouragingly, ∼100 mAh g −1 is sustained after 2800 cycles (2 C) and 2500 cycles (10 C), underscoring superior cycling longevity. Collectively, SMI‐paradigm provides fresh insights for advanced interfacial engineering of high‐voltage cathodes.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.5600863","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/锂电","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压钴酸锂表面改性","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"高电压钴酸锂（LCO）是高能量密度锂金属电池的重要正极材料，但需将充电截止电压提升至4.5 V以上才能充分释放其比能量潜力。深度脱锂会引发不可逆相变和界面副反应，其根源在于LCO表面本征脆弱。本研究提出表面键合分子集成（SMI）范式，通过多位点相互作用重构LCO表面，赋予其优异的电化学活性和结构稳定性。经合理优化筛选，确定单锂化肌醇磷酸（CPLi）为最优分子，其在Lewis酸碱相互作用驱动下可精确锚定于配位不饱和的Co3+位点。","kp":["充电截止电压[高比能LiCoO2]: >4.5 V","表面重构策略[高压LCO]: 表面键合分子集成(SMI)多位点相互作用"]},{"t":"结构最简的环手性单体中的氢键编码实现展示超分子异构的大空腔组装","b":"ABSTRACT Large, well‐defined molecular cavities are typically constructed from rigid covalent scaffolds, which can limit structural adaptability and increase synthetic complexity. Here, we introduce a hydrogen‐bond encoded supramolecular strategy that enables structurally minimal, flexible monomers to assemble into discrete fullerene‐binding capsules. The monomer combines intra‐ and intermolecular hydrogen‐bonding motifs that restrict conformational freedom, induce cyclochirality, and guide controlled self‐assembly into oligomeric or cyclic aggregates. Spectroscopic and crystallographic analyses show that guest‐induced self‐sorting with fullerenes drives the formation of homochiral tetrameric capsules with high binding affinity and distinct structural isomerism. X‐ray structures confirm compact host–guest complexes stabilized by cooperative hydrogen bonding and C─H···π interactions. This work demonstrates that minimal monomer design can encode complex supramolecular behaviour, providing an adaptive platform for molecular recognition, catalysis, and materials science.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1587126","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分子空腔自组装","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"传统大尺寸、结构明确的分子空腔通常依赖刚性共价骨架构建，结构适应性受限且合成复杂。本研究提出氢键编码的超分子策略，使结构最简的柔性单体自组装成可结合富勒烯的离散胶囊。该单体同时含有分子内和分子间氢键基序，可限制构象自由度、诱导环手性，并引导其受控自组装为寡聚或环状聚集体。光谱与晶体学分析表明，富勒烯客体诱导的自分类驱动形成同手性四聚体胶囊，具有高结合亲和力和独特的结构异构现象，X射线结构证实了组装体结构。","kp":["组装策略[大空腔超分子胶囊]: 氢键编码、结构最简柔性单体自组装","单体特征[环手性]: 分子内/间氢键限制构象自由并诱导环手性"]},{"t":"调控局部阴离子化学亲和性实现双电解质全固态电池中稳定的卤化物–硫化物界面与快速离子传输","b":"ABSTRACT All‐solid‐state batteries (ASSBs) employing halide/sulfide bilayer electrolytes offer a promising route toward high energy density by combining the high oxidative stability of halides with the superior reductive stability of sulfides. However, severe halide–sulfide interfacial incompatibility induces continuous interfacial degradation and undermines Li + transport. Unlike conventional interfacial engineering approaches that rely on coatings or artificial buffer layers, we report a local chemistry–driven intrinsic compatibility strategy that fundamentally stabilizes halide–sulfide interfaces. By sulfurizing amorphous halide electrolytes Li 2 O–TaCl 5 , the short‐range coordination chemistry and medium‐range topology are simultaneously reconstructed, in which sulfur‐rich local motifs become thermodynamically more resistant to further sulfur substitution, whereas sulfur‐containing medium‐range networks exhibit stronger binding with PS 4 units in Li 6 PS 5 Cl, thereby intrinsically stabilizing the halide–sulfide interface and suppressing interfacial decomposition. Simultaneously, the sulfurized framework exhibits enhanced structural heterogeneity and interconnected Li + migration pathways, achieving an ultrahigh ionic conductivity of 14.2 mS cm −1 . As a result, the assembled NCM89|8S‐LTOC|LPSC|Li‐In ASSBs exhibit outstanding electrochemical performance from −50°C to 100°C, including 131 mAh g −1 at −50°C, 2000‐cycle stability at 15 C, and high areal capacities up to 21.7 mAh cm −2 . This work highlights local anion chemistry regulation as an effective strategy for developing robust halide–sulfide ASSBs.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.5372994","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/固态电池","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电池卤化物界面","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"采用卤化物/硫化物双层电解质的全固态电池可结合卤化物的高氧化稳定性与硫化物的高还原稳定性，是实现高能量密度的可行途径，但卤化物–硫化物界面严重不相容导致界面持续退化并阻碍锂离子传输。不同于依赖包覆层或人工缓冲层的传统界面工程，本研究提出基于局部化学的本征相容性策略：对非晶卤化物电解质Li2O–TaCl5进行硫化处理，同时重构其短程配位化学与中程拓扑结构，富硫局部基序从根本上稳定了卤化物–硫化物界面并实现快速离子传输。","kp":["电解质构型[全固态电池]: 卤化物/硫化物双层电解质","卤化物优势[氧化稳定性]: 高","硫化物优势[还原稳定性]: 优","界面策略[卤化物–硫化物界面]: 局部阴离子化学亲和性调控，无需涂层/缓冲层"]},{"t":"精细调控催化剂活性位点以获得先进超高熔点聚烯烃","b":"ABSTRACT Polyolefins with melting temperatures above 200°C are rare, as their synthesis typically relies on the polymerization of highly sterically congested α‐olefins, which is challenging for both industrial Ziegler–Natta and homogeneous catalysts. Pyridylamido‐Hf complexes are molecular catalysts known for their high activity and ability to incorporate sterically demanding monomers, for example, allyltrimethylsilane (ATMS) giving isotactic poly(allyltrimethylsilane) with a melting temperature of 310°C and high turnover frequency. However, they are unable to polymerize efficiently monomers such as vinylcyclohexane (VCH) or 4,4‐dimethyl‐1‐pentene (44DMP). In this study, we report a novel synthetic strategy that enables the polymerization of such sterically challenging monomers, based on a pre‐activation of the Hf catalyst by using ATMS as ligand modifier in situ. We show that ATMS acts as an effective pre‐activator of the Hf complex, enabling controlled formation of highly active species and unlocking the polymerization of sterically demanding α‐olefins. This afforded the first synthesis of isotactic poly(4,4‐dimethyl‐1‐pentene) with an unprecedented melting temperature of 420°C, and efficient polymerization of VCH and 3‐methyl‐1‐butene. These findings demonstrate how the tuning of the pyridylamido‐Hf active species through rational choice of the activating monomer can be leveraged to expand the access to ultrahigh melting temperature polyolefins.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.9519061","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源加工/有机物/大宗化工产品/塑料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熔点聚烯烃催化","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"熔点超过200°C的聚烯烃极为罕见，其合成通常依赖高位阻α-烯烃的聚合，对工业Ziegler–Natta催化剂和均相催化剂均具挑战性。吡啶基酰胺-Hf配合物是已知的高活性分子催化剂，能高效聚合位阻大的单体，如可将烯丙基三甲基硅烷（ATMS）聚合成熔点310°C、转换频率高的等规聚（烯丙基三甲基硅烷），但无法高效聚合乙烯基环己烷（VCH）和4,4-二甲基-1-戊烯（44DMP）等单体。本研究报道了一种新型合成策略，实现了此类高位阻单体的聚合。","kp":["熔点[先进超高熔点聚烯烃]: >200°C","催化剂[高活性聚合]: 吡啶胺-Hf配合物","单体示例[位阻烯烃聚合]: 烯丙基三甲基硅烷(ATMS)合成等规聚(ATMS)"]},{"t":"再生优化的化学吸附剂：评估用于大气取水的混合配位网络","b":"ABSTRACT Atmospheric water harvesting (AWH) can be enabled by solid desiccants that exhibit S‐shaped adsorption isotherms with one or more steps at low relative humidity (RH, SIFSIX‐3‐Ni family of hybrid coordination networks (HCNs) and a new, related family of HCNs, reveals a shared cooperative chemisorption mechanism with markedly different RH thresholds and regeneration requirements. Whereas the SIFSIX‐3‐Ni family operates outside the RH and regeneration limits of ROSs, four M′FSIX‐25‐M analogues (M = Co 2+ , Ni 2+ ; M' = Si 4+ , Ti 4+ , 25 = 1,4‐bis(imidazol‐1‐yl)naphthalene) exhibit both low‐RH chemisorption and regeneration from 34‐44°C. The lead regeneration optimized chemisorbent, ROC‐1 ( TIFSIX‐25‐Ni ), has a projected water‐harvesting productivity of ca. 3.5 L sorbent −1 d −1 . Density functional theory calculations provide insight into the energetics and mechanism of hydration/dehydration in these first‐generation ROCs. This work establishes ROCs as a new class of desiccants that offers reversible chemisorption within the low‐RH and mild‐regeneration conditions relevant to AWH in arid environments.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.6095254","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/隔离材料（膜材料/密封材料）","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"大气取水吸附剂","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"大气取水（AWH）依赖于在低相对湿度（RH）下呈S形吸附等温线的固体吸附剂。本研究对SIFSIX-3-Ni系列混合配位网络（HCNs）及一个新相关HCN家族进行评估，揭示其共享的协同化学吸附机制，但RH阈值和再生要求差异显著。SIFSIX-3-Ni家族的运行超出所需RH和再生温度范围，而四种M′FSIX-25-M类似物（M=Co2+、Ni2+；M′=Si4+、Ti4+）兼具低RH化学吸附和34–44°C低温再生能力。最优再生优化化学吸附剂ROC-1（TIFSIX-25-Ni）的预计取水产率约为3.5 L·(吸附剂·天)⁻¹。","kp":["吸附机制[SIFSIX-3-Ni/HCNs]: 共享协同化学吸附机制","吸附等温线[固体干燥剂]: S形多台阶低压相对湿度吸附","再生特性[M′FSIX-25-M]: 再生阈值低于SIFSIX-3-Ni族"]},{"t":"环糊精导向的动态多金属氧酸盐准轮烷组装","b":"ABSTRACT Cyclodextrins (CDs) are widely used as host molecules in supramolecular chemistry, yet their capacity to actively direct structural reorganization of inorganic clusters remains largely unexplored. Here, we demonstrate that α ‐CD can direct inorganic cluster reorganization during self‐assembly, enabling the synthesis of previously inaccessible azobenzene‐functionalized polyoxometalate (POM) pseudo‐rotaxanes, in which the macrocycle not only encapsulates the organic axle but also governs the structural evolution of the inorganic core. Upon complexation with α ‐CD, a flat arsonate‐functionalized {Mo 6 } cluster reorganizes into a bent analogue, yielding a dynamic pseudo ‐rotaxane assembly ( 1a @ α ‐CD). Fine pH modulation subsequently induces a CD‐mediated transformation into an inverted‐Keggin {Mo 12 } pseudo ‐rotaxane threaded by four α ‐CD units. NMR/ITC titration, DOSY/NOESY analyses, and single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction collectively reveal dual threading pathways and delineate the dynamic {Mo 6 } to {Mo 12 } reorganization process. Crucially, α ‐CD suppresses precipitation of hydrophobic ligands under strongly acidic conditions and stabilizes transient coordination states, thereby enabling cluster growth pathways inaccessible under identical synthetic conditions in the absence of α ‐CD. These findings demonstrate that CDs can actively direct inorganic self‐assembly through host‐guest interactions, providing a supramolecular route to previously inaccessible POM pseudo ‐rotaxanes and opening new opportunities for adaptive hybrid architectures.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.9362433","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多金属氧酸盐准轮烷","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"环糊精（CD）是超分子化学中广泛使用的主体分子，但其主动引导无机簇结构重组的能力尚少探索。本研究证明α-CD可在自组装过程中引导无机簇重组，合成出以往难以获得的偶氮苯功能化多金属氧酸盐（POM）准轮烷，其中大环不仅包封有机轴，还主导无机核心的结构演化。与α-CD配位后，平坦的砷酸根功能化{Mo6}簇重组为弯曲类似物，形成动态准轮烷组装体（1a@α-CD）；进一步精细调节pH可诱导CD介导的转化，生成反式组装结构。","kp":["α-环糊精[自组装过程]: 引导无机簇结构重组","合成策略[准轮烷]: 实现偶氮苯功能化多金属氧酸盐准轮烷","宿主作用[α-CD]: 包封有机轴并主导超分子组装"]},{"t":"通过熵工程Cd0.5Zn0.5Sb Zintl相中的Cu掺杂解锁高性能无碲p型热电材料","b":"ABSTRACT Zintl phases are crucial for Te‐free power generation and electrical cooling modules, which are considered next‐generation thermoelectric (TE) technology. While n‐type Zintl materials, such as Mg 3 Sb 2 , have achieved remarkable performance, their p‐type counterparts are restricted by electron‐phonon coupling. This work demonstrates a cost‐effective p‐type CdSb‐based Zintl material with high TE performance. We find that applying entropy engineering can sharply enhance the solid solubility of Cu in CdSb. Cu doping in entropy‐engineered Cd 0.5 Zn 0.5 Sb raises carrier concentration. More importantly, Cu boosts carrier mobility to about 222 cm 2 V −1 s −1 by screening ionized impurity scattering and enhancing covalent bonding across the cleavage plane along the [1 0 0] direction. Additionally, Cu doping induces dislocation scattering and lattice softening, significantly reducing lattice thermal conductivity. As a result, the Cd 0.46 Cu 0.04 Zn 0.5 Sb material achieves a high ZT of 1.5 at 573 K. Its high performance is verified by integrated TE devices. This work validates Cd 1− x Zn x Sb Zintl phases as highly efficient p‐type TE materials for practical applications.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7271276","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/导热/耐热材料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无碲热电材料","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"Zintl相是无碲热电器件的关键材料。n型Zintl材料（如Mg3Sb2）性能优异，但p型材料受电子-声子耦合限制。本研究开发了高性能、低成本的p型CdSb基Zintl热电材料。研究发现熵工程可显著提高Cu在CdSb中的固溶度；在熵工程化的Cd0.5Zn0.5Sb中掺杂Cu提高了载流子浓度，更重要的是，Cu通过屏蔽电离杂质散射并增强[100]方向解理面上的共价键合，将载流子迁移率提升至约222 cm²V⁻¹s⁻¹，从而获得优异的热电性能。","kp":["热电材料[无碲p型]: Cd₀.₅Zn₀.₅Sb Zintl相基CdSb材料","改性策略[CdSb基Zintl]: 熵工程+Cu掺杂提升固溶度并解锁高性能","掺杂元素[Cd₀.₅Zn₀.₅Sb]: Cu掺杂"]},{"t":"真空诱导Mn–Ce氧化物表面重构实现低温耦合氧化还原催化","b":"ABSTRACT Low‐temperature redox catalysis over mixed oxides is typically optimized by tuning bulk composition, yet the decisive chemistry occurs at the surface and subsurface interface. Here, we show that this interface can be deliberately reconstructed to enhance Mn–Ce oxide catalysis. Sequential vacuum annealing followed by reduced‐pressure O 2 treatment induces near‐surface Mn enrichment in an as‐prepared Mn–Ce oxide while largely preserving the fluorite CeO 2 framework. This reconstruction increases the near‐surface abundance of Mn‐containing species, modifies the Mn–Ce–O interfacial electronic and redox environment, and facilitates oxygen activation and redox cycling. Under coupled conditions, R‐MnCe achieved 95.5% NO x conversion at 100°C and complete chlorobenzene conversion at 200°C. In situ spectroscopy and DFT calculations reveal that interfacial electron redistribution lowers the oxygen activation barrier and sustains activated oxygen species that connect NH 3 ‐SCR and chlorobenzene oxidation through a shared oxygen‐mediated pathway. These results highlight near‐surface reconstruction as a promising postsynthetic strategy for improving noble‐metal‐free mixed‐oxide catalysts.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2739215","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Mn-Ce氧化催化","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"混合氧化物低温氧化还原催化通常通过调节体相组成优化，但决定性化学过程发生在表面与次表面界面。本研究通过对Mn–Ce氧化物进行先真空退火、后低压O2处理的顺序处理，在基本保持萤石CeO2骨架的同时诱导近表面Mn富集。该重构提高了近表面含锰物种的丰度，改变了Mn–Ce–O界面的电子与氧化还原环境，促进氧活化和氧化还原循环。在耦合条件下，重构催化剂R-MnCe在100°C下实现95.5%的NOx转化率，并在200°C下实现氯苯的完全转化。","kp":["制备工艺[Mn-Ce氧化物]: 真空退火+减压O₂顺序处理诱导表面重构","重构效果[近表面]: Mn富集且基本保持萤石CeO₂骨架","催化性能[Mn-Ce氧化物]: 实现低温耦合氧化还原催化"]},{"t":"利用分子马达实现布朗旋转的光门控控制","b":"ABSTRACT Controlling stochastic molecular motion in a predictable manner remains a major challenge in the development of functional molecular systems. Here we demonstrate that a light‐driven molecular motor can reversibly regulate Brownian rotation through remote steric interactions. We integrate an overcrowded alkene motor within a rigid triptycene scaffold, where it acts as a reversible steric gate for an alkynyl‐linked anthracene rotor. Photoisomerization modulates the steric environment around the rotor axis, switching the system between fast Brownian rotation and a sterically hindered regime. Variable‐temperature NMR spectroscopy reveals that one thermodynamically stable motor state exhibits rapid Brownian rotation of the anthracene unit about the alkynyl C─C≡C─C axis, whereas the other stable state displays hindered rotation, giving rise to two distinct rotameric states at low temperature. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations reproduce this behavior and show that the rotational barrier changes by 31 kJ mol −1 between the two states, corresponding to an approximately five‐order‐of‐magnitude difference in the calculated rotational rates at 20 °C. These results demonstrate that light‐driven molecular motors can reversibly regulate stochastic molecular motion through steric control, providing a general strategy for coupling directional and Brownian dynamics within a single molecular system.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7061287","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光控分子马达","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"以可预测方式控制分子随机运动是功能分子系统发展的重大挑战。本研究展示了一种光驱动分子马达可通过远程空间位阻相互作用可逆调控布朗旋转。研究者将 overcrowded 烯烃马达集成于刚性三蝶烯骨架中，作为与炔基相连的蒽转子的可逆位阻门控。光异构化调节转子轴周围的空间环境，使体系在快速布朗旋转态和位阻受阻态之间切换。变温核磁共振谱显示，马达的一种热力学稳定状态下蒽单元绕炔基C─C≡C─C轴快速布朗旋转，另一种状态则旋转受阻，实现了对布朗旋转的光门控控制。","kp":["调控机制[布朗旋转]: 光驱动分子马达通过远程位阻作用可逆调控","结构设计[分子马达]: 拥挤烯烃马达嵌入刚性三蝶烯支架","门控方式[转子]: 光致异构化调制蒽转子周围位阻环境"]},{"t":"小分子调控TERRA RNA四链体重编程ALT端粒维持机制","b":"ABSTRACT Telomeric repeat–containing RNA (TERRA) plays a central role in telomere maintenance in telomerase‐negative cancers that employ the alternative lengthening of telomeres (ALT) pathway; however, its RNA G‐quadruplex (rG4) structures remain underexplored as chemical targets. Here, we report a structure‐guided approach to selectively modulate TERRA rG4 using an indoloquinoxaline‐based small‐molecule scaffold. Biophysical analyses confirm high‐affinity and selective binding, while NMR and computational studies identify terminal tetrad stacking as the dominant binding mode of the ligand to the TERRA rG4. Ligand engagement disrupts the TERRA–Telomeric Repeat‐Binding Factor 2 (TRF2) interaction (ELISA, EMSA) and alters TERRA abundance (qRT‐PCR). Transcriptomic (RNA‐seq) analysis reveals ligand‐induced differential expression of ALT‐associated genes and DNA metabolism pathways. In ALT‐positive U2OS cells, the ligand localizes to the nucleus, induces telomere‐associated DNA damage, and triggers S‐phase arrest and apoptosis. These findings establish TERRA rG4 as a chemically addressable structural element in ALT biology and demonstrate the potential of small molecules to probe and modulate long non‐coding RNA (lncRNA)‐mediated genome maintenance.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.2898522","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"TERRA端粒调控","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"端粒重复序列RNA（TERRA）在采用ALT端粒延长途径的端粒酶阴性癌细胞端粒维持中发挥核心作用，但其RNA G-四链体（rG4）结构作为化学靶点仍研究不足。本研究报道了基于吲哚喹喔啉小分子骨架、结构导向选择性调控TERRA rG4的方法。生物物理分析证实其高亲和力和选择性结合；核磁与计算研究表明末端四分体堆叠是配体与TERRA rG4的主要结合模式。配体结合可破坏TERRA–TRF2相互作用，改变TERRA丰度，转录组分析揭示了对ALT通路的广泛影响。","kp":["靶向策略[TERRA rG4]: 吲哚喹喔啉类小分子支架选择性调控","结合特性[小分子-TERRA rG4]: 高亲和力和高选择性结合","作用机制[ALT端粒维持]: 小分子重编程TERRA RNA四链体"]},{"t":"甲氧基导向的无锂一锅硼化反应构建四硼、吡啶氮和氨基氮集成PAHs，实现超窄带热活化延迟荧光","b":"ABSTRACT Doping multiple boron and other heteroatoms into polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons (PAHs) could induce the multiresonance effect and thus highly promising narrowband emitters, but their development is hindered by tricky synthesis. Here, we report the design and facile synthesis of a novel tetraboron–oxygen covalent bonds, nitrogen‐integrated PAH (QBO‐1) and its derivative with an additional pyridinic nitrogen doping (QBO‐Py) using the same methoxy‐directed, lithium‐free one‐shot borylation route on a gram scale. Both QBO‐1 and QBO‐Py emitters exhibit ultra‐narrowband violet emission with full width at half‐maximum (FWHM) values of 7.4 and 8.6 nm in toluene and 9.5 and 11.2 nm in organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs), respectively. The electroluminescent results of QBO‐1 represents the narrowest reported for organic systems in terms of in nanometers. Moreover, the strategically replacing the benzene‐core in QBO‐1 with a pyridine in QBO‐Py substantially reduced singlet‐triplet energy gap, thereby enabling QBO‐Py with evident thermally activated delayed fluorescence properties and leading to high external quantum efficiency of 14.5% in OLEDs. This work pioneers the integration of pyridinic nitrogen in multi‐boron PAHs, demonstrating its key role in simultaneously tuning the energy gap and suppressing spectral broadening, thus providing a new design route for high‐purity, high‐efficiency OLED emitters.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.8471593","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼掺杂PAH合成","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"在多环芳烃（PAHs）中掺杂多个硼及其他杂原子可产生多共振效应，获得极具前景的窄带发射体，但其合成困难制约发展。本研究报道采用甲氧基导向、无锂的一锅硼化路线，克级规模简便合成了新型四硼-氧键、氮集成PAH（QBO-1）及额外吡啶氮掺杂的衍生物（QBO-Py）。两种发射体均表现出超窄带紫光发射：在甲苯中半峰宽分别为7.4和8.6 nm，在OLED器件中分别为9.5和11.2 nm，QBO-1的电致发光结果代表了热活化延迟荧光的优异性能。","kp":["合成路线[硼化PAHs]: 甲氧基导向、无锂一锅硼化反应","分子结构[QBO-1]: 四硼-氧共价键+氮集成PAH","衍生物[QBO-Py]: 额外引入吡啶氮掺杂","发光性能[QBO系列]: 多共振效应实现超窄带热活化延迟荧光"]},{"t":"谷氧还蛋白快速还原谷氨酸过硫化物与多硫化物","b":"ABSTRACT Hydropersulfides have gained attention as excellent biochemical nucleophiles and membrane‐protective radical scavengers. They form perthiyl radicals, which terminate radical chain reactions through self‐recombination, yielding polysulfides. It is currently unknown exactly how polysulfides are subsequently reduced. Using stopped–flow kinetic measurements in combination with mass spectrometry, we show that the model class I glutaredoxin from Plasmodium falciparum (PfGrx) rapidly reduces the polysulfides glutathione trisulfide (GS 3 G) and tetrasulfide (GS 4 G), yielding glutathionylated PfGrx and the corresponding glutathione hydropersulfide (GSSH) and hydrotrisulfide (GS 3 H). The second‐order rate constants of these reductions ≥10 7 M −1 s −1 are even slightly higher than for glutathione disulfide (GSSG). In contrast, PfGrx was inactive or only moderately active toward cystine or cysteine trisulfide. GSSH and GS 3 H are further reduced by PfGrx with second‐order rate constants on the order of 10 6− 10 7 M −1 s −1 , yielding glutathionylated PfGrx and hydrogen sulfide (H 2 S) or hydrogen disulfide (H 2 S 2 ), respectively. Thus, glutaredoxins specifically recognize the glutathione moiety of glutathione (hydro)per/polysulfides. Since reduced glutathione (GSH) rapidly reduces glutathionylated glutaredoxins, glutathione (hydro)per/polysulfides are efficiently converted to GSSG and H 2 S or the corresponding hydrogen polysulfides. As a consequence, the steady‐state concentration of glutathione (hydro)per/polysulfides should be tightly controlled in subcellular compartments containing active glutaredoxins and high GSH concentrations.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1222129","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"谷氧还蛋白还原","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"过硫化氢因其优良的生化亲核性和膜保护自由基清除能力受到关注，其形成的过硫自由基通过自复合终止自由基链反应生成多硫化物，但多硫化物如何被还原尚不清楚。本研究结合停流动力学测量与质谱分析，发现恶性疟原虫I型谷氧还蛋白模型蛋白PfGrx可快速还原谷胱甘肽三硫化物（GS3G）和四硫化物（GS4G），生成谷胱甘肽化PfGrx及相应的GSSH和GS3H。其二级速率常数≥10⁷ M⁻¹s⁻¹，甚至略高于谷胱甘肽的还原速率。","kp":["还原底物[PfGrx]: 快速还原谷氨酸过硫化物与多硫化物","研究方法[反应动力学]: 停流动力学+质谱联用","生化意义[过硫化物]: 优良亲核试剂与膜保护性自由基清除剂"]},{"t":"给电子氨基硅烷桥接实现全彩色水性磷光纳米球的普适制备","b":"ABSTRACT The pursuit of a universal and efficient strategy for converting organic molecules into aqueous‐phase phosphorescent nanoparticles (PNPs) exhibiting prolonged afterglow and uniform morphology represents a persistent challenge in materials chemistry. In this study, we report a general in situ silanization platform that enables the integration of organic precursors into silica‐based matrices via an aminosilane‐mediated “bridge”, yielding monodisperse, size‐tunable (10∼320 nm) full‐color PNPs with emission spanning blue‐purple to red. Aminosilanes with electron‐donating characteristics not only promote an intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) state to enhance intersystem crossing (ISC) efficiency but also facilitate the encapsulation of silanized anhydride within silica frameworks (ASLs@SiO 2 ), effectively shielding the emitters from aqueous and oxygen quenching. Orthogonal screening across 14 anhydrides and 12 aminosilanes validated the strategy's universality, achieving full‐color afterglow with a maximum lifetime of 1128.07 ms and a quantum yield of 24.04%. Furthermore, to precisely control dispersion and size, two distinct ASLs@SiO 2 architectures were engineered: one embedding silanized anhydride within a concentric silica interlayer, and another infusing it into dendritic porous silica spheres. This scalable, low‐cost synthesis (∼$1 per 150 g) underscores the commercial viability of the approach and establishes a new approach for designing high‐performance aqueous‐phase PNPs.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7868412","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水性磷光纳米球","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"将有机分子普适、高效地转化为具有长余辉和均匀形貌的水相磷光纳米颗粒（PNPs）是材料化学的持久挑战。本研究报道一种通用原位硅烷化平台，通过氨基硅烷介导的\"桥\"将有机前驱体集成于硅基基质中，制备出单分散、尺寸可调（10~320 nm）的全色PNPs，发射覆盖蓝紫至红光。具有给电子特性的氨基硅烷不仅促进分子内电荷转移（ICT）态以增强系间窜越（ISC）效率，还促进硅烷化酸酐在硅框架内的封装，从而实现水相长余辉磷光。","kp":["制备平台[水性磷光纳米球]: 原位硅烷化通用平台","桥接机制[硅基基质]: 给电子氨基硅烷介导桥接","粒径调控[PNPs]: 10~320 nm，单分散可调","发射特性[PNPs]: 全彩色、长余辉水性磷光"]},{"t":"二维SnS2中间层实现空位引导的离子迁移，用于稳定扩散型忆阻器和仿生伤害感受","b":"ABSTRACT The realization of sophisticated autonomous interaction in humanoid robots is currently constrained by the complexity and stochasticity of conventional sensory hardware. Volatile memristors provide a promising biomimetic alternative; however, their performance is often limited by uncontrolled ionic dynamics in disordered oxides. Here, we report two‐dimensional SnS 2 interlayers as an effective platform for vacancy‐guided ion migration in oxide‐based diffusive memristors. A solution‐processed SnS 2 layer with tunable sulfur vacancy density is introduced into an Ag/TaO x /SnS 2 /ITO heterostructure to regulate filament formation. Under electrical bias, sulfur vacancies of SnS 2 layer locally enhance the electric field and provide deterministic pathways for Ag + migration. This enables atomic‐scale confinement of conductive filaments, resulting in highly uniform threshold switching (variability ≈ 10.9%), ultralow switching energy (∼ 10.9 pJ), and stable operation over 5,000 cycles. Furthermore, modulation of the vacancy landscape allows dynamic reconfiguration of switching polarity, enabling a transition from unidirectional to bidirectional volatile switching. Beyond improved electrical performance, the devices reproduce key nociceptive behaviors and can be integrated into an 8 × 8 crossbar array to achieve spatially resolved perception of mechanical stimuli.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.6605459","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩散型忆阻器","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"aip":1,"as":"人形机器人复杂自主交互受限于传统传感硬件的复杂性和随机性，易失性忆阻器提供了有前景的仿生替代方案，但无序氧化物中不受控的离子动力学限制其性能。本研究报道二维SnS2中间层作为氧化物扩散型忆阻器中空位引导离子迁移的有效平台。在Ag/TaOx/SnS2/ITO异质结构中引入可调硫空位密度的溶液法SnS2层以调控导电丝形成：电偏压下SnS2的硫空位局部增强电场，为Ag+迁移提供确定性路径，实现稳定的扩散型忆阻行为和仿生伤害感受功能。","kp":["中间层材料[氧化物忆阻器]: 二维SnS₂","工作机制[扩散型忆阻器]: 空位引导离子迁移","器件应用[忆阻器]: 稳定扩散动力学并实现仿生伤害感受器","器件类型[仿生硬件]: 易失性忆阻器替代传统传感硬件"]},{"t":"用于生物偶联的钌(CAAC-5)烯烃复分解催化剂","b":"ABSTRACT Olefin metathesis is a powerful transformation for carbon–carbon bond formation, yet its application in biological settings is challenged by the instability of most ruthenium catalysts in aqueous media. Herein, we report a Ru(CAAC‐5) olefin metathesis catalyst bearing a functional handle for bioconjugation. The resulting hybrid catalyst catalyzes ring‐closing metathesis (RCM) and displays extended lifetimes in aqueous media. Functionalized CAAC‐5 ligands bearing a protected aniline linker were prepared via enamine alkylation and coordinated to ruthenium to afford the corresponding Ru(CAAC‐5) complex. In a benchmark RCM reaction under biologically relevant conditions, the ruthenium complex exhibits enhanced catalytic robustness and reaches turnover numbers of up to 600. Deprotection of an amine‐functionalized handle enables the bioconjugation to proteins and peptides. Using this platform, the catalyst was anchored to biomolecules through supramolecular anchoring to human carbonic anhydrase II (hCA II), click conjugation to peptides (SS01), and covalent attachment to ubiquitin (Ubi). To the best of our knowledge, this aniline‐functionalized Ru(CAAC‐5) complex is the first CAAC‐bearing metathesis catalyst amenable to bioconjugation, while retaining the prolonged catalytic activity characteristic of CAAC‐based systems in aqueous media.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.3685338","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/催化材料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钌复分解催化剂","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"烯烃复分解是构建碳–碳键的强力反应，但大多数钌催化剂在水介质中不稳定，制约其生物体系应用。本研究报道了带有生物偶联功能手柄的Ru(CAAC-5)烯烃复分解催化剂。通过烯胺烷基化制备带保护苯胺连接基的功能化CAAC-5配体，并与钌配位得到相应配合物。该杂化催化剂可催化关环复分解（RCM）反应，在水介质中寿命显著延长；在生物相关条件的基准RCM反应中表现出增强的催化稳健性，转换数最高达600。脱保护后可实现生物偶联应用。","kp":["催化剂[Ru(CAAC-5)烯烃复分解]: 含生物偶联功能把手，在水介质中寿命延长"]},{"t":"从稳定自由基到自由基捕获抗氧化剂：Blatter自由基有效抑制自氧化并抑制铁死亡","b":"ABSTRACT Ferroptosis is a clinically important form of regulated cell death implicated in numerous degenerative pathologies, making the discovery of novel ferroptosis inhibitors of great translational interest. Radical‑trapping antioxidants (RTAs) effectively prevent lipid peroxidation (LPO) and constitute the largest and most important class of ferroptosis inhibitors. However, current approaches for compound discovery and mechanistic studies rely almost exclusively on phenolic or aromatic amine scaffolds, which are typically identified via labor‑intensive high‑throughput screening or adapted from classical antioxidants. Here, we demonstrate that Blatter radicals potently inhibit autoxidation and suppress ferroptosis. Beyond their intrinsic potent radical‑trapping capability, these compounds exhibit super‑stoichiometric activity in inhibiting (phospho)lipid peroxidation through an unusual catalytic cross‑dismutation of lipid peroxyl radicals (LOO•) and hydroperoxyl radicals (HOO•). Importantly, this potent chemical reactivity translates effectively into biological systems: Blatter radicals confer broad anti‑ferroptotic cytoprotection at low nanomolar concentrations, effectively protect against oxygen‑glucose deprivation/reperfusion (OGD/R) injury, and exert strong anti‑inflammatory effects in lipopolysaccharide (LPS)‑stimulated BV2 microglial cells. Collectively, our results highlight the unprecedented versatility of Blatter radicals—extending from stable radicals to RTAs—and validate a rational design strategy for potent ferroptosis inhibitors.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1404527","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁死亡抑制剂","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"铁死亡是临床重要的调节性细胞死亡形式，与多种退行性病理相关，发现新型铁死亡抑制剂具有重要转化价值。自由基捕获抗氧化剂（RTAs）能有效阻止脂质过氧化，是最重要的一类铁死亡抑制剂，但现有化合物发现与机制研究几乎完全依赖酚类或芳胺骨架，通常需高通量筛选或改编经典抗氧化剂。本研究证明Blatter自由基可有效抑制自氧化并抑制铁死亡；除本征强自由基捕获能力外，这些化合物还展现出独特性质，为铁死亡抑制剂开发提供了新骨架。","kp":["[自由基捕获抗氧化剂]: Blatter自由基可有效抑制脂质过氧化并抑制铁死亡"]},{"t":"手性杂化溴化铜(I)微米片中的强二阶非线性光学活性","b":"ABSTRACT Organic–inorganic chiral hybrid metal halides (HMHs) with efficient second‐order nonlinear optical responses are promising for various photonic applications. However, chiral HMHs that simultaneously deliver strong second‐harmonic generation (SHG) and pronounced nonlinear chiroptical responses remain limited. Herein, we report a pair of chiral hybrid copper(I) bromide microplates, ( R ‐ and S ‐MPZ)Cu 2 Br 4 (MPZ = 2‐methylpiperazinediium), which crystallize in the noncentrosymmetric space group P 2 1 2 1 2 1 and feature distinctive one‐dimensional zigzag chains constructed from three‐coordinate trigonal–planar CuBr 3 units. Benefiting from the highly distorted Cu─Br frameworks, the microplates exhibit an SHG intensity approximately 376 times that of Y‐cut quartz at 870 nm, together with a high laser damage threshold of up to 11.14 mJ cm −2 . More importantly, the ( R ‐ and S ‐MPZ)Cu 2 Br 4 microplates display effective SHG circular dichroism (SHG‐CD) and circularly polarized SHG responses, enabling a conceptual chirality‐encoded SHG tagging and decoding protocol. This work highlights chiral hybrid copper(I) halides as a versatile lead‐free platform for integrating efficient frequency conversion, nonlinear chiroptical functionality, and information encryption capabilities.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.4724561","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性杂化铜卤非线性光学","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"具有高效二阶非线性光学响应的有机-无机手性杂化金属卤化物（HMHs）在光子学领域前景广阔，但兼具强二次谐波生成（SHG）和显著非线性手性光学响应的手性HMHs仍然稀缺。本研究报道了一对手性溴化铜(I)微米片(R-/S-MPZ)Cu2Br4（MPZ=2-甲基哌嗪鎓），结晶于非中心对称空间群P212121，由三配位三角平面CuBr3单元构成独特的一维之字链。得益于高度扭曲的Cu─Br骨架，其870 nm处SHG强度约为Y切石英的376倍，并伴有显著的非线性手性光学响应。","kp":["材料[手性杂化溴化铜(I)微米片 (R-/S-MPZ)Cu2Br4]: 非中心对称空间群，具有强二阶谐波生成与显著非线性手性光响应"]},{"t":"压力诱导的单分子变形使零维碘化铜杂化物实现208倍光致发光强度增强","b":"ABSTRACT Hybrid metal halides exhibit diverse excited‐state behaviors, yet the molecular‐level origin of pressure‐induced emission enhancement (PIEE) remains elusive. Here, we develop a rational molecular design strategy to isolate pressure‐induced single‐molecule deformation as the key factor of PIEE in 0D copper iodide hybrids. By systematically tuning the alkyl‐chain length of quaternary phosphonium cations, we construct a series of single crystals, (EtPPh 3 ) 2 Cu 2 I 4 , (PrPPh 3 ) 2 Cu 2 I 4 , and (BuPPh 3 ) 2 Cu 2 I 4 , which exhibit distinct crystal‐packing modes and distortions while preserving a [Cu 2 I 4 ] emissive core. In this work, “single‐molecule deformation” refers to the pressure‐induced geometric evolution of an individual discrete [Cu 2 I 4 ] 2− emissive unit within the crystal lattice. Pressure‐dependent structural, spectroscopic, kinetic, and theoretical analyses show that crystal packing and intermolecular interactions govern pressure transmission and suppress nonradiative relaxation, while deformation of the initially pre‐distorted [Cu 2 I 4 ] 2− unit in (PrPPh 3 ) 2 Cu 2 I 4 drives excited‐state reconfiguration and activates radiative decay. Consequently, its photoluminescence (PL) intensity reaches 208‐fold the ambient‐pressure value at 2.6 GPa, and the absolute photoluminescence quantum yield (PLQY) rises from 0.68% to 84.59%. These results identify single‐molecule deformation as the predominant structural origin of its high PIEE. Moreover, we demonstrate a power‐free preload‐sensing gasket and multilevel pressure‐encoded optical encryption, underscoring the application potential of pressure‐responsive luminescence.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1615351","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碘化铜杂化压力发光","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"杂化金属卤化物展现多样的激发态行为，但压力诱导发射增强（PIEE）的分子层面起源尚不明确。本研究提出合理的分子设计策略，在零维碘化铜杂化物中分离出压力诱导的单分子变形作为PIEE的关键因素。通过系统调节季鏻阳离子烷基链长度，构建了(EtPPh3)2Cu2I4、(PrPPh3)2Cu2I4和(BuPPh3)2Cu2I4系列单晶，它们保持[Cu2I4]发光核心，但呈现不同的堆积模式与变形，压力下单分子几何演化导致发光强度最高增强208倍。","kp":["光致发光增强[压力诱导、零维碘化铜杂化物]: 强度增强208倍","机制[0D铜碘杂化物]: 单分子形变为压力诱导发光增强的关键因素"]},{"t":"第三组分的静电势位点效应实现低能量损失的高性能有机太阳能电池","b":"ABSTRACT Organic solar cells (OSCs) are typically plagued by substantial non‐radiative energy loss (Δ E 3 ) during the photoelectric conversion process, which limits further performance improvement. While incorporating a third component can effectively optimize active layer morphology and suppress non‑radiative recombination, the selection of such components currently lacks precise theoretical guidance. To address this challenge, we propose a new concept of electrostatic potential (ESP) site effect, which enables modulation of local ESP distribution by precisely adjusting terminal substituent positions without altering average molecular ESP, energy levels, or absorption. Guided by this concept, two asymmetric acceptors, ZY‐SCF 3 ‐N2F and ZY‐SCF 3 ‐B2F, were rationally designed and incorporated as the third component into the PM6/BTP‐eC9 system. Combining theoretical and experimental results reveal that both acceptors possess large dipole moments that favor Δ E 3 suppression. Notably, ZY‐SCF 3 ‐B2F, featuring a larger ESP difference at terminal carbon atoms, induces more ordered molecular packing and favorable phase separation morphology in the ternary blend. This leads to synergistic enhancements in open‑circuit voltage, short‑circuit current density, and fill factor, ultimately delivering an outstanding efficiency of 20.53%. This work elucidates the critical role of local ESP distribution in determining material properties and provides a simple yet effective theoretical guideline for developing highly efficient ternary OSCs.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.8983584","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池低损耗","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"有机太阳能电池（OSCs）在光电转换过程中存在较大的非辐射能量损失（ΔE3），限制性能提升。加入第三组分可有效优化活性层形貌并抑制非辐射复合，但组分选择缺乏精确理论指导。本研究提出静电势（ESP）位点效应新概念：在不改变分子平均ESP、能级或吸收的情况下，通过精确调节末端取代基位置调控局域ESP分布。基于该概念合理设计了两个不对称受体ZY-SCF3-N2F和ZY-SCF3-B2F并掺入体系，实现了低能量损失的高性能有机太阳能电池。","kp":["[有机太阳能电池第三组分]: 静电势位点效应可降低非辐射能量损失ΔE3、抑制非辐射复合"]},{"t":"通过自报告近红外诱导上转换能量传递过程调控与解析纳米材料表面功能化","b":"ABSTRACT The surface functionalization chemistry of nanomaterials remains a black box, where the dynamic modification process is conventionally imperceptible, which severely limits the rational design of advanced nanohybrids. Herein, a holistic strategy that transforms upconversion nanorods (UCNR) surface functionalization from an empirically treated outcome into an optically self‐reporting process via near‐infrared (NIR)‐mediated photoinduced electron/energy transfer‐reversible addition‐fragmentation chain transfer (PET‐RAFT) polymerization is present. This three‐in‐one design, where the UCNR concurrently acts as a NIR‐harvesting antenna, polymerization substrate, and optical signaling unit, enables the precise, temporally controlled growth and monitoring of polymer shells with tunable thickness and grafting density. Critically, a linear correlation between the evolving polymer shell architecture and the upconversion luminescence intensity was unraveled, thereby turning the optical signal into a real‐time, nondestructive probe that reveals the invisible surface modification process. Building upon this self‐monitoring capability, the polymer brushes were further engineered to template the in situ growth of gold nanoparticles, establishing a cascaded energy transfer pathway for efficient photothermal conversion. Using the nanohybrids as a built‐in ratiometric fluorescent nanothermometer, the nanohybrid enables real‐time temperature feedback during NIR irradiation as precise nanothermometry. This work establishes a new paradigm for creating intelligent, self‐sensing nanoplatforms with profound implications for precision theranostics and adaptive photonic materials.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.4453766","c":"通用技术/材料工程/纳米工程","a":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"上转换纳米材料表面功能化","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"纳米材料表面功能化化学仍是黑箱，动态修饰过程通常不可感知，严重制约先进纳米杂化材料的理性设计。本研究提出一种整体策略，通过近红外（NIR）介导的光诱导电子/能量转移-可逆加成-断裂链转移（PET-RAFT）聚合，将上转换纳米棒（UCNR）表面功能化从经验性结果转变为光学自报告过程。该三合一设计中，UCNR同时充当NIR捕获天线、聚合基底和光学信号单元，实现对聚合物壳层厚度可调的生长及时间精度可控的原位监测。","kp":["[上转换纳米棒表面功能化]: 借助NIR介导的光致电子/能量转移-可逆加成-断裂链转移实现光学自报告过程"]},{"t":"钠离子电池Sidorenkite型Na3-xFe(PO4)(CO3)碳磷酸盐正极容量限制的机理起源","b":"ABSTRACT New classes of materials are required for sodium ion batteries (SIBs) to compete with their Li‐counterpart. Sidorenkite‐type carbonate‐phosphate cathodes, such as Na 3‐ x Fe(PO 4 )(CO 3 ), were predicted to deliver high capacities based on two electron reactions. However, experiments consistently only access one of the predicted two equivalents of Na, leaving the origin of this limitation unresolved. Here, we establish the mechanistic basis for this discrepancy. We show that carbonate stability and Na + mobility are not performance limiting bottlenecks. Instead, the rigid polyanionic framework destabilizes d 4 ‐configured transition metal centers (e.g., Fe 4+ ), generating lattice strain and suppressing electronic conductivity at high states of charge. Validation through isostructural Mn substitution (d 4 Mn 3+ ) confirms this instability as the root cause for the limited capacity. These insights convert theoretical predictions into actionable design rules: maintain crystallinity to protect carbonate integrity and avoid electron configurations prone to Jahn–Teller distortion (d 4 ) via multi‐element substitution. This work provides a clear pathway for advancing high‐energy sodium‐ion cathodes based on carbonophosphate chemistry.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71604","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/钠电","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电碳磷酸盐正极机理","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对钠离子电池Sidorenkite型碳磷酸盐正极Na₃₋ₓFe(PO₄)(CO₃)实际容量仅为理论两电子反应一半的问题，研究阐明了其机理根源。结果表明，碳酸根稳定性和Na⁺迁移率并非性能限制瓶颈，真正原因在于刚性聚阴离子框架会破坏d⁴构型过渡金属中心（如Fe⁴⁺）的稳定性，在高荷电状态下产生晶格应变并抑制电子电导，导致仅能脱出一个Na当量。该发现通过同构体系验证，为设计高容量碳磷酸盐正极提供了机理依据。","kp":["正极[Sidorenkite型Na3-xFe(PO4)(CO3)钠离子电池]: 预测双电子高容量但实验仅实现一个钠当量，碳酸根位点为容量限制机理根源"]},{"t":"锌-空气电池中生物聚合物电解质的表征：挑战、最佳实践及指导未来研究方向的高效工作流程","b":"ABSTRACT Bio‐based gel polymer electrolytes (GPEs) are emerging as promising components for rechargeable zinc–air batteries (ZABs), combining electrochemical functionality, mechanical adaptability, and sustainability. Yet, progress in this area is increasingly limited not only by materials design, but also by the lack of rigorous and application‐relevant characterization workflows. This critical, practice‐oriented review assesses the characterization strategies used for bio‐based GPEs in ZABs, focusing on relevant, recent studies reported between 2021 and 2026. Methods are grouped into six categories: mechanical and rheological characterization, electrochemical analysis and cell‐level testing, spectroscopic techniques, microscopy and nanoscale imaging, thermal analysis, and bulk physicochemical characterization. Rather than merely cataloguing methods, the review examines what each technique can reliably reveal, the key parameters controlling data quality, and the limitations imposed by conditions specific to ZAB operation, including highly alkaline environments, dynamic electrode interfaces, and the soft, heterogeneous nature of biopolymer networks. Recurring inconsistencies in experimental practice and reporting are highlighted, and best‐practice recommendations, methodological adaptations, and emerging approaches are discussed. Overall, the review provides a workflow‐oriented framework linking formulation, structure, interfacial behavior, and electrochemical performance, underscoring that better electrolytes require better characterization to enable more rigorous evaluation and accelerate the rational development of next‐generation sustainable GPEs for ZABs.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71394","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池生物聚合物电解质","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"本综述系统评估了2021至2026年间生物基凝胶聚合物电解质（GPE）在可充电锌-空气电池（ZAB）中的表征策略。生物基GPE兼具电化学功能、机械适应性和可持续性，是ZAB的重要方向，但进展受限于缺乏严格且与应用相关的表征流程。文章将表征方法归为六类：机械与流变学表征、电化学分析与电池级测试、光谱技术、显微镜与纳米成像、热分析以及整体物理化学表征，并指出挑战、最佳实践和指导未来研究的高效工作流程。","kp":["电解质[可充电锌-空气电池]: 生物基凝胶聚合物电解质兼具电化学功能、机械适应性与可持续性"]},{"t":"硅氧烷介导的双交联策略实现热稳定且高效的钙钛矿太阳能电池","b":"ABSTRACT The practical application of perovskite solar cells (PerSCs) is still limited by their intrinsic instability, particularly under dynamic temperature fluctuations in outdoor conditions. In this study, we present a series of dual cross‐linking agents to improve the efficiency and temperature endurance of PerSCs. Specifically, 3‐(trichlorosilyl)propyl methacrylate (MPTCl) with multiple functional groups is applied to modify the upper interface of the perovskite. The ─C═O group exhibits strong interactions with the undercoordinated Pb 2+ on the perovskite surface, helping to stabilize structures and reduce interfacial charge recombination. The C═C bond of the methacrylate group undergoes in situ polymerization/cross‐linking, while the trichlorosilyl group undergoes hydrolysis and subsequent condensation under humid conditions, enabling MPTCl to form a Si─O─Si cross‐linked network. This cross‐linked interfacial layer improves interfacial structural stability and enhances resistance to moisture‐ and heat‐induced degradation. Consequently, the optimal PerSCs achieved a high power conversion efficiency of 26.22% and demonstrated enhanced thermal durability under simulated thermal cycling conditions, retaining 82.4% of their initial efficiency after 250 cycles. This work proposes a dual cross‐linking strategy that provides an effective route for simultaneously improving the efficiency and thermal resilience of PerSCs, offering valuable insights into the development of durable perovskite photovoltaic technologies.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71607","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池热稳定界面","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对钙钛矿太阳能电池在户外动态温度波动下的本征不稳定性，研究提出一系列双交联剂策略，以3-(三氯硅基)丙基甲基丙烯酸酯（MPTCl）修饰钙钛矿上界面。其中C=O基团与钙钛矿表面欠配位Pb²⁺强相互作用，稳定结构并减少界面电荷复合；甲基丙烯酸酯的C=C键发生原位聚合/交联，三氯硅基团则经水解与表面缩合形成交联网络。该多重功能协同策略同时提升了器件效率与耐温性能。","kp":["界面改性剂[钙钛矿太阳能电池上界面]: 3-(三氯硅基)丙基甲基丙烯酸酯(MPTCl)双交联，羰基C=O基团相互作用强，提升效率与温度耐受性"]},{"t":"用于稳定硫化物基全固态电池锂金属界面的中间层材料性能分类","b":"ABSTRACT Sulfide‐based all‐solid‐state lithium metal batteries (ASSLMBs) promise high energy density by using lithium metal anodes, but their practical implementation is limited by severe interfacial instability. At the lithium metal/sulfide electrolyte interface, coupled chemical, electrochemical, and mechanical degradation accelerates impedance growth and cell failure. Interlayer strategies are promising for stabilizing sulfide‐based all‐solid‐state batteries because they can mitigate interfacial degradation, improve contact stability, and regulate ion/electron transport at critical electrode–electrolyte interfaces. However, their mechanisms have largely been interpreted based on phenomenological observations and empirical performance improvements, rather than through intrinsic material property–mechanism relationships, highlighting the need for a material property‐driven design framework. Here, we categorize interlayer strategies into metal, polymer, ceramic, and composite systems and reinterpret their functions from an electro‐chemo‐mechanical perspective. We discuss how stiffness, ductility, fracture toughness, electronic conductivity, electrochemical stability, chemical stability, lithiophilicity, and Li‐ion transport govern interfacial behavior during assembly, plating, stripping, and long‐term cycling. By correlating representative interlayer systems with their electro‐chemo‐mechanical properties, this perspective clarifies the relationship between material characteristics and interfacial stabilization behavior in sulfide‐based ASSLMBs. This property‐driven framework is expected to provide practical criteria for screening unexplored interlayer materials and guiding the rational design of stable lithium metal/sulfide electrolyte interfaces.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71612","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/固态电池","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化物全固态锂界面","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"硫化物基全固态锂金属电池（ASSLMB）采用锂金属负极可实现高能量密度，但锂金属/硫化物电解质界面处化学、电化学与机械退化耦合作用导致阻抗增长和电池失效。中间层策略可缓解界面退化、改善接触稳定性并调控电极-电解质界面的离子/电子传输，是稳定硫化物基全固态电池的有力途径。然而现有中间层机制多基于现象观察和经验性性能改进来解释，缺乏基于本征材料性质的深入理解，本文对此进行了系统性梳理。","kp":["[硫化物基全固态锂电池锂金属界面]: 中间层策略可缓解化学/电化学/机械耦合降解与阻抗增长"]},{"t":"隧穿门控金属化塑料集流体实现锂离子电池自主可逆热关断","b":"ABSTRACT Thermal runaway has constrained the application of high‑energy‑density batteries. Metalized plastic current collectors (MPCCs) offer a promising approach to reducing inactive mass and improving mechanical safety, yet they remain intrinsically passive and provide no active response to thermal abuse. Here, we propose tunneling‑gated thermoresponsive MPCCs (TTMP), which transforms conventional MPCCs from passive conductors into autonomous, self‑protecting components. The TTMP integrates a polyethylene matrix and embedded spiky carbon conductive particles, sandwiched between ultrathin aluminum layers on both surfaces. Upon heating above 100°C, thermal expansion of the polymer disrupts electron tunneling between adjacent spiky carbon particles, sharply suppressing electrical conduction through the TTMP, thereby interrupting current flow and delaying thermally accelerated electrochemical reactions under abuse conditions. When returns to room temperature, electron transport is fully restored, and the battery resumes normal operation. During thermal triggering, the resistance of the TTMP increases from 6.3 Ω to 2.1 × 10 5 Ω within a response time of 4 s. Cells equipped with this collector show a reversible reduction in discharge current of up to 92.5%. Furthermore, 1 Ah pouch cells achieve up to 6 cycles of reversible thermal shutdown with complete performance recovery, while the onset of thermal runaway is delayed by up to 30°C.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71617","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电热关断"},{"t":"复合使之强大：通过协同挥发性固体添加剂实现从单向到双向的转变，获得20.16%效率且稳定的有机太阳能电池","b":"ABSTRACT Traditional volatile solid additives (VSAs) often regulate only the donor or acceptor phase, limiting synergistic microstructure optimization. Here, we report two halogenated nitrobenzene‐based additives, 3,5‐dichloronitrobenzene (DCNB) and 3,5‐dibromonitrobenzene (DBNB), that enable bidirectional regulation of both components. Owing to their anisotropic electrostatic potential and large dipole moments, they simultaneously promote ordered crystallization of donor D18 and enhanced packing of acceptor L8‐BO. Characterizations confirm improved molecular ordering and optimized phase separation, forming a favorable interpenetrating network. Consequently, D18:L8‐BO devices with DCNB and DBNB achieve power conversion efficiencies of 20.16% and 19.80%, respectively, versus 17.87% for the control. The 20.16% efficiency ranks among the highest for binary OSCs processed with volatile solid additives. Charge dynamics and transient absorption spectroscopy reveal enhanced exciton dissociation, suppressed recombination, and accelerated interfacial hole transfer. This strategy also shows broad universality across multiple D‐A systems, retaining >90% initial efficiency after 1000 h. This work unveils a bidirectional synergistic regulation mechanism and offers new insights into morphology engineering for stable, high‐efficiency OSCs.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71615","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池添加剂","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究报道了两种卤代硝基苯类挥发性固体添加剂（VSAs）——3,5-二氯硝基苯（DCNB）和3,5-二溴硝基苯（DBNB），可对有机太阳能电池的给体和受体相实现双向调控。传统VSA通常仅调节给体或受体相，难以协同优化微观结构。得益于各向异性静电势和大偶极矩，这两种添加剂同时促进给体D18的有序结晶和受体L8-BO的增强堆积，改善分子有序度并优化相分离，形成良好的互穿网络。基于D18:L8-BO的器件分别实现20.16%和19.80%的功率转换效率，而对照器件仅为17.87%，且器件兼具良好稳定性。","kp":["光电转换效率[协同挥发性固体添加剂有机太阳能电池]: 20.16%","挥发性固体添加剂[双向调控]: 3,5-二氯硝基苯(DCNB)与3,5-二溴硝基苯(DBNB)卤化硝基苯类添加剂","添加剂机理[各向异性静电势/大偶极矩]: 同时促进给体D18有序结晶并增强受体堆积"]},{"t":"调控低维钙钛矿中热载流子冷却动力学的设计策略","b":"ABSTRACT The structural landscape of low‐dimensional perovskites, modulated by the organic spacer cation, governs the relaxation of hot carriers. Using transient absorption spectroscopy and molecular dynamics simulations, we show that spacer‐induced octahedral distortions and lattice rigidity define the balance between polaronic screening and phonon‐driven relaxation. We found that the phenethylammonium spacer induces significant distortions and stronger exciton‐phonon coupling, favoring polaron formation and delayed carrier cooling. In contrast, a rigid bithiophenethylammonium spacer suppresses distortions, stabilizes coherent phonons, and accelerates thermalization, while thiopheneethylammonium represents intermediate behavior. The structure‐phonon‐carrier interplay reconciles conflicting views on hot‐carrier dynamics, revealing that soft lattices stabilize polarons, whereas rigid heteroatom‐containing conjugated spacers activate efficient phonon relaxation pathways. This structural picture operates alongside a coupled electronic contribution from spacer‐derived electronic states within the conduction manifold, which provides an additional relaxation pathway, indicating that lattice rigidity and electronic coupling are intrinsically coupled rather than acting independently. These insights provide molecular design principles for tailoring carrier relaxation, guiding perovskite engineering toward optoelectronic devices and the efficient harnessing of hot carriers.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71597","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿热载流子","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究探讨有机间隔阳离子调控低维钙钛矿结构进而影响热载流子弛豫的机制。通过瞬态吸收光谱与分子动力学模拟，揭示了间隔阳离子诱导的八面体畸变与晶格刚性决定极化子屏蔽与声子驱动弛豫之间的平衡。结果表明，苯乙铵间隔阳离子诱导显著畸变和较强的激子-声子耦合，促进极化子形成并延缓载流子冷却；刚性联二噻吩乙基铵间隔阳离子抑制畸变、稳定相干声子，加速热化过程；噻吩乙基铵则表现为中间行为。该结构-声子-载流子相互作用机制为设计热载流子冷却动力学提供了策略。","kp":["热载流子冷却调控[低维钙钛矿]: 有机间隔阳离子调控八面体畸变与晶格刚性，决定极化子屏蔽与声子弛豫的平衡","间隔阳离子[苯乙基铵]: 诱导显著八面体畸变与更强激子-声子耦合，有利于极化子形成","研究方法[低维钙钛矿]: 瞬态吸收光谱与分子动力学模拟结合"]},{"t":"Mo-NiSeO₄/NiSe₂异质结构中空位稳定Pt位点的界面电子调控用于工业级碱性电解水","b":"ABSTRACT Developing bifunctional electrocatalysts that combine high activity, long‐term durability, and practical device compatibility remains a major challenge for alkaline water electrolysis. Herein, we report a heterostructure catalyst of a conductive Co 2 P nanowire scaffold integrated with a Mo‐regulated NiSeO 4 /NiSe 2 heterophase shell, and atomically dispersed Pt species stabilized at O/Se‐coordinated vacancy sites (Pt,Mo‐NiSeO 4 /NiSe 2 @Co 2 P) grown on nickel foam via sequential electrodeposition, controlled selenization, and galvanic replacement. Benefiting from synergistic electronic modulation and heterointerface engineering, the catalyst requires only 24 and 98 mV to deliver 10 and 100 mA cm −2 for the hydrogen evolution reaction, and 242 and 330 mV for the oxygen evolution reaction, in 1.0 M KOH, with excellent durability. Operando Raman spectroscopy and X‐ray absorption spectroscopy reveal dynamic surface evolution during electrocatalysis and confirm the atomic dispersion of Pt. When assembled in a two‐electrode electrolyzer, the catalyst achieves cell voltages of 1.47 V at 10 mA cm −2 and 1.65 V at 100 mA cm −2 in 30 wt.% KOH. Furthermore, an anion exchange membrane water electrolyzer delivers 1.55 V at 0.3 A cm −2 and 1.76 V at 1.0 A cm −2 at 70 °C, demonstrating its promise for practical alkaline hydrogen production.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71614","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源/氢能","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱性电解水催化","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该工作报道了一种用于碱性电解水的双功能电催化剂：在泡沫镍上通过顺序电沉积、可控硒化和置换反应，构建导电Co₂P纳米线骨架与Mo调控的NiSeO₄/NiSe₂异相壳层复合结构，并在O/Se配位空位处稳定原子级分散的Pt物种(Pt,Mo-NiSeO₄/NiSe₂@Co₂P)。得益于协同电子调控和异质界面工程，析氢反应在10和100 mA cm⁻²下仅需24和98 mV过电位，析氧反应仅需242和330 mV，兼具高活性、长耐久性与器件实用性。","kp":["催化剂[工业级碱性电解水]: Pt,Mo-NiSeO₄/NiSe₂@Co₂P异质结构","结构特征[催化剂]: 导电Co₂P纳米线骨架集成Mo调控的NiSeO₄/NiSe₂异相壳层","Pt位点稳定方式[原子级分散]: 稳定于O/Se配位空位位点","制备方法[催化剂]: 泡沫镍上顺序电沉积生长","催化性能[碱性电解水]: 双功能、高活性、长耐久性"]},{"t":"解决钙钛矿太阳能电池埋底界面的电-机械权衡问题","b":"ABSTRACT Carbazole‐based self‐assembled monolayers (SAMs) are essential in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) due to superior electrical properties, yet their inherent rigidity imposes severe mechanical stress on the perovskite layer. Herein, we construct an interfacial architecture featuring discontinuous metal‐oxide islands to circumvent this fundamental electro‐mechanical trade‐off at the buried contact. Specifically, this discontinuous topography imparts macroscopic structural flexibility to the interface by functioning as localized strain‑relaxation zones, enabling strain‐relaxed perovskite films with reduced defect density. Meanwhile, the modified interface maintains unimpeded hole‐selective pathways and optimal energy level alignment. Consequently, the corresponding PSC yields a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.92% (certified 26.60%) with enhanced long‐term stability. This strategy establishes a rational design principle for synergistic electro‐mechanical management, paving the way for high‐efficiency and stable photovoltaic devices.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71638","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池界面","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"咔唑类自组装单分子层(SAM)因优异电学性能广泛应用于反式钙钛矿太阳能电池，但其固有刚性会对钙钛矿层造成严重机械应力。该工作在埋底接触处构建了不连续金属氧化物岛屿界面结构，以规避电-机械权衡：不连续形貌作为局域应变弛豫区，赋予界面宏观结构柔性，实现应变弛豫、缺陷密度降低的钙钛矿薄膜；同时修饰界面保持畅通的空穴选择性通道和最佳能级排列，由此获得的电池展现出优异性能。","kp":["埋底界面结构[反式钙钛矿太阳能电池]: 不连续金属氧化物岛状拓扑","界面材料[反式PSC]: 咔唑基自组装单分子层(SAMs)","设计目的[埋底接触]: 突破电学-力学权衡，赋予宏观结构柔性以缓解SAM刚性对钙钛矿层的机械应力"]},{"t":"混合两步喷墨打印与浸涂实现可规模化的30%效率钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池","b":"ABSTRACT Fully scalable fabrication routes are one cornerstone required for commercial deployment of monolithic perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells. However, to date industrially viable deposition processes delivering high performance, uniform thin films, and compatibility with established silicon manufacturing remain limited. Here, we present a fully scalable deposition strategy for the entire perovskite top‑cell, including a dip‐coated self‑assembled monolayer hole‑transport layer, a hybrid two‐step inkjet‐printed wide‐bandgap perovskite absorber, and a dip‐coated interfacial passivation. The process shows excellent reproducibility and high device performance. When integrated with textured silicon bottom cells, the tandem solar cells achieve power conversion efficiencies exceeding 30%, highlighting the technological potential of this fabrication route. Scaling the perovskite active area by a factor of >120 results in a single‐junction module with an area of 12.96 cm 2 and an efficiency of 17.8%, corresponding to a loss of only 0.53% abs. per decade of area scaling. This highlights that our process not only delivers high performance tandem devices, but also offers excellent prospects for upscaling the device area. Extensive material analysis and device analysis substantiate the scalability, film quality, and interfacial control achieved. Importantly, this work provides the first demonstration of perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells surpassing 30% efficiency using an inkjet‑printing‐based perovskite absorber deposition.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71579","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层打印","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该工作提出一种钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的全可扩展沉积策略，涵盖完整顶电池工艺：浸涂自组装单分子层空穴传输层、混合两步喷墨打印宽带隙钙钛矿吸光层，以及浸涂界面钝化层。工艺展现出优异的可重复性和高器件性能。与绒面硅底电池集成后，叠层太阳能电池光电转换效率超过30%，为单片钙钛矿/硅叠层电池的商业化部署提供了与既有硅制造工艺兼容的可行制备路线。","kp":["光电转换效率[钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池]: 30%","制备工艺[钙钛矿顶电池规模化沉积]: 两步喷墨打印与浸涂混合策略","空穴传输层[可规模化工艺]: 浸涂自组装单分子层(SAM)","工艺兼容性[产业化]: 薄膜均匀且与既有硅制造工艺兼容"]},{"t":"电解液微环境与合金界面协同实现-30至50°C宽温区水系铝离子电池","b":"ABSTRACT Aqueous aluminum‐ion batteries (AAIBs) have attracted interest due to the high abundance, low cost, and high theoretical capacity of aluminum. However, their development is hindered by limited electrolyte stability, severe corrosion and passivation of the Al anode, and sluggish Al 3+ diffusion kinetics, particularly under temperature extremes. Herein, an electrolyte–anode coupled strategy is developed by combining a hydrated eutectic electrolyte with an electrodeposited Al‐Zn alloy anode. The optimized electrolyte, denoted as AETH30, is composed of Al(ClO 4 ) 3 ·9H 2 O, ethylene glycol (EG), triethyl phosphate (TEP), and H 2 O at a molar ratio of 1:6:4:30. EG and TEP reorganize the hydrogen‐bond network and establish a dynamic mixed Al 3+ solvation environment, reducing water‐dominated coordination and suppressing parasitic reactions. Electrolyte‐derived interfacial species improve surface stability, while the Al‐Zn alloy lowers interfacial resistance and facilitates reversible plating/stripping. Benefiting from the complementary regulation of the electrolyte microenvironment and alloy‐anode interface, the Al‐Zn || AETH30 || PANI full cell retains 88.81 mAh g −1 after 1700 cycles at 25°C. It also maintains capacities of 53.96 and 81.47 mAh g −1 after 850 cycles at −30°C and 1000 cycles at 50°C, respectively. This work demonstrates an electrolyte microenvironment and alloy interface synergy strategy for durable AAIBs capable of wide‐temperature operation.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71616","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系铝离子电池","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"水系铝离子电池因铝资源丰富、成本低、理论容量高而受关注，但受限于电解液稳定性差、铝负极严重腐蚀与钝化以及Al³⁺扩散动力学缓慢。该工作提出电解液-负极耦合策略：将水合共晶电解液与电沉积Al-Zn合金负极结合。优化电解液AETH30由Al(ClO₄)₃·9H₂O、乙二醇、磷酸三乙酯和水按1:6:4:30摩尔比组成，乙二醇与磷酸三乙酯重组氢键网络并构建动态混合Al³⁺溶剂化环境，降低水主导的副反应，实现-30至50°C宽温区稳定运行。","kp":["工作温区[水系铝离子电池]: -30至50°C","电解液-负极耦合策略[宽温区AAIB]: 水合共晶电解液结合电沉积Al-Zn合金负极","电池负极[水系铝离子电池]: 电沉积Al-Zn合金","技术优势[水系铝离子电池]: 铝储量丰富、成本低、理论容量高"]},{"t":"锂硫电池的多模态原位分析：电解液组成影响的对比研究","b":"ABSTRACT The effect of electrolytes on battery cell performance is multifaceted, and it is difficult to isolate their impact on individual processes. Operando analysis of batteries is a powerful tool to investigate battery degradation mechanisms. By combining different techniques on the same cell a wider perspective can be opened and enables easier cross‐correlation. Here, we introduce a fully laboratory‐based multimodal operando platform that synchronizes EIS/DRT, Raman spectroscopy, UV–vis reflectance spectroscopy, temperature monitoring, and galvanostatic cycling in one sealed Li–S cell. The platform is demonstrated over an extended observation window of up to 20 cycles to compare electrolyte‐dependent polysulfide speciation, transport limitations, and resistance evolution. The experimental design is optimized for reproducible mechanistic characterization and is not intended as a benchmark of practical cell performance or long‐term cycle life.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71554","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/锂电","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池原位分析","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该工作引入一个完全基于实验室的多模态原位分析平台，在同一个密封锂硫电池内同步集成EIS/DRT、拉曼光谱、紫外-可见反射光谱、温度监测和恒电流循环测试，并在长达20个循环的观测窗口内运行演示。通过在同一电池上结合多种技术，实现对不同电解液体系中多硫化物物种演化、传输限制和阻抗演变的交叉关联对比分析，为研究电解液组成对电池各过程的影响及电池退化机制提供了有力工具。","kp":["分析方法[锂硫电池]: 全实验室多模态operando原位平台","同步联用技术[同一电池]: EIS/DRT、拉曼光谱、UV-vis等","研究目标[锂硫电池]: 隔离并解析电解液组成对电池各退化过程的影响机制"]},{"t":"水介导质子促进实现稳定的酸性CO₂电催化","b":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical CO 2 conversion in acid can, in principle, maximize carbon efficiency but is typically undermined by facile hydrogen evolution. Moreover, operating at high current density often triggers a sharp local pH increase that propagates into the bulk electrolyte, causing an overall pH shift that erodes nominally “acidic CO 2 reduction” toward neutral/alkaline conditions. To address these limitations, we incorporated Ce species with high proton affinity into the surface of porous Cu nanosheet, constructing proton‐mitigating Cu─O─Ce active sites. Beyond conventional C─C coupling driven by local * CO accumulation, Cu─O─Ce motifs accelerate * CO formation and its protonation, thereby enabling downhill proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET) toward and beyond * CO─ * CHO dimerization. This strategy demonstrates efficient multi‐carbon generation under retentive pH conditions minimizing the collateral deficiencies of acidic CO 2 reduction. Facilitating kinetically suppressed C─C coupling at a relatively low current density offers a strategic catalyst design that maintains a stable bulk pH compared to high current density operations, thereby maximizing the in situ generation of CO 2 within the acidic media.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71609","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源回收利用与排放治理/碳捕集/其它碳捕集技术","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性CO2电催化","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"酸性电催化CO₂还原虽可最大化碳效率，但易受析氢竞争反应影响，且高电流密度下局部pH骤增会扩散至本体电解液，使名义酸性条件趋向中性/碱性。该工作将具有高质子亲和力的Ce物种引入多孔Cu纳米片表面，构建缓解质子的Cu─O─Ce活性位点。除局部*CO积累驱动的C─C耦合外，Cu─O─Ce基元加速*CO形成及其质子化，实现朝向并超越*CO─*CHO二聚的下坡质子耦合电子转移(PCET)，从而在酸性条件下实现稳定的CO₂电催化转化。","kp":["催化剂改性[酸性CO₂电催化]: 将高质子亲和性的Ce物种掺入多孔电极表面","技术目标[酸性CO₂还原]: 高电流密度下抑制析氢并稳定局部/体相pH，维持酸性反应环境","运行挑战[酸性CO₂RR]: 高电流密度引发局部pH骤升并扩散至体相电解液，使酸性还原退化为中性/碱性条件"]},{"t":"无CO₂甲醛电重整燃料电池","b":"ABSTRACT Conventional electrochemical synthesis is often hampered by steep energy demands and catalyst degradation, limiting both efficiency and durability. Here we introduce a hybrid alkali/acid formaldehyde‐to‐hydrogen fuel cell (h‐A/AFHFC) that transcends these limitations by coupling alkaline formaldehyde oxidation conversion with acidic oxygen reduction. A columnar branched AgCu catalyst drives the h‐A/AFHFC to a striking 2.0 V output and peak power density of 482 mW cm −2 , maintaining robust operation for over 110 h. Beyond electricity, the device leverages the exceptionally low oxidation potential of formaldehyde and its single‐electron dehydrogenation pathway to co‐produce hydrogen and formate in a *CO‐free, CO 2 ‐free electrochemical process, reformulating the role of fuel cells. Each kilogram of hydrogen is inherently paired with 46.0 kg of formate and 33.2 kWh of electricity, offering a rare convergence of clean energy and high‐value chemical synthesis. This strategy extends to gaseous formaldehyde and diverse aldehydes, enabling integrated energy‐chemical platforms for sustainability.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71611","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/二次能源利用/燃料电池","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲醛燃料电池","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该工作提出一种混合碱/酸甲醛制氢燃料电池(h-A/AFHFC)，将碱性甲醛氧化与酸性氧还原耦合。采用柱状分支AgCu催化剂，电池实现2.0 V输出电压和482 mW cm⁻²峰值功率密度，并稳定运行超过110小时。除发电外，该器件利用甲醛极低的氧化电位及其单电子脱氢路径，在无*CO、无CO₂的电化学过程中联产氢气和甲酸盐，重新定义了燃料电池的角色，同时克服了传统电合成高能耗和催化剂降解的局限。","kp":["输出电压[混合碱/酸甲醛制氢燃料电池h-A/AFHFC]: 2.0 V","峰值功率密度[h-A/AFHFC]: 482 mW/cm²","阳极催化剂[甲醛氧化]: 柱状分支AgCu催化剂","工作机理[无CO₂甲醛燃料电池]: 碱性甲醛氧化与酸性氧还原耦合"]},{"t":"异质集成：具有空间可编程特性与功能的先进液晶弹性体的设计原则","b":"ABSTRACT Liquid crystal elastomers (LCEs) uniquely merge liquid crystal anisotropy with rubbery elasticity, positioning them as cornerstone materials for soft actuators. As the field is progressing from laboratory demonstrations toward practical applications in soft robotics and biomedical devices, it is moving beyond the simple, uniform deformations toward advanced spatially programmable properties and integrated functionalities. The design principles underlying these advances lie in heterogeneous integration, defined as the intentional spatial design of chemical, structural, or orientational differences across a unified LCE system, permitting precise programming of differentiated actuation directions, mechanical gradients, and sequential responsiveness unattainable in homogeneous LCEs. Heterogeneous integration pervades almost all advances in alignment techniques, network engineering, and device assembly. This review categorizes the diverse achievements into three hierarchical strategies: heterogeneity in orientation, heterogeneity in polymer network architecture, and heterogeneous modular assembly. We systematically summarize the mechanistic origins, achievable precision, and functional outputs of each approach. Furthermore, we outline future directions from discrete patterning to continuous gradients, from single‐dimensional to multidimensional integration, and from static programming to adaptive evolution. This review establishes a coherent conceptual blueprint to guide the rational design of next‐generation intelligent LCE systems.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75020","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液晶弹性体设计","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"液晶弹性体（LCE）兼具液晶各向异性与橡胶弹性，是软体驱动器的核心材料。随着领域从实验室演示走向软体机器人和生物医学器件的实际应用，正从简单均匀变形向空间可编程性质与集成功能演进。其设计原则核心是异质集成，即在统一LCE体系内对化学、结构或取向差异进行有意的空间设计，从而实现均质LCE无法达到的差异化驱动方向、力学梯度和顺序响应性的精确编程。文章总结了相关设计原理与功能实现路径。","kp":["设计原则[空间可编程液晶弹性体]: 异质集成实现空间可编程特性与集成功能","材料本质[液晶弹性体]: 液晶各向异性与橡胶弹性的融合","应用方向[先进LCE]: 软体机器人与生物医学器件的软驱动器"]},{"t":"高容量富镍正极异质界面处的电子态连续性实现稳定的硫化物基全固态锂电池","b":"ABSTRACT Sulfide‐based all‐solid‐state lithium batteries are severely constrained by the intertwined challenges of interfacial instability and sluggish lithium‐ion kinetics at the nickel‐rich layered oxide cathode interface. Herein, we report a design principle centered on electronic‐state continuity across a cathode heterointerphase to simultaneously address these issues. By co‐doping single‐crystal LiNi 0.94 Co 0.04 Mn 0.02 O 2 with selected period‐5 elements (Y, Zr, Nb, and Mo), a self‐assembled heterointerphase with spatially differentiated functions is achieved. Thermodynamically driven segregation yields a LiNbO 3 /Li 2 MoO 4 outer passivation layer that suppresses side reactions, which remains coherent with a subsurface Y/Zr‐enriched rocksalt interlayer that anchors lattice oxygen. Crucially, the energetically continuous distribution of unoccupied 4 d orbital‐derived electronic states across the heterointerphase establishes an efficient charge redistribution channel and induces a well‐oriented built‐in electric field that screens the space‐charge barrier, thereby driving accelerated interfacial Li + transport. Consequently, the optimized cathode delivers a high specific capacity of 204.4 mAh g −1 at 0.1 C and maintains 86.7% capacity retention over 1000 cycles at 0.5 C when paired with a Li 6 PS 5 Cl solid‐state electrolyte. This orbital‐level electronic engineering strategy provides a promising design principle for integrating chemical passivity and ionic transport kinetics in high‐capacity all‐solid‐state energy storage systems.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75070","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/固态电池","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化物固态电池","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"硫化物基全固态锂电池受限于富镍层状氧化物正极的界面不稳定性和迟缓的锂离子动力学。该工作提出以正极异质界面处电子态连续性为核心的设计原则：对单晶LiNi₀.₉₄Co₀.₀₄Mn₀.₀₂O₂共掺杂选定的第五周期元素(Y、Zr、Nb、Mo)，自组装形成功能空间分化的异质界面。热力学驱动偏析生成LiNbO₃/Li₂MoO₄外层钝化层以抑制副反应，并与富Y/Zr的亚表面岩盐相中间层保持共格，后者锚定晶格氧，从而同步解决界面不稳定与离子动力学问题，实现稳定的全固态锂电池。","kp":["正极材料[单晶富镍]: LiNi0.94Co0.04Mn0.02O2","共掺杂元素[第5周期]: Y、Zr、Nb、Mo","设计策略[正极异质界面]: 电子态连续性"]},{"t":"毫秒级闪热合成过渡金属二硫属化物单原子修饰用于高性能室温化学电阻传感器","b":"ABSTRACT Transition metal dichalcogenides (TMD) are attractive for adsorption‐driven reactions, yet their activity is strongly site‐dependent. Activity is concentrated at edge motifs, whereas most exposed area resides on inert basal planes. Dual‐site designs that enrich edges while activating basal planes with catalysts remain challenging to realize without coarsening and metal aggregation during thermal processing. Here, an intense pulsed light‐driven flash thermal synthesis route is demonstrated that directly converts ammonium tetrathiomolybdate ((NH 4 ) 2 MoS 4 ) into few‐layer, edge‐rich MoS 2 nanoflakes (FTS‐MoS 2 ) within 10 ms pulse in ambient‐air. Ultrafast photothermal shock (1192–1811°C; ∼10 5 /10 4 °C s − 1 heating/cooling rates) suppresses in‐plane coarsening and out‐of‐plane stacking, while Pt, Ir, or Au single atoms are uniformly anchored on MoS 2 via rapid metal‐sulfur coordination without aggregation. As a proof‐of‐concept, FTS‐MoS 2 exhibits a 23.6‐fold higher NO 2 response at 5 ppm than solvothermally synthesized MoS 2 . Pt single atom functionalization (FTS‐Pt SA ‐MoS 2 , 1.2 wt%) further boosts the response by 22.8‐fold versus pristine FTS‐MoS 2 and achieves 100.8% response toward 400 ppb NO 2 at room temperature. Density functional theory supports enhanced NO 2 adsorption and charge transfer on FTS‐Pt SA ‐MoS 2 . With a low electrical energy input (8.6 kJ g −1 ) and scalable irradiation, ultrafast FTS enables industrially relevant active‐site and single‐atom engineering in TMDs for high‐performance gas sensors.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75106","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/传感器","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"闪热合成气体传感器","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"过渡金属二硫属化物（TMD）的吸附驱动反应活性高度依赖位点，主要集中在边缘，而惰性基底面占据绝大部分暴露面积。研究提出一种强脉冲光驱动闪热合成方法，在环境空气中于10毫秒脉冲内直接将四硫代钼酸铵转化为富含边缘的少层MoS₂纳米片（FTS-MoS₂）。超快光热冲击（1192–1811°C，升/降温速率约10⁵/10⁴°C s⁻¹）抑制了面内粗化和金属团聚，实现单原子修饰与双位点设计，获得高性能室温化学电阻传感器。","kp":["合成方法: 强脉冲光驱动闪热合成","结构设计[传感器/TMD]: 双位点设计（富集边缘+激活基面）","应用场景: 室温化学电阻传感器"]},{"t":"选择性激光烧结与石墨化用于集成主体电路与立体流体的单基体一体化可穿戴电子器件制造","b":"ABSTRACT Wearable integrated electronic devices for biomedical, robotics, and sensing applications require greater compactness and functional complexity while maintaining wearability. However, seamlessly integrating electronic and microfluidic components remain challenging due to fabrication heterogeneity, material mismatches, and complex assembly requirements. In this study, we present an innovative selective laser sintering and graphitization (SLSG) 3D printing technology that enables seamless integration of 3D circuits (stereo‐circuits) and 3D fluidic channels (stereo‐fluidics). SLSG achieves unibody, autonomous mono‐matrix fabrication through adaptive photonic modulation of carbon‐rich precursors (e.g., polyetheretherketone (PEEK) powder), simultaneously creating insulating sintered structures and conductive graphitized patterns with conductivity up to 1,895 S/m, yielding 7.64‐fold higher electrochemical performance than classic glassy carbon electrodes (GCEs). Using SLSG, we fabricated a watch‐type wearable unibody multimodal microfluidic biosensor (UMMB) with integrated electrochemical biosensors for on‐body sweat metabolite monitoring. UMMB incorporates stereo‐circuits for sensing and signal routing, plus stereo‐fluidic channels for sweat respiration, achieving effective lactate and glucose sensing. The device demonstrates excellent sensitivities of 29.43 and 16.86 µA/mM for detecting lactate and glucose, respectively, while exhibiting nondetectable interference or circuit‐fluidic crosstalk. This novel SLSG 3D printing technology introduces a transformative unibody approach to fabricate multifunctional bioelectronic‐fluidic platform for integrated point‐of‐care devices, wearable sensors/biosensors, actuators, advanced theranostics, and personalized biomedical devices.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75075","c":"通用技术/工艺和工程","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激光烧结可穿戴器件","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"面向生物医学、机器人和传感应用的可穿戴集成电子器件需在保持可穿戴性的同时提高紧凑性与功能复杂度，但电子与微流控组件的异质制造、材料失配和复杂组装阻碍了无缝集成。研究提出选择性激光烧结与石墨化（SLSG）3D打印技术，通过对富碳前驱体（如聚醚醚酮PEEK粉末）的自适应光子调制，在同一基体上无缝一体化制造3D立体电路与3D流体通道，同步形成绝缘烧结结构与导电石墨化结构，实现单体式可穿戴器件制造。","kp":["制造技术: 选择性激光烧结与石墨化(SLSG) 3D打印","集成特性[可穿戴器件]: 主体电路与立体微流体单基体一体化无缝集成"]},{"t":"分子间氢键诱导顺磁性用于一氧化氮的无损CEST成像","b":"ABSTRACT Nondestructive monitoring of nitric oxide (NO) generation is crucial for understanding its biological functions and therapeutic effects in vivo, but most existing NO probes interfere with its physiological activity. Here, we propose a novel strategy of intermolecular hydrogen bonds inducing paramagnetism (HIP), which facilitates nondestructive detection of exogenous NO using chemical exchange saturation transfer (CEST) imaging in vivo. Arg–Cu (II) assembles into a copper (II)‐carboxylate complex that propagates magnetic dipole–dipole interactions through intermolecular hydrogen bonds, thereby shifting the chemical exchange saturation transfer (CEST) signal of arginine to 34.0 ppm. Upon arginine metabolism and NO release, the intermolecular hydrogen bonds between Arg–Cu (II) units are cleaved. This results in an increase in electron density around Cu 2+ (from 0.96 to 1.10), shortening of the T 1 relaxation time (from 2684.30 to 1975.70 ms), and a subsequent decrease in proton exchange rate (from 1230.89 to 410.85 s −1 ). This approach facilitates nondestructive detection of exogenous NO concentrations as low as 1.02 µM in vitro and 1.24 µM in vivo. A significant correlation between CEST signals and NO‐associated Ccnd2 expression further supports its NO‐responsive imaging capability. By minimizing interference with physiological processes, this strategy offers a reliable platform for dynamic, nondestructive NO monitoring, advancing precision molecular imaging.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75063","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CEST成像检测NO","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对现有NO探针多会干扰NO生理活性、难以无损监测的问题，研究提出分子间氢键诱导顺磁性（HIP）新策略，实现体内基于化学交换饱和转移（CEST）成像的外源NO无损检测。Arg-Cu(II)自组装形成羧酸铜配合物，通过分子间氢键传播磁偶极-偶极相互作用，将精氨酸的CEST信号移至34.0 ppm；当精氨酸代谢释放NO后，Arg-Cu(II)单元间氢键解离，CEST信号相应改变，从而实现NO生成的无创、可视化监测。","kp":["检测策略[NO检测]: 分子间氢键诱导顺磁性(HIP)","成像技术[NO活体监测]: CEST化学交换饱和转移成像","探针组成: Arg–Cu(II)组装","检测特性: 无损、不干扰NO生理活性"]},{"t":"具有可定制频率响应的钙钛矿光电探测器","b":"ABSTRACT Photodetectors in emerging optoelectronic systems are increasingly required to deliver application‐defined transfer characteristics rather than merely high responsivity or fast response. Existing response‐engineering strategies mainly operate in the wavelength or intensity domains, but often increase source‐side complexity, power consumption, and sensitivity to optical‐path fluctuations. Here we introduce a frequency‐centric strategy for response modulation. By combining a time‐integrated‐charge‐based alternating‐current‐to‐direct‐current (AC–DC) mapping with continuous tuning of the built‐in electric fields across heterojunction regions with antagonistic photoresponses, the transfer function becomes customizable in the frequency domain. Using lead‐halide perovskites as a model platform, we demonstrate bipolar responses for image‐processing, nonlinear responses for neuromorphic activation‐function emulation, and selective responses for anti‐interference free‐space optical communication. The selective‐response device suppresses stray illumination by more than three orders of magnitude, while the transmitter can be implemented using a conventional laser diode driven by a function generator. The extension of this strategy to PbS and PbI 2 ‐based systems supports its material generality, indicating a general route to photodetectors with application‐defined response characteristics.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75093","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/传感器","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿光电探测器","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"新兴光电系统要求光电探测器提供应用定义的传递特性，而非单纯高响应度或快响应。研究提出一种以频率为核心的响应调制策略：将基于时间积分电荷的交流-直流（AC-DC）映射与跨异质结区内建电场的连续调控相结合，该异质结具有拮抗光响应，使传递函数在频域可定制。以卤化铅钙钛矿为模型材料，实现了频率响应可定制的钙钛矿光电探测器，避免了波长/强度域调控带来的源端复杂性和功耗增加。","kp":["响应调控策略[光电探测器]: 以频率为核心的调制策略","性能特征: 可定制频率响应"]},{"t":"通过原位偶极工程实现无空穴传输层的高效Sn-Pb混合钙钛矿太阳能电池与光电探测器","b":"ABSTRACT Mixed tin‐lead (Sn–Pb) perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have great potential for photovoltaics and infrared photodetector (PD) applications. However, their performance and reliability are severely limited by non‐radiative recombination, both within the perovskite bulk and at the interface between the perovskite and hole transporting layer (HTL). In HTL‐free architectures, the buried perovskite/ITO interface becomes the dominant extraction and recombination bottleneck, yet remains insufficiently engineered. Herein, we report an efficient HTL‐free mixed Sn–Pb optoelectronic device by introducing isoniazid (INH) into the perovskite film (FA 0.6 MA 0.3 Cs 0.1 Pb 0.5 Sn 0.5 I 3 ) to in situ form a dipole interface and establish a built‐in electric field, thereby suppressing the interface/bulk non‐radiative recombination and promoting hole extraction. The INH molecule can coordinate with Sn 2+ to modulate film crystallization, and the hydrazide group acts as a potent reducing agent, mitigating the Sn 2+ oxidation and passivating the defects. As a result, the optimized HTL‐free Sn–Pb PSCs achieved a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.71%, with improved stability that retained 80% of their initial efficiency after 2250 h in an N 2 glovebox. Additionally, this strategy enabled high‐performance HTL‐free PDs with a remarkable specific detectivity beyond 10 14 Jones at 920 nm. This work provides a strategic pathway for developing efficient HTL‐free Sn–Pb perovskite optoelectronic devices.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75076","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无传输层钙钛矿电池","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"Sn-Pb混合钙钛矿器件在光伏和红外光电探测领域潜力巨大，但钙钛矿体相及与空穴传输层（HTL）界面的非辐射复合限制其性能。在无HTL结构中，埋底钙钛矿/ITO界面成为载流子提取与复合的主要瓶颈。研究将异烟肼（INH）引入FA₀.₆MA₀.₃Cs₀.₁Pb₀.₅Sn₀.₅I₃钙钛矿薄膜中，原位形成偶极界面并建立内建电场，抑制界面非辐射复合，实现无空穴传输层的高效Sn-Pb混合钙钛矿太阳能电池与光电探测器。","kp":["电池结构[Sn–Pb钙钛矿]: 无空穴传输层(HTL-free)","关键工程手段: 原位偶极工程","瓶颈界面[HTL-free结构]: 埋底钙钛矿/ITO界面"]},{"t":"单个准垂直范德华异质结构忆阻器作为光可重构人工智能硬件","b":"ABSTRACT The explosive advancement of artificial intelligence (AI) has driven vast amounts of unstructured data that directly emerges at sensory interaction interfaces. Memristors with superior computing ability are among the most promising computing blocks. However, conventional vertical Metal/Resistive layer/Metal (V‐MRM) memristors tend to generate intense electric fields, suffer from limited sensory response, inflexible, and rigid functional modes, as well as long‐standing variability and overshoot issues. Here, we present an unconventional two‐terminal quasi‐vertical (QV) van der Waals heterostructure (vdWH) memristor as opto‐reconfigurable hardware. Unlike the V‐MRM memristor with a strong, rigid vertical electric field, this QV‐vdWH memristor realizes a significantly softened, tunable electric field, enabling parametric configurable and wavelength‐dependent reconfigurable modes across nonvolatile/volatile memory, neurons, synapses, and optical perception. Moreover, the light‐memristive switching‐vdWH coupling triggers a super‐additive synergistic enhancement of memristive performance (> 100‐fold) and photoresponse (> 3000‐fold). Meanwhile, the long‐standing variability and overshoot issues are overcome, yielding ultra‐uniform memristive behavior with even a single‐valued distribution. Leveraging the opto‐reconfigurability, high‐accuracy object tracking, and human motion recognition (∼96.8%) are successfully performed. Breaking through the inherent functional limitation of the conventional V‐MRM memristive structure, the QV‐vdWH memristor provides a flexible, opto‐reconfigurable hardware platform for emerging computing paradigms, and AI applications.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75098","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光可重构忆阻器","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对传统垂直金属/阻变层/金属(V-MRM)忆阻器电场过强、感知响应有限、功能模式刚性、存在变异性和过冲等问题，研究提出一种两端准垂直(QV)范德华异质结构忆阻器作为光可重构AI硬件。与V-MRM器件强而刚性的垂直电场不同，QV-vdWH忆阻器实现了显著软化且可调的电场分布，从而改善感知响应能力并提供灵活可重构的功能模式，为感算一体的人工智能硬件提供了新的器件架构。","kp":["器件结构: 单个准垂直范德华异质结构忆阻器","功能特性: 光可重构人工智能硬件"]},{"t":"单层石墨烯包覆Cu(111)衬底实现全维度晶体学连贯的单晶锌负极","b":"ABSTRACT Aqueous Zn metal batteries are promising candidates for large‐scale energy storage, yet their practical deployment is hindered by poor Zn reversibility. Although crystallographic engineering can improve Zn electrochemistry, the precise fabrication of single‐crystal Zn electrodes with full‐dimensional crystallographic coherence remains elusive. Here we report a remote electro‐epitaxy (REE) strategy to render high‐quality single‐crystal Zn electrodes. Using monolayer graphene‐skinned Cu(111) substrate as the epitaxial current collector, REE manages to preserve perfect crystallographic inheritance through substrate‐potential transmission and accommodate lattice mismatch via interfacial strain relaxation, which is evidenced by theoretical and instrumental characterizations. As a result, the Zn(002) deposits with uniform out‐of‐plane crystallographic orientation, in‐plane crystallographic coherence, and through‐thickness crystallographic continuity are achieved on both centimeter‐scale foils and 4‐inch wafer substrates. The resulting electrodes warrant reversible Zn plating/stripping behavior, enhanced stability under elevated depth‐of‐discharge conditions, and successful implementation in Ah‐scale pouch cells competing the state‐of‐the‐art. Beyond Zn, our strategy is extendable to a multitude of metals, offering a scalable pathway toward single‐crystal electrode fabrication for emerging energy storage.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.75114","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/有机体系/锂电","a":"Advanced Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-21.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单晶锌负极","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"水系锌金属电池在大规模储能中前景广阔，但锌可逆性差制约其实际应用。研究提出远程电外延(REE)策略，以单层石墨烯包覆的Cu(111)衬底作为外延集流体，通过衬底-电位传递实现完美的晶体学遗传，并借助界面应变弛豫容纳晶格失配，理论与仪器表征均证实了这一机制，最终获得全维度晶体学连贯的高质量单晶锌负极，可提升锌负极电化学性能与循环可逆性。","kp":["负极材料: 全维度晶体学连贯单晶锌负极","制备策略[单晶Zn电极]: 远程电外延(REE)","衬底结构: 单层石墨烯包覆Cu(111)"]},{"t":"Li─P─F─O键合拓扑决定高倍率LRMO基全固态锂电池中的氧氧化还原与界面稳定性","b":"ABSTRACT Lithium‐rich manganese‐based oxides (LRMO) derive high capacity from lattice‐oxygen redox, but oxygen release at high voltage oxidizes solid electrolytes and drives rapid interfacial resistance growth. Nanosizing improves solid‐state kinetics yet exposes more under‐coordinated surface oxygen, aggravating interfacial degradation. Here, density functional theory screening identifies phosphate as the most effective oxyanion motif for stabilizing surface oxygen. Guided by this insight, a Li─P─F─O bonding topology is constructed through a one‐step mechanochemical reaction between LRMO and LiPO 2 F 2 . This process simultaneously refines the particles, introduces near‐surface fluorine, and forms a conformal amorphous interphase featuring P─O, P─F, and Li─F bonding environments. P–O coordination stabilizes surface oxygen, delocalizes oxidation holes, and suppresses O─O coupling, while near‐surface fluorine widens the Li layers and facilitates Li + transport. Together, these effects suppress oxygen loss, electrolyte oxidation, impedance growth, and interfacial contact failure. The modified cathode delivers 248.5 mAh g −1 at 25°C and 268 mAh g −1 at 60°C (0.1 C), retains 85% capacity after 2000 cycles at 10 C, and operates up to 16 000 cycles. A high‐loading lithium‐metal pouch cell achieves 212 mAh g −1 with specific energy of 277 Wh kg −1 . This work demonstrates bonding‐topology regulation as an effective strategy for stabilizing oxygen redox in solid‐state batteries.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71568","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/传统蓄电池/固态电池","a":"Advanced Energy Materials","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全固态锂电池界面","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"富锂锰基氧化物(LRMO)依靠晶格氧氧化还原获得高容量，但高电压下氧释放会氧化固态电解质，导致界面电阻快速增加；纳米化虽改善固态动力学，却暴露更多欠配位表面氧加剧界面退化。密度泛函理论筛选表明磷酸盐是稳定表面氧最有效的含氧阴离子基团。据此研究通过LRMO与LiPO₂F₂一步机械化学反应构建Li-P-F-O键合拓扑，同时细化颗粒、引入近表面氟，并形成含P-O、P-F、Li-F键合环境的保形非晶界面相，从而稳定氧氧化还原并提升界面稳定性，适用于高倍率LRMO基全固态锂电池。","kp":["正极材料[全固态锂电池]: 富锂锰基氧化物(LRMO)","DFT筛选结论[稳定表面氧]: 磷酸根为最有效含氧阴离子基元","关键机制: Li─P─F─O键合拓扑决定氧氧化还原与界面稳定性"]},{"t":"DTT加热与电流驱动系统的现状及设计挑战","b":"This paper reports the main design keys and the challenging issues of the heating and current drive system (HCD) of the divert tokamak test (DTT) facility that is under construction at ENEA site in Frascati with the aim to perform studies on the power exhaust in a flexible and easily modifiable environment. The selected HCD systems for DTT are those with the most consolidated technology and expected to be relevant for the future reactor. The status of each system is reported, both in terms of design and procurement, which are well advanced for the system required in the first phase of the DTT exploitation: electron and ion cyclotron resonant heating. The third system is neutral beam injector, based on negative ion acceleration, which will be installed in DTT in a second phase, after the first five years of operation. The full heating power will be reached with the doubling of the radiofrequency power to reach the 45 MW at plasma needed to test the divertor with a power density at reactor level.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae9aaf","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/核电/聚变","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"DTT加热电流驱动","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"本文综述了意大利ENEA Frascati园区正在建设的偏滤器托卡马克试验装置(DTT)的加热与电流驱动(HCD)系统的设计要点与挑战，该装置旨在灵活且易于改造的环境中开展功率排出研究。DTT选择技术最成熟、对未来反应堆具有参考价值的HCD系统：第一阶段所需电子回旋共振加热和离子回旋共振加热系统，其设计与采购已相当成熟；第三套系统为基于负离子加速的中性束注入器，将在第一阶段之后于第二阶段安装。","kp":["设施[DTT装置/ENEA Frascati]: 偏滤器托卡马克试验装置，在建","系统组成[HCD]: 选用技术最成熟、对未来反应堆具有相关性的加热与电流驱动系统","研究目标: 灵活可改的功率排出研究"]},{"t":"低Z杂质注入对J-TEXT托卡马克破裂后 runaway 电流的影响","b":"Major disruptions in tokamak plasmas pose a severe threat to the safe and stable operation of the device, and the runaway current formed by high-energy runaway electrons is one of the hazardous consequences. Massive impurity injection serves as a primary means of mitigating runaway current, where high-Z impurities can effectively dissipate it, while low-Z deuterium enables benign termination of runaway current. On the J-TEXT tokamak, experiments on mitigating runaway current have been conducted using shattered pellet injection (SPI) and massive gas injection (MGI) with low-Z deuterium/neon mixtures. The results indicate that both SPI and MGI with large amounts of low-Z mixed impurities can extend plateau duration of runaway current and reduced RE energy following mixture impurity injection, and a higher proportion of deuterium in the mixture impurities plays a dominant role. Furthermore, based on the injection characteristics of SPI and MGI, it is inferred that penetration depth of mixed impurities in the runaway current core region and a larger injection quantity are main factors influencing the phenomenon of runaway current. These findings provide important references for extrapolating mitigation schemes for runaway current to future tokamak fusion reactors.","d":"2026-09-20","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae9ede","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/核电/聚变","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"托卡马克破裂缓解","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"托卡马克等离子体大破裂严重威胁装置安全稳定运行，高能逃逸电子形成的逃逸电流是主要危害之一。在J-TEXT托卡马克上，研究团队利用低Z氘/氖混合物的碎裂弹丸注入(SPI)和大量气体注入(MGI)开展了逃逸电流缓解实验。结果表明，SPI和MGI注入大量低Z混合杂质均可延长逃逸电流平台持续时间，并降低混合杂质注入后的逃逸电子能量，为破裂缓解策略提供了实验依据。","kp":["高Z杂质[破裂缓解]: 有效耗散runaway电流","低-Z氘[runaway电流]: 可实现良性终止"]},{"t":"2020年后的保护优先区域正受到全球采矿业的威胁","b":"The United Nations has committed to halting and reversing biodiversity loss by 2030. Despite this commitment, mining remains a major driver of biodiversity decline, particularly in conservation priority zones (CPZs) and areas with high species extinction risk. Regardless of growing awareness, the full extent of current and future mining threats to biodiversity remains inadequately quantified, limiting effective global conservation strategies. Here, we quantify the threats of 145,000 km² of current mining land to biodiversity. We find that 34% (49,000 km²) of these mining areas overlap with CPZs, intersecting the ranges of more than 2,300 species, including many classified as threatened. These threats span 14 biomes, with disproportionately high relative impacts in fragile ecosystems such as Mangroves and the Mediterranean. Furthermore, an additional 43% (12 million km²), 29% (2 million km²), and 37% (4 million km²) of land potentially exploitable for metals, non-metals, and coal, respectively, overlap with CPZs, highlighting the heightened risks from future mining expansion without consideration for biodiversity. Our findings offer actionable insights for policymakers and industry stakeholders, guiding conservation efforts to mitigate biodiversity loss and align mining practices with global conservation goals, including the UN Sustainable Development Goals and the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77626-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源获取/开采技术","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"采矿威胁保护区","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"联合国承诺到2030年遏止并扭转生物多样性丧失，但采矿仍是生物多样性下降的重要驱动因素。研究量化了当前145,000平方公里采矿用地对生物多样性的威胁，发现其中34%（49,000平方公里）与保护优先区域(CPZs)重叠，涉及超过2,300个物种的分布区，其中许多已被列为受威胁物种。这些威胁跨越14个生物群系，在脆弱生态系统中相对影响尤为突出，凸显了全球保护战略中量化评估采矿威胁的紧迫性。","kp":["当前采矿业威胁面积[保护优先区域]: 145,000 km²"]},{"t":"出版商更正：BRCA1-A的泛素链供给机制。","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77841-1","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"BRCA1-A泛素机制","as":"出版商更正声明，涉及BRCA1-A复合物泛素链供给机制相关研究的更正。"},{"t":"作者更正：单细胞图谱解析滑翔哺乳动物飞膜发育","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77842-0","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"滑翔动物飞膜发育","as":"作者更正声明，涉及单细胞图谱解析滑翔哺乳动物飞膜发育机制研究的更正。"},{"t":"作者更正：神经元-星形胶质细胞组合体tau病模型的单细胞转录组图谱","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77856-8","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"tau病单细胞图谱","as":"作者更正声明，涉及神经元-星形胶质细胞组合体tau病模型单细胞转录组图谱研究的更正。"},{"t":"作者更正：在原子分辨率下解析口蹄疫病毒抗原景观及免疫原性降低机制","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77852-y","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"口蹄疫病毒抗原","as":"作者更正声明，涉及口蹄疫病毒抗原景观及免疫原性降低机制的原子分辨率结构解析研究的更正。"},{"t":"作者更正：维生素B12通过卵黄蛋白原储备诱导捕食记忆","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77839-9","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"维生素B12捕食记忆","as":"作者更正声明，涉及维生素B12通过卵黄蛋白原储备诱导捕食记忆机制研究的更正。"},{"t":"碳纳米管作为冷冻电镜样品制备的支撑膜","b":"Specimen preparation is a critical and rate-limiting step in cryo-EM structural analysis, primarily due to challenges posed by the air-water interface. In this study, we introduce carbon nanotubes (CNTs) as a one-dimensional fibrous support material to address this issue. CNTs interact with macromolecules, effectively protecting them from air-water interfaces, and macromolecules arrange themselves around CNTs in various orientations. Furthermore, CNTs biofunctionalized with affinity tags exhibit strong specificity in binding target macromolecules, facilitating direct purification of targets from cell lysates and on-grid assembly of complexes for subsequent cryo-EM analysis. We also demonstrate that CNT grids are compatible with cell culturing, allowing for seamless integration into the cryo-EM characterization workflow for cellular structures. We anticipate that these properties will make the CNT network a promising support for cryo-EM.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77953-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/纳米工程","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳纳米管电镜载膜","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"样品制备是冷冻电镜结构分析的关键限速步骤，主要难点在于气液界面对蛋白质分子的损伤。研究引入碳纳米管(CNTs)作为一维纤维状支撑膜，CNTs与大分子相互作用，有效保护其免受气液界面影响，大分子以多种取向围绕CNTs排列。经亲和标签生物功能化的CNTs可特异性结合目标大分子，实现从细胞裂解液中直接纯化靶标并在载网上组装复合物用于冷冻电镜分析。此外CNTs载网兼容细胞培养，可无缝整合进冷冻电镜工作流程。","kp":["碳纳米管[冷冻电镜样品制备]: 一维纤维支撑材料，保护大分子免受空气-水界面影响","碳纳米管[生物功能化]: 可偶联亲和标签"]},{"t":"Blm10:13S蛋白酶体中间体结构揭示蛋白酶体核心颗粒的平行组装途径","b":"The proteasome core particle (CP) can be capped by Blm10/PA200, which promotes ATP-independent degradation of disordered proteins and contributes to attenuating antigenic diversity and impacts immunotherapy upon upregulation. The assembly process that leads to Blm10-CP proteasomes remains unresolved and Blm10 is present not only at mature proteasomes but also bound to assembly intermediates. We identified and solved structures of five CP intermediate complexes by cryo-electron microscopy, two of which include Blm10. We find that CP intermediates interactions with Blm10 and Pba1/Pba2 chaperone complex are mutually exclusive and both leads to mature CP production. We further find no synergy between Pba1/Pba2 and Blm10 for CP assembly. These data suggest a parallel assembly pathway exists for Blm10 proteasomes that does not require sequential activity with Pba1/Pba2. Whereas CP affinity for Pba1/Pba2 is reduced during maturation to promote its release, no such affinity switch occurs for Blm10, further suggesting a parallel Blm10-assembly pathway for production of mature Blm10-bound CPs. Altogether, our findings reveal a functionally distinct CP assembly pathway for the production of mature Blm10-CP proteasomes.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77943-w","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白酶体组装结构","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"蛋白酶体核心颗粒(CP)可被Blm10/PA200封端，促进非折叠蛋白的ATP非依赖性降解，其上调还会削弱抗原多样性并影响免疫治疗。Blm10-CP蛋白酶体的组装过程此前未知。研究通过冷冻电镜解析了五种CP中间体复合物结构，其中两种包含Blm10。结果显示Blm10与Pba1/Pba2伴侣复合物与CP中间体的结合互斥，二者均可导向成熟CP的产生，且Pba1/Pba2与Blm10在CP组装中无协同作用，表明蛋白酶体核心颗粒存在平行的组装途径。","kp":["Blm10/PA200[蛋白酶体核心颗粒封盖]: 促进不依赖ATP的无序蛋白降解","中间体复合物[冷冻电镜解析]: 五种CP组装中间体结构"]},{"t":"作者更正：CANTAC-seq分析揭示E2f1与Otx1协同调控Xenopus tropicalis的合子基因组激活","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77837-x","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"合子基因组激活","as":"作者更正声明，涉及CANTAC-seq分析揭示E2f1与Otx1协同调控爪蟾合子基因组激活研究的更正。"},{"t":"与细胞类型特异性的个体内基因表达变异相关的遗传变异揭示基因组调控机制","b":"Gene expression varies substantially across cells, even within seemingly homogeneous populations. Understanding how genetic variation influences this variability is critical for elucidating mechanisms of genome regulation, yet the genetic control of cell-to-cell expression variability remains poorly characterised. Here, we introduce MEOTIVE (Mapping genetic Effects On inTra-Individual Variability of gene Expression), a statistical framework that identifies genetic effects on gene expression variability (sc-veQTLs) while modelling mean-variance dependence. Applying MEOTIVE to single-cell RNA-seq data from 1.2 million peripheral blood mononuclear cells across 980 donors in the OneK1K cohort, we identify 14–3,488 genes with significant sc-veQTLs across blood cell types, including 2,103 shared across multiple cell types. We further detect 55 SNP-gene pairs (34 genes) associated with gene expression dispersion (sc-deQTLs), enriched for immune and viral response pathways; 32 of these associations remain significant after additional adjustment for mean expression. Notably, rs1131017 in the 5′UTR of RPS26 is associated with widespread expression dispersion across cell types and reduced autoimmune disease risk. We also identify a monocyte-specific deQTL in LYZ (rs1384), which replicates in an independent cohort. MEOTIVE provides a robust framework for mapping the genetic regulation of gene-expression variability at single-cell resolution and reveals pathways linking cellular heterogeneity to autoimmune disease risk.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77453-9","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"基因表达变异遗传","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"基因表达在看似同质的细胞群体内部也存在显著变异，但细胞间表达变异的遗传调控机制尚不清楚。研究提出MEOTIVE统计框架，在建模均值-方差依赖关系的同时鉴定影响基因表达变异的遗传效应位点(sc-veQTLs)。应用于OneK1K队列980名供体约120万个外周血单个核细胞的单细胞RNA测序数据，研究在多种血液细胞类型中鉴定出14至3,488个具有显著sc-veQTLs的基因，其中2,103个为共享位点，揭示了细胞类型特异性的个体内基因表达变异相关遗传变异及其基因组调控机制。","kp":["技术框架[细胞内基因表达变异]: MEISTIVE统计框架，识别基因表达变异性的遗传效应","研究对象[个体内表达变异]: 细胞间表达变异性的遗传调控机制"]},{"t":"单卵母细胞蛋白质组-转录组联合图谱揭示失调的乳酸代谢在卵母细胞衰老中的作用","b":"The age-related decline in oocyte quality is a major risk factor for female infertility. Although transcriptome has been examined in aged oocytes, proteomic landscape, which reflects primary gene functional executors, remains largely unexplored. This gap limits our understanding of oocyte aging. To address this, we perform single-cell proteome/transcriptome co-profiling of GV/MII-aged oocytes from mice and humans, revealing species- and stage-specific proteomic/transcriptomic changes during oocyte aging. Strikingly, we observe uncoupled proteomic and transcriptomic alterations, indicating that proteomic changes in aged oocytes are not primarily driven by RNA levels. Furthermore, we capture molecular heterogeneity in aged oocytes and identify MCT4 as a candidate marker of oocyte aging. Functional studies suggest MCT4 contributes to aging-associated oocyte defects via lactate export, and its inhibition improves aged-oocyte quality. These findings indicate altered lactate metabolism as a candidate marker and intervention target for oocyte aging and underscore the value of our profiling in dissecting oocyte aging.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77910-5","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"卵母细胞衰老蛋白质组","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"卵母细胞质量的年龄相关下降是女性不孕的主要风险因素，但衰老卵母细胞的蛋白质组图谱此前基本空白。研究对小鼠和人类的GV/MII期衰老卵母细胞进行单细胞蛋白质组与转录组联合分析，揭示了卵母细胞衰老过程中物种特异性和阶段特异性的蛋白组与转录组变化。研究发现蛋白质组与转录组改变存在解耦现象，表明衰老卵母细胞的蛋白质变化并非主要由RNA水平驱动；同时捕获了衰老卵母细胞的分子异质性，鉴定出MCT4为卵母细胞衰老候选标志物，功能研究提示失调的乳酸代谢在卵母细胞衰老中发挥作用。","kp":["技术方法[单卵母细胞]: 蛋白质组-转录组联合图谱","研究对象[卵母细胞衰老]: 失调的乳酸代谢","样本条件[GV/MII卵母细胞]: 小鼠与人类单细胞蛋白组/转录组联合分析"]},{"t":"诺如病毒NS3的整合结构提示其在RNA转运中的作用","b":"Human noroviruses (HuNoVs) are the leading global cause of acute gastroenteritis, yet no vaccines or antiviral therapies are currently approved. The non-structural protein NS3 is a membrane-bound AAA+ ATPase of superfamily 3 (SF3) with multiple proposed roles in the norovirus replication cycle. However, the structure of NS3, and the mechanisms by which it contributes to genome replication and membrane remodeling, have remained unknown. We engineered a soluble, hexameric, and catalytically active form of NS3 and determined its cryo-EM structure in the presence of a nucleotide analogue at 2.9 Å resolution. The structure adopts a split lock-washer architecture characteristic of AAA+ motors that operate via a hand-over-hand translocation mechanism. Complementary biochemical, single-molecule, and virological assays support oligomerization-dependent ATPase activity, ssRNA engagement, and the functional importance of conserved structural elements. Using integrative modeling with AlphaFold3, supported by targeted mutagenesis, we generated a full-length, membrane-associated model in which NS3 forms a continuous conduit across the membrane. This model supports a role for NS3 as a candidate membrane-spanning RNA translocase that may couple ATP hydrolysis to genome movement. This structural and functional framework helps address long-standing gaps in our understanding of norovirus replication and establishes a basis for mechanistic studies and structure-guided antiviral design.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77946-7","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"诺如病毒NS3结构","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"人诺如病毒是全球急性胃肠炎的主要病原，目前尚无获批疫苗或抗病毒疗法。非结构蛋白NS3是超家族3(SF3)的膜结合AAA+ ATPase，在病毒复制周期中具有多种推测功能，但其结构未知。研究构建了可溶、六聚且具有催化活性的NS3形式，并在核苷酸类似物存在下以2.9埃分辨率解析其冷冻电镜结构。该结构呈现AAA+马达典型的分裂锁垫构型，提示其通过hand-over-hand易位机制运行，结合生化与单分子实验提示NS3在RNA转运中的作用，为理解病毒基因组复制和膜重塑机制提供基础。","kp":["NS3蛋白属性[诺如病毒]: 膜结合AAA+ ATPase（SF3超家族）","工程化蛋白[NS3结构研究]: 可溶性、六聚体、具催化活性"]},{"t":"噬菌体DUF669蛋白介导切割后DNA修复以对抗宿主CRISPR免疫","b":"Phages have evolved various anti-CRISPR (Acr) proteins or RNA-based anti-CRISPR (Racr) to evade host CRISPR immunity by direct interference. However, whether other counter-CRISPR mechanisms exist remains unexplored. Here, we report a phage-encoded two-protein system, termed Healer, which neutralizes CRISPR immunity via a post-cleavage DNA repair mechanism. This phage replication-associated system comprises two proteins: Gp63 (a DUF669 domain-containing protein), and Gp64 (an AAA domain-containing protein). Mechanistic investigations elucidate that Gp63 acts as a rapid-response effector of CRISPR-induced DNA breaks. After Gp63 binds ssDNA, it promotes Gp64-mediated homologous recombination, which repairs CRISPR-generated phage DNA breaks and supports phage viability. Notably, co-expression of the Healer system with Cas9/Cas12 in E. coli, P. aeruginosa, and A. baumannii demonstrated high phage genome-editing efficiency. Collectively, our findings reveal an important anti-CRISPR complementary strategy, providing a promising tool for genome engineering.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77998-9","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"噬菌体抗CRISPR机制","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"噬菌体已进化出多种抗CRISPR蛋白(Acr)或RNA型抗CRISPR(Racr)直接干扰宿主免疫，但其他对抗机制尚待探索。研究报道了一种噬菌体编码的双蛋白系统Healer，通过切割后DNA修复机制中和CRISPR免疫。该系统包含含DUF669结构域的Gp63和含AAA结构域的Gp64。机制研究表明Gp63是CRISPR诱导DNA断裂的快速响应效应蛋白，其结合单链DNA后促进Gp64介导的同源重组，修复CRISPR造成的噬菌体DNA断裂并维持噬菌体存活；共表达两蛋白可有效支持噬菌体复制。","kp":["反CRISPR机制[噬菌体Healer系统]: 切割后DNA修复机制","系统组成[Healer]: Gp63（含DUF669结构域）和Gp64（含AAA结构域）双蛋白系统"]},{"t":"作者更正：溶酶体\"TRAP\"：清除病毒及变异体的一种新型方式","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77845-x","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"溶酶体抗病毒更正","sc":1.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":1.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":"作者更正声明，涉及溶酶体TRAP清除病毒及变异体的新型免疫机制研究的更正。"},{"t":"RIPK3在单纯疱疹病毒脑炎中作为神经保护与神经病变之间的分子开关","b":"Herpes simplex virus type 1 (HSV-1) is the leading cause of sporadic viral encephalitis, where uncontrolled viral replication and neuroinflammation drive fatal brain injury. Inherited RIPK3 deficiency predisposes humans to severe disease, but the protective mechanism remains unclear. Using single-cell transcriptomics, genetic knockout models, and analysis of viral replication, interferon production, and cell death across neurons, astrocytes, microglia, and myeloid cells, we show that RIPK3 acts as a cell-type-specific molecular switch. RIPK3 scaffolding promotes interferon response and viral control in multiple central nervous system cell types, while RIPK3-dependent apoptosis limits myeloid accumulation. In contrast, RIPK3 kinase activity in astrocytes triggers necroptosis, leading to neuronal loss and lethal neuroinflammation. Genetic or pharmacological inhibition of RIPK3 kinase suppresses astrocyte necroptosis, enhances IFN responses, preserves brain integrity, and improves survival. These findings suggest that selective modulation of RIPK3 signaling may balance antiviral defense with limitation of neuropathology in HSV-1 encephalitis.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77881-7","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"RIPK3神经保护机制","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"单纯疱疹病毒1型(HSV-1)是散发性病毒性脑炎的主要病因，失控的病毒复制与神经炎症导致致命性脑损伤。人类遗传性RIPK3缺陷易导致重症，但其保护机制不明。研究结合单细胞转录组学、基因敲除模型及对病毒复制、干扰素产生和细胞死亡的分析，显示RIPK3是细胞类型特异性的分子开关：其支架功能在多种中枢神经系统细胞中促进干扰素应答和病毒控制，并通过RIPK3依赖性凋亡限制髓系细胞积累；而星形胶质细胞中RIPK3激酶活性则触发坏死性凋亡，导致神经病变，揭示其在保护与致病间的双重角色。","kp":["RIPK3功能[HSV-1脑炎]: 神经保护与神经病变之间的分子开关","RIPK3缺陷关联[人类遗传]: 易感严重单纯疱疹病毒脑炎"]},{"t":"五国肠道微生物组组成与基因组变异的地理及膳食驱动因素分析","b":"Human diet and lifestyle vary widely across cultures, shaping global diversity in gut microbiome composition and function. However, comparable cross-population studies have been limited by methodological heterogeneity. The Human Diets and Microbiome Initiative (THDMI) integrates standardized recruitment, dietary assessment, and shotgun metagenomics across 1,976 participants from the United States, United Kingdom, Spain, Mexico, and Japan to disentangle biological from technical variation. We observed pronounced geographic differences in nutrient intake, food consumption, and microbial composition, with both shared and country-specific features linked to diet. Sparse canonical correlation and machine-learning analyses revealed that microbiome–diet associations were largely population-specific, with limited cross-country generalization. Strain-level analyses further uncovered significant genomic differentiation of gut microbes, consistent with localized dietary and ecological differences. Together, these results show that while core microbial responses to healthy eating exist, the structure and function of the human gut microbiome varies strongly with culture, geography, and long-term dietary practices.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77928-9","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"肠道微生物组地理差异","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"人类饮食与生活方式跨文化差异巨大，塑造了全球肠道微生物组的多样性与功能，但方法学异质性限制了可比的跨人群研究。人类饮食与微生物组计划(THDMI)对美国、英国、西班牙、墨西哥和日本1,976名参与者进行标准化招募、膳食评估和宏基因组鸟枪测序，以区分生物与技术差异。研究观察到营养摄入、食物消费和微生物组成的显著地理差异，以及与饮食相关的共享和国家特异特征；稀疏典型相关与机器学习分析显示微生物组-饮食关联很大程度上具有人群特异性。","kp":["样本规模[THDMI计划]: 五国1,976名参与者","技术方法[肠道微生物组]: 标准化招募+膳食评估+鸟枪法宏基因组测序","覆盖国家[跨人群研究]: 美国、英国、西班牙、墨西哥、日本"]},{"t":"组合靶向miR-379/miR-410簇使雄性糖尿病和肥胖模型中的糖脂稳态恢复正常","b":"Non-coding RNAs from the Dlk1-Dio3 locus are critical for the maturation of metabolic tissues in early stages of postnatal development; however, their role in the mature organs remains elusive. Herein, we show that microRNAs from the miR-379/miR-410 cluster are robustly upregulated in livers of subjects with obesity and various mouse models of metabolic dysfunction. Adult-onset, combinatorial inhibition of this miRNA cluster by hepatocyte-specific expression of a decoy sequence reduces triglyceride, total and LDL cholesterol circulating levels, decreases basal glycemia and improves glucose tolerance and insulin sensitivity irrespective of sex. Consistent with the decoy-triggered enhancement of PI3K/mTOR signaling in these mice, hepatocytes expressing the combinatorial decoy show augmented mitochondrial mass and function. Notably, decoy therapy also ameliorates glucose and lipid homeostasis in both type 1 diabetic and diet-induced, type 2 pre-diabetic, obese male animals. Collectively, our results demonstrate that microRNAs from the miR-379/miR-410 cluster are critical regulators of metabolic homeostasis in the mature liver. Given the preservation of miRNA dysfunction in human obesity, hepatocyte-specific combinatorial inhibition of a large miRNA cluster represents an approach towards multi-parameter improvements in diabetes and obesity.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77808-2","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"miRNA簇调控糖脂代谢","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"Dlk1-Dio3位点的非编码RNA对出生后早期代谢组织成熟至关重要，但其在成熟器官中的作用不明。研究显示miR-379/miR-410簇微小RNA在肥胖人群肝脏及多种代谢功能障碍小鼠模型中显著上调。在成年期通过肝细胞特异性表达诱骗序列组合抑制该miRNA簇，可降低甘油三酯、总胆固醇和LDL胆固醇循环水平，降低基础血糖，并改善葡萄糖耐量和胰岛素敏感性，且不受性别影响。与诱骗触发的PI3K/mTOR信号增强一致，表达组合诱骗的肝细胞表现出增强的代谢功能，使雄性糖尿病和肥胖模型中的糖脂稳态恢复正常。","kp":["干预策略[miR-379/miR-410簇]: 肝细胞特异性表达诱饵序列的组合抑制","干预时机[成年 onset]: 成年后组合抑制miRNA簇","效应[糖尿病肥胖模型]: 恢复糖脂稳态、降低甘油三酯","表达变化[肥胖肝脏]: miR-379/miR-410簇显著上调"]},{"t":"基于双重作用适配体标签对寨卡病毒与基孔肯雅病毒RNA的活体成像与互作组分析","b":"Arthropod-borne, positive-sense RNA viruses encompass many human pathogens posing significant health threats worldwide. Understanding intracellular dynamics and host-factor interactions of the viral genome is essential for devising effective antiviral strategies. Here, we engineer dual-labeled Zika and chikungunya viruses incorporating a Mango-II aptamer for RNA pulldown and real-time imaging, achieving high-resolution imaging of flavivirus RNA in live cells. Tandem imaging with viral replication proteins revealed intracellular dynamics of replication complexes and RNA molecules of these viruses. We identify >200 high-confidence host interactors of viral RNA and corroborated 355 hits from existing data sets. Spliceosome factor SFPQ is as a common interactor decreasing RNA production in both viruses when depleted. Intracellular colocalization of SFPQ-ZIKV and SFPQ-CHIKV RNA is confirmed through confocal microscopy imaging of infected cells. Thus, we demonstrate Mango-II aptamer tagging as an innovative strategy for identifying spatiotemporal dynamics and virus-host interactions of viral genomes in positive-strand RNA viruses.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77830-4","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"病毒RNA活体成像","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"虫媒正义单链RNA病毒包含多种威胁人类健康的病原，理解病毒基因组的胞内动态及宿主因子互作对抗病毒策略至关重要。研究构建了双标记的寨卡病毒和基孔肯雅病毒，整合Mango-II适配体用于RNA富集和实时成像，实现了活细胞中黄病毒RNA的高分辨率成像。与病毒复制蛋白的串联成像揭示了复制复合物和RNA分子的胞内动态；鉴定出200余个高置信度病毒RNA宿主互作因子，并验证了已有数据集中的355个候选靶点。剪接体因子SFPQ被确定为两种病毒共有的互作因子，可降低病毒RNA产生。","kp":["病毒改造[寨卡/基孔肯雅病毒]: 双重标记，整合Mango-II适配体","技术能力[活体成像]: RNA pulldown与实时成像，实现黄病毒RNA活细胞高分辨率成像"]},{"t":"通过深度学习驱动的缠结设计构建具有可定制应力松弛行为的蛋白质水凝胶","b":"Protein hydrogels are promising artificial extracellular matrices (ECMs) for 3D stem cell and organoid culture due to their favorable stress relaxation behavior (a decrease in stress in response to strain). Inter-chain entangled motifs, in which different protein chains are interlaced, represent a powerful strategy to synthesize such hydrogels. However, designing these motifs with tailored properties such as binding energy remains a major challenge due to the difficulty of simultaneously controlling these properties while ensuring entanglement. Here, we introduce TangleDiff, a deep learning framework for the de novo design of homodimeric entangled proteins with programmable features. TangleDiff generates diverse foldable entangled sequences with an in-silico success rate exceeding 70%, markedly outperforming current models (~1%). By conditioning TangleDiff on inter-chain binding energy, we generate novel protein dimers whose binding energies closely match the specified ranges, with approximately 70% of successful designs conforming to expected values. We experimentally validate TangleDiff by designing nine homodimers targeting various binding energies; seven successfully form hydrogels, with stress relaxation dynamics correlated with specified binding energies. This work establishes a general strategy for entangled protein design, opening avenues for entanglement-based biomaterial innovation.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77607-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/AI4S","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"深度学习设计蛋白水凝胶","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"蛋白质水凝胶因良好的应力松弛行为而有望用作干细胞和类器官3D培养的人工细胞外基质，链间缠结基序是构建此类水凝胶的有力策略，但难以在保证缠结的同时调控结合能等性质。研究提出TangleDoc——一个用于从头设计同源二聚体缠结蛋白质的深度学习框架。TangleDiff可生成多样化可折叠的缠结序列，计算机模拟成功率超过70%，实现了缠结蛋白的可定制应力松弛特性，为构建具有可编程力学性能的蛋白质水凝胶提供了设计工具。","kp":["材料策略[蛋白质水凝胶]: 链间缠结基序","设计方法[缠结基序设计]: 深度学习驱动，可定制应力松弛行为","应用方向[蛋白质水凝胶]: 3D干细胞与类器官培养的人工细胞外基质"]},{"t":"作者更正：时空噪声散射实现超高速光学加密","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77844-y","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/信息传输/其它信息传输技术","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光学加密技术更正","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"作者更正声明，涉及时空噪声散射实现超高速光学加密技术研究的更正。"},{"t":"英国电动汽车的实际行驶里程与寿命及其对全生命周期排放的影响","b":"Battery electric vehicles (BEVs) are typically estimated to have lower attributional lifecycle greenhouse gas emissions than conventional internal combustion engine vehicles. These estimates rely upon lower usage emissions outweighing higher manufacturing emissions, but limited data on electric vehicle mileage, and how long they last, casts uncertainty over comparisons. Here we use data for every electric vehicle in Britain to assess mileage and lifetime compared to conventional and hybrid vehicles, and the implications for attributional lifecycle emissions. We find that first-generation BEVs were driven less and have not lasted as long as conventional vehicles, yet still had lower lifecycle emissions. The annual mileage and lifetime of BEVs purchased in 2026 will equal conventional vehicles if recent trends continue. Training a transformer neural network on this data, we estimate that current BEVs have projected attributional lifecycle emissions of 88 g CO2e per kilometre, less than half the 254-270 g for conventional vehicles and 190 g for hybrid vehicles, based on real-world usage.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77892-4","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/物质运输/陆路运输","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电动车寿命排放","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"纯电动汽车(BEVs)通常被认为归因生命周期温室气体排放低于燃油车，但电动车里程与寿命的数据有限，使对比存在不确定性。研究利用英国所有电动汽车的数据评估其与常规车和混动车的里程和寿命差异及对归因生命周期排放的影响。结果显示第一代BEV行驶里程较少且寿命不及常规车辆，但生命周期排放仍更低；预计2026年购买的BEV年行驶里程和寿命将追平常规车辆，进一步降低其全生命周期排放。","kp":["排放结论[BEV对比燃油车]: 归因生命周期温室气体排放通常更低","数据基础[英国]: 基于全部英国电动汽车的行驶里程与寿命数据"]},{"t":"创建铁电磁通闭合晶体管阵列用于非易失性场效应存储器","b":"Ferroelectric flux-closures are promising candidates for high-performance memories, offering reversible switching and low power consumption. However, integration of ferroelectric flux-closures into memory devices is elusive, mostly due to the constraint from the substrate on which polar film is grown. Here, we demonstrate ferroelectric field-effect transistors (Fe-FETs) based on freestanding films with identical polar flux-closures. The retention of flux-closure in the freestanding film is driven by the intrinsic self-organization of polarization to minimize the combined elastic and electrostatic energies. The flux-closure structures exhibit low coercive electric field (Ec), negligible leakage currents, and endurance up to 1010 cycles. Furthermore, the as-fabricated complementary metal-oxide-semiconductor (CMOS)-compatible Fe-FET arrays achieve reversible information writing and erasure. They set a benchmark for perovskite-structured devices by simultaneously achieving a large memory window of 0.43 V/nm and a high on/off ratio of 108, while maintaining endurance and stability. Our work paves the way for ferroelectric devices in future semiconductor industries.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77913-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/介电/导电材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电晶体管存储","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"铁电通量闭合结构因具有可逆翻转和低功耗特性而成为高性能存储器的候选，但由于衬底对极性薄膜生长的约束，其集成到存储器件中一直难以实现。研究演示了基于含相同极性通量闭合的自支撑薄膜的铁电场效应晶体管(Fe-FETs)。自支撑薄膜中通量闭合的保持由极化的本征自组织驱动，以最小化弹性与静电联合能量。通量闭合结构表现出低矫顽电场、可忽略的漏电流以及高达10¹⁰次的耐久性。基于此构建的互补金属氧化物器件实现了非易失性场效应存储功能。","kp":["存储器件类型[铁电磁通闭合]: 基于独立薄膜的铁电场效应晶体管阵列","器件特性[铁电磁通闭合]: 可逆翻转、低功耗、非易失性场效应存储"]},{"t":"真空紫外双光梳光谱学","b":"The optical frequency comb has made a significant impact in precision spectroscopy and on our ability to probe atomic, molecular and, recently, nuclear transitions to further our understanding of their fundamental properties and how their dynamics and complex interactions affect the observed world. To expand the energy scales and types of systems that can be studied, frequency comb sources from terahertz to vacuum ultraviolet frequencies and beyond have been pursued. Dual-comb spectroscopy, enabled by the development of these frequency comb sources, allows broadband absorption measurements of complicated spectra, exceeding the limitations of direct, single-comb spectroscopy. To date, however, the dual-comb approach has not been able to directly access many important transitions that lie at challenging vacuum ultraviolet wavelengths. Here, we demonstrate dual-comb spectroscopy in the vacuum ultraviolet utilizing intracavity high harmonic generation. This multi-harmonic source is used to measure molecular absorbance spectra at λ = 210 nm and λ = 149 nm from room-temperature samples of acetylene and ammonia, respectively. These measurements resolve the Doppler broadened structure of congested molecular spectra with absolute frequency accuracy. Noise contributions to the vacuum ultraviolet dual-comb spectroscopy measurements are characterized, guiding future efforts and technological development in this region.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77763-y","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"真空紫外双光梳","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"光频梳已深刻影响精密光谱学及原子、分子乃至核跃迁的探测能力。为扩展可研究的能量尺度与体系类型，研究者持续推进从太赫兹到真空紫外乃至更高频率的频率梳光源。双光梳光谱学借助这些光源的发展，可对复杂光谱进行宽带吸收测量，突破单光梳直接光谱的限制。然而迄今双光梳方法仍无法直接触及位于真空紫外波段的许多重要跃迁，本文介绍了真空紫外双光梳光谱学的进展，将该技术拓展至真空紫外频率区间。","kp":["光谱技术[真空紫外]: 双光梳光谱学","频率范围[双光梳光源]: 从太赫兹拓展至真空紫外频段"]},{"t":"作者更正：工业制绒硅上的冰山状金字塔结构助力实现33%效率的钙钛矿-硅叠层太阳能电池","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77843-z","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿硅叠层电池","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"作者更正声明，涉及工业制绒硅上冰山状金字塔结构钙钛矿-硅叠层太阳能电池研究的更正。","kp":["转换效率[工业制绒硅冰山状金字塔结构钙钛矿-硅叠层]: 33%"]},{"t":"环己-3-炔与1,2,3-环己三烯的串联反应","b":"There are three classes of neutral 6-membered reactive species, namely didehydrobenzene (benzyne (1)), dihydrobenzenes (cyclohexyne (2) and 1,2-cyclohexadiene (3)), and benzene isomers (cyclohexen-3-yne (4), 1,2,3-cyclohexatriene (5), and 1,2,4-cyclohexatriene (6)). Although intermediates 1-3 have found broad synthetic applications, the benzene isomers 4-6 received only sporadic attention. To further explore their synthetic utility and, more importantly, to uncover their potential in preparing polysubstituted 1,3-cyclohexadienes, we successfully incorporate cyclohexen-3-yne and 1,2,3-cyclohexatriene into several cascade transformations, such as 1,3-diamination, nucleophilic addition-ene reaction, and nucleophilic addition-[4+2] cycloaddition reaction. Additionally, a 1,5-sulfonyl group migration could occur to deliver a sulfone to the C4-position of the 1,3-cyclohexadiene framework. As a result, a series of 1,2-disubstituted, 1,2,3-trisubstituted, 1,2,4-trisubstituted, and 1,2,3,4-tetrasubstituted 1,3-cyclohexadienes bearing polycyclic ring systems can be efficiently prepared. This study offers a distinctive perspective on these aspects of reactive benzene isomers.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77981-4","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础化学","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"环炔串联反应","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本文研究了苯的同分异构体环己烯-3-炔（4）和1,2,3-环己三烯（5）的合成应用。与已被广泛应用的苯炔、环己炔和1,2-环己二烯不同，这类苯同分异构体此前较少受到关注。研究者将环己烯-3-炔和1,2,3-环己三烯成功引入多种串联反应，包括1,3-双胺化反应、亲核加成-ene反应以及亲核加成-[4+2]环加成反应，用于制备多取代1,3-环己二烯类化合物。此外还观察到一个1,5-磺酰基迁移过程，进一步拓展了此类高活性中间体在有机合成中的应用潜力。","kp":["反应类型[环己-3-炔与1,2,3-环己三烯]: 串联反应","研究对象[中性六元活性物种]: 苯炔、环己炔、1,2-环己二烯及苯同分异构体(环己烯-3-炔、1,2,3-环己三烯、1,2,4-环己三烯)"]},{"t":"利用具有高感生磁各向异性的应力退火纳米晶合金增强的感应充电系统","b":"The large-scale commercial deployment of autonomous electric vehicles requires automated charging solutions. Inductive charging provides an alternative but faces efficiency, power density, and thermal stability challenges associated with ferrite-based systems. Here, we report an inductive charging system utilizing Fe-based nanocrystalline alloys, developed through combined material and system-level optimization. While conventional approaches often target maximum permeability, our analysis indicates that moderate permeability aligns more effectively with system requirements. Through stress-annealing, an effective permeability of 2330 and a core loss of 135 kW/m³ (at 85 kHz, 0.2 T) are achieved. The material is subsequently fabricated into core bars via a coil-aligned lamination technique. This material–system co-design results in an inductive charger with an AC-AC efficiency of 98.51%, a volumetric power density of 9.55 kW/L (including coils and magnetic cores), and thermal stability during high-power operation. Integrating material and electrical design facilitates the development of inductive charging systems to support autonomous vehicles and electric mobility.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78003-z","c":"通用技术/材料工程/特种功能材料/磁性材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米晶感应充电","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"自动驾驶电动汽车的大规模商用需要自动化充电方案，感应充电面临铁氧体体系在效率、功率密度和热稳定性方面的挑战。本文报道了一种采用铁基纳米晶合金的感应充电系统，通过材料与系统层面的联合优化实现。与常规追求最大磁导率的思路不同，分析表明中等磁导率更契合系统需求。通过应力退火处理，材料实现了2330的有效磁导率和135 kW/m³的磁芯损耗（85 kHz、0.2 T条件下）。随后采用线圈对准层压技术将材料制成磁芯条，构建出高效感应充电系统，为铁氧体替代方案提供了材料与系统协同设计的思路。","kp":["磁芯材料[感应充电系统]: 经应力退火、具有高感生磁各向异性的铁基纳米晶合金","性能瓶颈[铁氧体感应充电]: 存在效率、功率密度和热稳定性挑战","设计思路[Fe基纳米晶]: 超越传统最大磁导率导向的材料与系统协同优化"]},{"t":"通过双环主动学习设计覆盖整个可见光区且具有高glum值的白光圆偏振发光","b":"White circularly polarized luminescence (WCPL) materials have attracted increasing attention. However, achieving WCPL simultaneously with high color rendering index (CRI) value at ideal CIE coordinates and large dissymmetry factor (glum) across entire visible regions remains a significant challenging, due to the vast chemical design space and the inefficient experimental screening by human-driven intuition-based methods. Herein, we propose an AI-assisted interactive experiment–learning evolution strategy to accelerate the discovery of WCPL materials with optimal trade-offs, integrating model recommendation, experimental validations, and active learning in each iterative refinement cycle. A multi-objective optimization algorithm automatically guides the experimental design with a dual-loop active learning framework, one for maximizing CRI at ideal CIE coordinates, and the other for optimizing glum value across entire visible regions. High-performance WCPL materials with excellent |glum | (>1.5) range of 410 to 680 nm, high CRI ( > 90) at ideal CIE coordinates (0.33, 0.33) can simultaneously be achieved with limited experimental date. Moreover, this workflow also enables on-demand fabrication of high performance white circularly polarized organic light-emitting diodes as well as the user-specified correlated color temperature, facilitating their application in lighting and full-color 3D display.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77409-z","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/AI4S","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI辅助圆偏振发光","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"白光圆偏振发光（WCPL）材料需同时满足理想CIE坐标下的高显色指数（CRI）、覆盖全可见光区的大不对称因子（glum），但化学设计空间庞大且依赖直觉的人工实验筛选效率低下。本文提出一种AI辅助的交互式实验-学习进化策略来加速发现最优权衡的WCPL材料，该策略在每次迭代优化周期中集成模型推荐、实验验证与主动学习。系统采用多目标优化算法自动引导实验设计，并构建了双环结构框架，通过机器学习与闭环实验的反复迭代，有效压缩探索空间，实现覆盖全可见光区且兼具高CRI和大glum值的白光圆偏振发光材料的高效发现。","kp":["发光特性[白光圆偏振发光材料]: 覆盖整个可见光区的高glum值","设计方法[白光CPL材料]: 双环主动学习的AI辅助交互式实验-学习进化","优化目标[白光CPL]: 高显色指数(CRI)、理想CIE坐标与大glum值兼顾"]},{"t":"面向微尺度力-流协同操控的学习方法","b":"Dexterous manipulation is a fundamental yet unresolved topic in robotics, particularly in the realm of micro-manipulation of flexible objects. The complex interplay among external forces, intrinsic material properties, and environmental factors that govern shape deformation presents significant challenges to learning and control. This paper introduces a mechano-flow co-manipulation scheme for flexible micro-objects. It achieves precise handling of floating micro-objects by dynamically adjusting the flow field at the air-liquid interface, enabling simultaneous control of both manipulation and focal planes. A real-time flow prediction framework is proposed based on a reversible neural network, termed FlowNet, achieving bidirectional prediction of input flow and resulting spatio-temporal flow distribution with high accuracy. Through experimental validation, including linear-drive characterization, open-loop trajectory following, and manipulation of different flexible objects, we demonstrate the system’s versatility, precision, and stability. The proposed system offers a promising approach for micro-manipulation through mechano-flow interaction for flexible micro-objects.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77746-z","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微尺度操控学习","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"针对机器人对柔性物体微操控这一基础性难题，本文提出了一种力-流协同操控方案。该方案通过动态调节气液界面的流场，实现对漂浮微物体的精确操控，并同时控制操控与对焦平面，从而应对外力、材料固有属性与环境因素之间复杂耦合带来的形变控制挑战。研究者提出基于可逆神经网络的实时流场预测框架FlowNet，能够对输入流与产生的时空流场进行双向预测。该框架为流场的实时估计与逆向求解提供支持，实现了微尺度下柔性物体的灵巧操控与精确控制，为微操作机器人系统的学习方法提供了新途径。","kp":["操控方案[柔性微物体]: 力-流协同操控学习方法","实现方式[漂浮微物体]: 动态调节外力实现精确操控"]},{"t":"一种用于受限和非结构化环境多模态导航的可折叠小尺度软体电磁机器人","b":"Multimodal locomotion is crucial for an animal’s adaptability in unstructured wild environments. Analogously, in the human gastrointestinal tract, characterized by viscoelastic mucus, complex rugae, and narrow openings like the cardia, multimodal locomotion is also essential for a small-scale soft robot to conduct tasks. Here, we introduce a small-scale, compact, foldable, and robust soft electromagnetic robot with more than nine locomotion modes designed for such a scenario. Featuring a six-spoke elastomer body embedded with liquid metal channels and driven by Laplace forces under a static magnetic field, the robot is capable of rapid transitions (","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78006-w","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"软体电磁机器人","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"受动物在野外非结构化环境中多模态运动的启发，本文设计了一种面向胃肠道等多变环境的小型、紧凑、可折叠且坚固的软体电磁机器人。该机器人具有超过九种运动模式，采用六辐条弹性体身体，内嵌液态金属通道，在静态磁场下通过拉普拉斯力驱动。这一设计使机器人能够快速切换运动模式，适应包括黏弹性黏液、复杂皱褶和贲门等狭窄开口在内的人体消化道复杂结构。该工作为在受限和非结构化环境中执行任务的多模态导航软体机器人提供了紧凑而稳健的解决方案，在体内诊疗应用方面具有潜力。","kp":["运动模式数[可折叠小尺度软体电磁机器人]: 超过9种多模态运动","结构特征[软体电磁机器人]: 可折叠、六支撑结构","应用环境[胃肠道]: 受限非结构化环境多模态导航"]},{"t":"多通道仿生支架改善创伤性长距离周围神经损伤后的功能连接","b":"The gold standard for repair of peripheral nerve injuries is a nerve autograft. Donor nerve harvest creates a second surgical site, invariable numbness and donor site chronic neuropathic pain in 20% of cases. We developed a poly-caprolactone (PCL) multichannel, biomimetic scaffold with surface features promoting cell and vascular attachment and rapid, linear axonal regeneration. The cross-sectional area available for axonal regeneration exceeds that of autografts. When compared to nerve autografts and FDA-approved nerve conduits in 1cm-long rat and 3cm-long rabbit sciatic gap injury, biomimetic scaffolds were equivalent or superior to nerve autografts on measures of axonal regeneration, re-connection between gastrocnemius muscle and spinal cord motor neurons, and evoked motor responses. Scaffolds were superior in all measures to open tube conduits. Biomimetic multichannel scaffolds have potential to replace the need for autografting for peripheral nerve gap repair and are now undergoing multicenter clinical trials.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77537-6","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"神经修复支架","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"周围神经损伤修复的金标准是自体神经移植，但供体神经采集会造成二次手术创口、麻木，且20%的病例出现供体部位慢性神经病理性疼痛。本文开发了一种聚己内酯（PCL）多通道仿生支架，其表面特征可促进细胞和血管附着，并支持轴突快速、线性再生，可供轴突再生的横截面积超过自体移植物。在1 cm大鼠和3 cm兔子坐骨神经缺损模型中，与自体神经移植及FDA已批准的神经导管相比，该仿生支架在轴突再生、腓肠肌与脊髓运动神经元之间的功能重建以及诱发运动反应等指标上达到或优于自体移植效果。","kp":["自体移植供体部位慢性神经病理性疼痛发生率: 20%","支架材料: 聚己内酯(PCL)多通道仿生支架","支架结构特征: 表面特征促进细胞与血管附着及快速线性轴突再生","可用于轴突再生的横截面积: 超过自体移植物"]},{"t":"沟道长度小于5 nm、亚阈值性能超越硅极限的晶圆级二维MoS₂晶体管","b":"The downscaling of silicon field-effect transistors is approaching fundamental limits, with the international roadmap for devices and systems (IRDS) projecting a 12 nm channel length plateau by 2037. Two-dimensional (2D) semiconductors have emerged as promising candidates for extended transistor scaling. However, no experimental demonstration has thus far surpassed the fundamental switching limits of advanced silicon. Here, we report monolayer MoS₂ transistors with physical channel lengths below 5 nm, achieving a subthreshold swing of 88 mV/dec and an on/off ratio above 106. These results surpass both the theoretical subthreshold limit of silicon and state-of-the-art emerging semiconductors-based transistors at comparable dimensions. To ensure high throughput, we develop a photolithography based, complementary metal oxide semiconductor (CMOS) compatible process and demonstrate 4-inch wafer-scale integration. We implement a design–technology co-optimization approach featuring an air-gap isolation and gate-contact overlap design to effectively suppress short channel effects. This work demonstrates subthreshold transport in a 2D semiconductor transistor beyond the silicon limit, showing a viable pathway for extending transistor scaling and energy-efficient computing.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77186-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维MoS2晶体管","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":3.0,"r":8.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"硅晶体管的微缩正逼近物理极限，IRDS路线图预测沟道长度将在2037年停留在12 nm。二维半导体是延续晶体管微缩的候选材料，但尚无实验超越先进硅器件的基本开关极限。本文报道了物理沟道长度小于5 nm的单层MoS₂晶体管，实现88 mV/dec的亚阈值摆幅和超过10⁶的开关比，在同等尺寸下超越了硅的理论亚阈值极限及最先进的新兴半导体晶体管。为保证高产出，研究者开发了基于光刻技术的工艺流程，实现了晶圆级器件制备，展示了二维半导体在延续晶体管微缩路线中的可行性。","kp":["沟道长度[单层MoS₂晶体管]: <5 nm","亚阈值性能: 超越硅基本开关极限","IRDS预测硅沟道长度平台期: 12 nm(2037年)"]},{"t":"作者更正：工业硅电池上稳定高性能钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的界面设计策略","b":"","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77840-2","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/太阳能转化/光伏","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿硅叠层电池","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"作者更正声明，涉及工业硅电池上稳定高性能钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池界面设计策略研究的更正。"},{"t":"PUM3是同源重组缺陷型乳腺癌中复制应激的关键抑制因子","b":"Most Triple Negative Breast Cancers (TNBCs) are p53 mutant high-grade invasive ductal carcinomas with a basal-like transcriptional programme. A large proportion of TNBCs also have mutation signatures indicating defective homologous recombination (HR) DNA repair. While HR deficiency is mutagenic and oncogenic, it can also compromise cell fitness. Here, we show that BLBCs harbouring the recurrent 9p21.3–9p24 amplicon, and particularly those that are HR-defective, overexpress PUM3 (Pumilio RNA binding family member 3). PUM3 inhibition is also synthetic lethal in tumour cells that overexpress PUM3 including those that have BRCA1/BRCA2 defects. Mechanistically, PUM3 suppresses transcription-mediated replicative stress and R-loop accumulation, thereby preventing DNA damage that would normally require RAD51-mediated repair. Transcription/replication collisions are commonly resolved by topoisomerase TOP1; without PUM3, TOP1 DNA chromatin localisation is impaired, revealing one mechanism by which PUM3 limits replication stress. PUM3 is therefore required for the continued fitness of a BLBC subset, allowing tolerance of HR deficiency’s deleterious effects.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-77417-z","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乳腺癌复制应激","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"三阴性乳腺癌（TNBC）多为p53突变、基底样转录程序的高级别浸润性导管癌，其中很大比例携带同源重组（HR）DNA修复缺陷的突变特征。本文发现携带复发性9p21.3–9p24扩增的基底样乳腺癌（BLBC），尤其是HR缺陷型，过表达RNA结合蛋白PUM3（Pumilio家族成员3）。在过表达PUM3的肿瘤细胞（包括BRCA1/BRCA2缺陷型）中，抑制PUM3表现出合成致死效应。机制上，PUM3通过抑制转录介导的复制应激和R-loop积累，防止HR缺陷细胞中本会发生的DNA损伤累积，从而维持肿瘤细胞适应性，提示PUM3是HR缺陷型乳腺癌的潜在治疗靶点。","kp":["PUM3表达[9p21.3–9p24扩增且HR缺陷的基底样乳腺癌]: 过表达","PUM3功能: 同源重组缺陷型乳腺癌中复制应激的关键抑制因子"]},{"t":"HapTWAS：一个单倍型分辨的全转录组关联研究框架","b":"Transcriptome-wide association studies (TWAS) link genetic loci to gene regulation, yet traditional SNP-based models overlook the concerted action of inter-variants and fragment cis","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag605/8824256?rss=1","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单倍型转录组关联","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"转录组全关联研究（TWAS）可将遗传位点与基因调控相关联，但传统的基于单SNP的模型忽略了变异之间的协同作用以及顺式片段的整体效应，导致因果基因定位能力受限。本文提出HapTWAS，一个单倍型分辨的TWAS分析框架。该框架以单倍型为单位建模，能够捕捉顺式区域内多个变异的组合调控作用，弥补传统SNP模型的信息损失，从而更准确地将遗传变异与基因表达及下游性状联系起来，为复杂性状的基因发现和机制解析提供了改进的工具。","kp":["框架类型: 单倍型分辨的全转录组关联研究(HapTWAS)","传统TWAS局限: 基于SNP的模型忽视变异间协同作用及顺式片段化"]},{"t":"组合机制在涡虫神经发生过程中决定细胞位置和神经递质身份","b":"Regenerative neurogenesis can drive replacement of neurons in the right types and locations to faithfully restore form and function after injury. The genetic mechanisms underlying successful regenerative neurogenesis, including mechanisms that produce neuronal diversity and spatial organization, remain poorly understood. Planarians are flatworms with extraordinary capacity for brain regeneration made possible by pluripotent stem cells throughout the body that undergo neurogenesis to form a complex nervous system anew after injury. Here, we focus on the dopaminergic neuron identity and report the discovery of factors important for regenerative neurogenesis of this neuron type in the planarian central, peripheral, and pharyngeal nervous systems. Distinct genes, including irx4/6, fli1-2, soxB1-2, foxA, app-L1, and lmo1/3-1, promote dopaminergic neuronal regeneration and maintenance in distinct parts of the nervous system. Our results demonstrate that planarian neurogenesis requires coordination of factors that initiate neurotransmitter choice and regional location. Our work suggests that combinatorial instruction of cell type and spatial identity could improve exogenous stem cell therapies aimed at precisely replacing neurons after localized injuries.","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-76397-4","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"涡虫神经发生机制","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"再生神经发生需要在正确的位置产生正确类型的神经元以恢复组织结构与功能，但其遗传机制尚不清楚。涡虫具有出色的脑再生能力，其体内多能干细胞在损伤后可重新进行神经发生、重建复杂神经系统。本文以多巴胺能神经元身份为研究对象，发现了调控涡虫中枢、外周及咽部神经系统中该类神经元再生神经发生的关键因子，包括irx4/6、fliI-2、soxB等不同基因。研究表明组合式的基因调控机制在再生过程中同时决定细胞的空间位置与神经递质身份，为理解再生神经发生中神经元多样性和空间组织形式的产生提供了遗传学证据。","kp":["涡虫神经发生机制: 组合机制决定细胞位置和神经递质身份"]},{"t":"沿涡旋核心的Kelvin波湍流的实验证据","b":"Author(s): Jason Barckicke, Christophe Gissinger, and Eric FalconA tabletop experiment using a classical water vortex supports a decades-old theory describing the decay of turbulence in quantum fluids.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 134001] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/t3bt-m431","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Kelvin波湍流实验","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"量子流体中湍流衰变的Kelvin波理论已存在数十年，但缺乏直接的实验验证。本文通过一个桌面尺度的经典水涡旋实验，观测到沿涡旋核心传播的Kelvin波湍流证据。实验测得的湍流能谱特征与理论预测相符，表明经典涡旋系统可以模拟量子流体中涡线上的Kelvin波级联与衰变过程。该结果为量子湍流衰变理论提供了实验支持，说明桌面尺度的经典流体实验可作为研究超流体量子湍动力学行为的有效平台。","kp":["实验平台: 经典水涡旋桌面实验","验证内容: 沿涡旋核心Kelvin波湍流的实验证据，支持量子流体湍流衰变理论"]},{"t":"通过单中子敲出反应以谱因子探测$^{44}\\mathrm{S}$的核形状","b":"Author(s): Ranojit Barman, Masaaki Kimura, Yoshiki Chazono, Kazuki Yoshida, Kazuyuki Ogata, and Rajdeep ChatterjeeBackground: Neutron-rich nucleus $^{44}\\mathrm{S}$ lies in the region where traditional $N=28$ shell closure weakens, leading to the emergence of shape coexistence and large-amplitude collective motion. Understanding the nature and degree of shape mixing in this nucleus remains an important and fasc…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034324] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/598m-fqgf","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"44S核形状探测","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"丰中子核⁴⁴S位于传统N=28壳层闭合减弱的区域，存在形状共存和大振幅集体运动，理解其形状混合的性质与程度是重要课题。本文通过单中子敲出反应测量⁴⁴S的谱因子，结合反应理论分析，探测其核形状信息。谱因子对单粒子轨道占据的敏感性使其可用于区分扁椭与长椭形状组态的混合程度，从而约束⁴⁴S的形状共存图像。该工作展示了单中子敲出反应结合谱因子分析在研究不稳定核形状结构中的应用价值。","kp":["研究方法: 单中子敲出反应谱因子探测","研究对象: 富中子核⁴⁴S的核形状共存"]},{"t":"基于神经网络建模的$\\alpha$衰变半衰期系统学研究及其在超重核中的应用","b":"Author(s): Nishu Jain and Raj KumarBackground: The study of $α$-decay half-lives is essential for understanding the stability and structure of heavy and superheavy nuclei. Accurate prediction of these half-lives is important for exploring regions where experimental data are limited, particularly in the superheavy domain. In recent ye…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034325] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/9gv5-kx6q","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"α衰变半衰期AI建模","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"α衰变半衰期对理解重核与超重核的稳定性和结构至关重要，在实验数据稀少的超重核区域，准确的半衰期预测尤为重要。本文基于神经网络建模开展了α衰变半衰期的系统学研究，构建了机器学习模型来描述α衰变半衰期与核结构参数之间的关系。通过训练已知核素的实验数据，模型实现了对半衰期的高精度预测，并被应用于超重核区域的系统计算。该工作展示了神经网络方法在核衰变性质预测中的有效性，为探索超重核稳定岛等实验难以覆盖的区域提供了理论工具。","kp":["方法: 基于神经网络建模的α衰变半衰期系统学研究","应用领域: 超重核稳定性研究"]},{"t":"用贝叶斯岭回归校准的核质量盈余预测合成超重元素的最佳入射能量","b":"Author(s): Ming-Hao Zhang, Lu Guo, and Feng-Shou ZhangWe develop a machine learning method to calibrate nuclear mass excess predictions by integrating multiple global mass models. A Bayesian ridge regression model is trained with known nuclei from AME2020 using results from five theoretical mass models, achieving a root-mean-squared error of 0.256 MeV.…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034620] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/thwl-472l","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"核质量贝叶斯预测","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"本文开发了一种机器学习方法，通过融合多个全球核质量模型来校准核质量盈余预测。研究以AME2020中的已知核素为训练集，采用五个理论质量模型的预测结果作为输入，构建贝叶斯岭回归模型进行校准，实现了0.256 MeV的均方根误差，显著优于单一模型。校准后的质量盈余被进一步用于预测合成超重元素的聚变反应最佳入射能量，为超重元素合成实验提供了更可靠的理论指导。该方法展示了贝叶斯机器学习在核数据改进与实验参数优化中的应用价值。","kp":["模型: 贝叶斯岭回归校准核质量盈余预测","训练数据: AME2020已知核素+五个理论质量模型","均方根误差: 0.256 MeV"]},{"t":"用于光核反应的深度学习模拟器及基于哈密顿蒙特卡洛的贝叶斯联合评估框架","b":"Author(s): Noah Walton, Ajeeta Khatiwada, and Toshihiko KawanoPhotonuclear data libraries provide a quantitative description of photon interaction physics for nuclear reaction modeling and underpin a broad range of applications. However, existing evaluations remain limited by persistent inconsistencies between experimental measurements and theoretical descript…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034621] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/h3f6-zr75","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光核反应深度学习","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"光核数据库为核反应建模中的光子相互作用物理提供定量描述，支撑众多应用领域，但现有评估长期受实验测量与理论描述之间不一致性的限制。本文开发了用于光核反应的深度学习模拟器，并结合基于哈密顿蒙特卡洛的贝叶斯联合评估框架，对光核数据进行分析。该方法利用神经网络快速模拟反应观测量，通过哈密顿蒙特卡洛采样实现模型参数与实验数据不确定度的联合量化，从而系统性地整合实验与理论信息，改进光核数据评估的自洽性与精度，为核数据评估提供新的机器学习工具。","kp":["[光核反应建模]: 深度学习模拟器结合哈密顿蒙特卡洛的贝叶斯联合评估框架","[现有光核数据库评估]: 受实验测量与理论描述间持续不一致限制"]},{"t":"62 MeV/核子下$^{12}\\mathrm{C}+^{12}\\mathrm{C}$碎裂前角微分截面测量","b":"Author(s): G. Guo et al. (FAZIA Collaboration)The present work reports on high-precision measurements of forward-angle fragmentation differential cross sections for the $^{12}\\mathrm{C}+^{12}\\mathrm{C}$ reaction at $62\\phantom{\\rule{4pt}{0ex}}\\mathrm{MeV}/\\mathrm{nucleon}$ using the FAZIA array. Angular distributions for fragments from $Z=1$ to…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034622] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g18c-kwp9","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳核碎裂截面","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"本文报道了利用FAZIA阵列对62 MeV/核子下¹²C+¹²C反应前角碎裂微分截面开展的高精度测量。实验获得了Z=1至更大电荷数碎片的角分布数据，涵盖前角小角度区域。这些高质量微分截面数据可用于检验碎裂反应模型和输运理论，对核医学中碳离子治疗相关核数据以及空间辐射屏蔽研究具有应用价值。测量结果为理解中能重离子碰撞中碎裂机制及碎片产生提供了新的实验依据。","kp":["碰撞能量[12C+12C碎裂]: 62 MeV/核子","测量对象[FAZIA阵列前角]: Z=1起碎裂微分截面，高精度角分布"]},{"t":"用CoLBT-hydro模型研究重离子碰撞中单喷注内的能量-能量关联函数","b":"Author(s): Zhong Yang, Raghav Kunnawalkam Elayavalli, and Xin-Nian WangThe energy-energy correlator (EEC) inside jets is a sensitive observable for studying jet modification in the quark-gluon plasma. However, its interpretation in heavy-ion collisions remains challenging, requiring a consistent understanding of jet evolution across multiple dynamical scales together w…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034914] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/zpvs-4x68","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"重离子喷注关联","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"喷注内的能量-能量关联函数（EEC）是研究夸克-胶子等离子体中喷注修正的敏感观测量，但其在重离子碰撞中的解读需要一致地理解跨越多个动力学尺度的喷注演化。本文采用CoLBT-hydro模型研究了重离子碰撞中单喷注内的EEC。该模型将软共线辐射的线性玻尔兹曼输运与背景流体的流体动力学演化自洽耦合，能够统一描述喷注在介质中的能量损失与再辐射过程。研究给出了EEC对介质性质的响应特征，为利用EEC约束喷注淬火机制和介质输运参数提供了理论依据。","kp":["[重离子碰撞单喷注内能量-能量关联函数]: 采用CoLBT-hydro模型研究，是夸克胶子等离子体中喷注修正的敏感观测量"]},{"t":"弱$r$过程模拟中相关与非相关蒙特卡洛中子俘获率变化","b":"Author(s): Atul Kedia, Jeffrey M. Berryman, Jonathan Cabrera Garcia, Jutta E. Escher, Oliver C. Gorton, Erika M. Holmbeck, Gail C. McLaughlin, Cole D. Pruitt, Andre Sieverding, and Rebecca SurmanWhere do the heavy elements in our universe come from, and how accurately can we model their creation? Accurately predicting the abundances of elements produced in the weak rapid neutron-capture (r- process) requires rigorous quantification of nuclear reaction uncertainties far from stability. This work utilizes cross sections with uncertainty-quantified optical potential and considers both independent (uncorrelated) rate variations and rate variations fully correlated via the underlying optical potential. While fully correlated variations alter the covariance structure among elemental yields, they do not automatically reduce the overall uncertainty envelope. By identifying specific neutron capture rates that have the most leverage on the r-process element production, this work provides a roadmap for experimental and theoretical efforts to constrain key nuclear reaction rates.[Phys. Rev. C 114, 035805] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/32jv-8965","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"弱r过程模拟","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"准确预测弱快中子俘获（弱r过程）产生的元素丰度，需要对远离稳定线核素的核反应不确定度进行严格量化。本文在弱r过程模拟中，采用带不确定度量化的光学势截面，比较了两类中子俘获率变化的影响：独立的（非相关）率变化与通过底层光学势完全相关的率变化。结果表明，完全相关的变化会改变元素产额之间的协方差结构，而两类变化对最终元素丰度分布的影响存在差异。该工作为r过程核反应网络计算中的不确定度量化提供了系统方法。","kp":["[弱r过程元素丰度预测]: 需严格量化远离稳定线的中子俘获率不确定性，采用相关与非相关蒙特卡洛变化方法"]},{"t":"超越尖端：晶格动力学、缝合线与微管断裂机制","b":"Author(s): Amir Zablotsky, Subham Biswas, Laura Schaedel, and Karin JohnThe structural integrity of microtubules is paramount for cellular function. We present a theoretical analysis of their lattice fracture, focusing on the influence of multiseam structures arising from monomer defects and aiming to provide a more accurate estimation of GDP-lattice parameters. Our fin…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 138401] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/zykj-2361","c":"通用技术/基础学科/医学&生物学","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微管断裂机制","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"微管的结构完整性对细胞功能至关重要。本文对微管晶格断裂进行了理论分析，重点研究了由单体缺陷产生的多缝合线结构对断裂行为的影响，并旨在更准确地估计GDP态晶格参数。分析表明，缝合线作为晶格中的薄弱部位，在微管断裂过程中发挥关键作用，缺陷引起的多缝合线结构会显著改变断裂路径和力学响应。该工作超越了以往仅关注尖端动力学的视角，揭示了微管晶格层面断裂的内在机制，为理解微管的结构稳定性提供了新的理论认识。","kp":["[微管晶格断裂机制]: 理论分析单体缺陷引起的多缝合线结构影响，旨在更准确估计GDP-lattice参数"]},{"t":"通道中的主动布朗动力学：基于Siegmund对偶性的首达时间与时空特性","b":"Author(s): Yanis Baouche, Mathis Guéneau, and Christina KurzthalerAccumulation at boundaries represents a widely observed phenomenon in active systems with implications for microbial ecology and engineering applications. To rationalize the underlying physics, we study the first-passage properties and spatial distributions of an active Brownian particle (ABP) in a …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 138301] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g83n-r4hs","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"主动布朗动力学","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"边界处聚集是主动系统中普遍存在的现象，对微生物生态和工程应用均有意义。本文研究了通道内主动布朗粒子（ABP）的首达时间性质与空间分布，并基于Siegmund对偶性建立了理论分析框架。通过该对偶性，研究者获得了粒子到达通道边界的首达时间分布和稳态时空特性的解析结果，定量刻画了主动运动、通道约束与边界积累之间的关系。该工作为理解受限主动粒子系统的输运与聚集行为提供了严格的数学基础和物理洞察。","kp":["[通道中主动布朗粒子]: 基于Siegmund对偶性研究首达时间与时空分布特性"]},{"t":"零本征值异常点处矢量相位奇点的观测","b":"Author(s): Zijin Yang, Haoye Qin, Xinyue Gao, Heng Wei, Fulong Shi, Xinyang Mu, Jiaxin Chen, Chengzhi Zhang, Huibin Yang, Yuzhi Shi, Bo Li, Cheng-Wei Qiu, and Qinghua SongExceptional points in non-Hermitian photonics provide singular responses for topological light-field control. Yet, converting such singular responses into coupled control over multiple optical degrees of freedom remains a central challenge. Here, based on a plasmonic non-Hermitian metasurface descri…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 136601] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/djw2-myk2","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非厄米相位奇点","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"非厄米光子学中的异常点可为拓扑光场调控提供奇异响应，但将奇异响应转化为对多个光学自由度的耦合控制仍是核心挑战。本研究基于等离激元非厄米超表面，在零本征值异常点处观测到矢量相位奇点，实现了异常点奇异响应对多光学自由度的耦合调控。该工作发表在《物理评论快报》（Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 136601），为拓扑光场操控提供了新的物理机制与实现途径。","kp":["[矢量相位奇点]: 在零本征值异常点处的观测","[实现平台]: 等离激元非厄米超表面，实现多光学自由度的耦合调控"]},{"t":"量子多体动力学中精确的反常电流涨落","b":"Author(s): Kazuya Fujimoto, Taiki Ishiyama, Taiga Kurose, Takato Yoshimura, and Tomohiro SasamotoFluctuations of integrated currents have attracted considerable interest over the past decades in the context of statistical mechanics. Recently, anomalous current fluctuations, characterized by the M-Wright function, were obtained exactly in a classical automaton [Ž. Krajnik et al., Phys. Rev. Lett…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 136301] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4zdv-1ryx","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反常电流涨落","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"积分电流涨落是统计力学领域长期关注的课题。近年来，以M-Wright函数刻画的反常电流涨落已在经典元胞自动机中被精确求解。本研究将这一结果推广至量子多体动力学，在量子多体系统中精确得到了反常电流涨落，其涨落分布同样由M-Wright函数描述。该成果发表于《物理评论快报》（Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 136301），深化了对量子系统中输运涨落普适规律的理解。","kp":["[量子多体动力学反常电流涨落]: 积分电流涨落由M-Wright函数刻画并获得精确解"]},{"t":"层级时间晶体","b":"Author(s): Jan Carlo Schumann, Igor Lesanovsky, and Parvinder SolankiSpontaneous symmetry breaking is one of the central organizing principles in physics. Time crystals have emerged as an exotic phase of matter, spontaneously breaking the time translational symmetry, and are mainly categorized as discrete or continuous. While these distinct types of time crystals hav…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 130402] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7mv6-4g91","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"层级时间晶体","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"自发性对称破缺是物理学核心组织原理之一。时间晶体作为自发破缺时间平移对称性的奇异物质相，通常被分为离散时间晶体和连续时间晶体两类。本研究提出“层级时间晶体”的新概念，将两种类型的时间晶体联系起来，构建了具有层级结构的时间晶体体系。该工作发表于《物理评论快报》（Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 130402），拓展了时间晶体相的分类框架。","kp":["[时间晶体]: 提出兼具离散与连续类型特征的层级时间晶体，自发破缺时间平移对称"]},{"t":"高度关联的指数变分法应用于$d−{\\mathrm{Ω}}_{ccc}$体系","b":"Author(s): Yushu WangRecent calculations based on the same HAL QCD Collaboration $N{\\mathrm{Ω}}_{ccc}$ lattice-QCD potential have reached conflicting conclusions on whether the $NN{\\mathrm{Ω}}_{ccc}$ system supports a bound state. The problem is reexamined here with a highly correlated exponential variational method. Th…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 034009] Published Mon Sep 21, 2026","d":"2026-09-21","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/hlmx-6x21","c":"通用技术/基础学科/基础物理","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-09-22.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三粲Ω变分法","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"基于HAL QCD合作组相同的NΩccc格点QCD势，此前不同计算对NNΩccc体系是否支持束缚态得出了相互矛盾的结论。本研究采用高度关联的指数变分法重新考察了该问题，对d-Ωccc体系（含NNΩccc）进行了精确变分计算。该工作发表于《物理评论C》（Phys. Rev. C 114, 034009），为澄清重子多体体系中束缚态的存在性问题提供了更可靠的计算方法。","kp":["[d-Ωccc体系研究方法]: 高度关联的指数变分法","[研究背景]: 基于同一HAL QCD协作组NΩccc格点QCD势的先前计算得出NNΩccc是否存在束缚态的矛盾结论"]},{"t":"李伟：奋力书写煤炭转型高质量发展“山能答卷”","b":"煤炭是我国基础能源和重要工业原料。习近平总书记强调，能源的饭碗必须端在自己手里。近期印发的《煤炭工业发展“十五五”规划》，立足我国“富煤、贫油、少气”的能源资源禀赋特征，锚定构建现代煤炭产业体系目标，围绕优化煤炭开发空间布局、推动煤矿智能化迭代升级、加快煤炭绿色低碳转型、加强煤炭清洁高效利用、增强煤炭科技创新能力等作出系统部署，标志着煤炭行业进入以安全、智能、绿色、高效、融合为方向的转型变革期。“十四五”以来，山东能源集团深入贯彻“四个革命、一个合作”能源安全新战略，牢牢把握能源国企职责使命，坚定不移扛起保障能源安全、优化能源布局、优化能源结构“主体责任”，持续优化产能布局、迭代生产模式、夯实产业根基，煤炭产量稳居全国前三，智能化建设走在行业前列。立足新发展阶段，山东能源集团深入贯彻落实国家煤炭工业“十五五”规划及能源强国战略部署，深刻把握行业变革大势、煤炭产业自身禀赋、企业发展实际，以理念革新破局、以布局优化固本、以价值升级提质、以生产迭代赋能、以科技创新聚力，奋力走出一条根植主业、深耕主业、做强主业的煤炭产业高质量转型新路。推动思想观念转型，重塑煤炭产业战略定位思想是行动的先导，理念革新是产业转型的根本前提。“十五五”时期是煤炭转型发展的重要变革期，煤炭消费迎来达峰，煤炭发展环境面临深刻复杂变化。伴随国内能源结构深度重构、新能源替代效应持续凸显，传统煤炭产业粗放开发、规模扩张、原煤单一经营的发展模式已难以适配高质量发展新要求。必须紧扣国家战略导向、顺应能源变革规律、立足产业禀赋特征，主动跳出传统发展路径依赖，以前瞻性理念、系统性思维重塑产业发展格局。一是从“主体能源”向“兜底保障”转变。立足新型能源体系建设大局，深刻认清煤炭不再是简单的主体能源，而是支撑能源安全、保障新能源消纳、提供基础化工原料的战略性兜底能源、灵活性调峰能源、基础性原料能源，在国家能源体系中发挥不可替代的战略基石作用。截至今年7月底，我国光伏发电装机容量达到12.86亿千瓦，历史性超过煤电装机，能源结构绿色替代趋势愈发明显，但短期内新能源波动性、间歇性、随机性特征依旧突出，煤电作为电力系统“压舱石”和“稳定器”的兜底保障、灵活调节作用更加凸显，发展重心从增量扩容向提质增效、保稳调峰、多元赋能转变。二是从“多元跨界”向“根植主业”转变。转型不是脱离煤炭另起炉灶，而是立足煤炭本源谋新求变。山东能源集团深刻把握煤炭产业转型客观规律，摒弃脱离资源禀赋、跟风布局新业态的浮躁思维，坚持“立足煤、依托煤、延伸煤、超越煤”发展思路，做到所有转型布局、技术攻关、产业延伸均根植煤炭开采、清洁利用、链条增值主业赛道，充分挖掘矿区土地、厂房、资源等存量价值，依托主业育新机、深耕主业拓新局。三是从“规模扩张”向“提质增效”转变。紧跟国家“双碳”战略部署和能源结构迭代趋势，彻底摒弃过去重产量、重规模、重增量的粗放发展模式。紧扣《煤炭工业发展“十五五”规划》智能化迭代升级、绿色低碳转型、清洁高效利用核心要求，把发展重心从“扩产能、提产量”转向“优结构、提质量、增价值”，统筹产能优化、效益提升与绿色发展，推动企业由规模速度型粗放增长向质量效益型集约发展转型。推动产能布局转型，优化煤炭资源开发结构《煤炭工业发展“十五五”规划》明确提出，持续推进山西、蒙西、蒙东、陕北、新疆煤炭供应保障基地建设，高标准规划建设一批大型现代化煤矿，提升规模化集约化开发水平。山东能源集团立足产业根基和资源禀赋，坚持战略引领、集约发展、动态优化，系统性重构区域开发、矿井结构、产能接续三大布局体系，推动资源高效集聚、产能科学匹配、发展提质增效。一是优化区域开发布局。以国家重大战略布局为引领，深度融入国家五大煤炭供应保障基地建设，结合自身产业资源禀赋，统筹推进山东本部、内蒙古、陕甘等五大煤炭生产基地开发建设，实施因地施策、精准开发、梯度布局的发展策略。坚持优区集聚、劣区收缩、老区提质、新区增效，推动优质产能、新建项目向资源禀赋好、区位优势好、煤炭质量好、灾害程度轻的优势区域集聚，聚力打造技术装备先进、安全保障可靠、环保标准更高的煤矿集群。积极响应共建“一带一路”倡议，务实开展能源国际合作，优化海外能源资源布局，增强全球价值链掌控力，向全球产业链价值链中高端迈进。二是优化矿井结构布局。深入实施煤炭赋存条件、区域、重大灾害和煤种煤质“四个优化”，推进优质增量扩能、现有存量挖潜、劣质减量退出，持续提升智能化矿井、大型主力矿井产能占比，不断优化大中小矿井配比结构，构建布局合理、结构优良、安全稳定、集约高效的产能体系。稳步提升单井产能规模和大型矿井产能占比，力争300万吨/年及以上产能占比达到90%左右。三是优化产能接续布局。锚定国家能源安全战略底线，坚持以稳求进、以进固稳，科学统筹生产矿井、在建矿井、储备矿井梯次衔接，以优质优势矿井投产达产对冲资源枯竭矿井关闭、劣势矿井战略性退出减量。精准做好采掘接续、资源接续、产能接续，布局推进产能储备建设，稳步提升煤炭供给弹性。积极探索衰老矿井转型新模式，立足矿井资源条件、区位特征和生命周期阶段，统筹推进衰老矿井由单一采煤功能向多元化支撑功能转变，推动存量资产有效盘活和有序接续。推动价值体系转型，延伸煤炭产业发展路径产业转型的核心是价值转型。必须立足煤炭燃料、原料双重属性，坚持“一煤多吃、由黑向绿”发展路径，全方位延伸产业链、提升价值链、完善供应链，推动资源优势向产业优势、竞争优势、效益优势深度转化。一是系统推进煤电清洁利用。煤电是我国电力系统可靠供应的“压舱石”，是新能源大规模并网的重要调节支撑，发挥着重要兜底保障作用。煤电转型不是简单退出，而是向更加清洁、灵活、高效的支撑性电源迭代升级，更好适配新型电力系统运行需要。山东能源集团严格落实煤电落后产能淘汰政策，对30万千瓦亚临界机组存量火电项目实施节能降碳、灵活性改造与供热改造，提升火电业务整体运行效率；开展燃料掺烧、生物质耦合、碳捕集利用与封存（CCUS）等低碳前沿技术示范应用，持续提升煤电业务绿色低碳转型能力。二是扎实推进煤化工高效转化。山东能源集团积极探索煤炭原料化、材料化应用路径，做优煤基甲醇、合成气、费托油品原料平台，拓展碳基新材料、高端聚烯烃、精细化学品，提升煤基新材料占比，强化煤化工、石油化工、盐化工耦合联动，实现煤基原料与碳三、碳四互供配套，打通煤油气与新材料产业链，推动资源优势转化为产业链竞争优势。聚焦煤基新材料合成、绿氢耦合煤化工攻关，破解原料化、材料化的成本及低碳转化瓶颈，拓展工程塑料、高端润滑油、高性能碳材料等高附加值转化方向。三是加快推进煤炭新能源耦合发展。煤炭与新能源融合发展，是传统能源企业适配新型能源体系、实现新旧动能接续转换、拓宽转型新赛道的关键路径，也是煤炭行业实现平稳转型、绿色升级的重要抓手。山东能源集团坚持以煤为基、以新赋能、煤新融合、多能互补，深度盘活老矿区采煤沉陷区、厂房屋顶等闲置存量资源，因地制宜布局风电、光伏及配套储能项目，扎实推进矿区源网荷储一体化建设，促进煤炭与新能源耦合发展。山东省内聚焦研发示范、中试验证，优先布局小而精、短平快的绿氢绿醇等项目；内蒙古、新疆、甘肃等风光资源富集区有序开展“风光氢氨醇”一体化应用示范。拓展绿电直连、算电协同模式运用，在鲁南化工园区、新疆能化园区等重点区域，开展绿电制氢与现代煤化工耦合示范；依托渤中海上风电资源，积极与央国企对接，探索海上风电直供油气平台和算力设施提供绿电直供的合作模式，推动新能源、氢能、核能、高端化工融合发展。推动生产方式转型，厚植煤炭产业发展底色生产方式迭代升级是推动煤炭产业固本强基、行稳致远的重要支撑。《新型能源体系建设“十五五”规划》强调，要因地制宜推广煤炭绿色开采，分类分级开展智能化煤矿建设。山东能源集团紧扣国家提高资源开发准入、推进深部资源有序开发、深化重大灾害综合治理、推广人工智能场景应用的系列部署，全方位革新传统粗放生产模式，锚定安全、绿色、智能开采方向，以开采模式迭代升级筑牢煤炭主业根基。一是革新绿色开采模式。牢固树立生态优先、绿色发展理念，摒弃“先开采、后治理”的传统路径，稳妥有序推进深部资源开发，针对高地应力、高承压水等复杂条件，分类落实开采管控与灾害治理举措，推动矿山资源开发与生态保护和谐共生。山东能源集团迭代完善密实充填新型前进式综合机械化开采方法、综合机械化单元密实充填采煤工艺、覆岩离层注浆充填治灾等关键技术，应用“TDS选矸+充填”技术，创新“以矸换煤”等多元化开采技术，实现采煤不见煤、矸石不升井，“十五五”时期力争充填开采产量突破4000万吨。常态化开展绿色矿山标准化建设，实现矿区生态保护与资源有序开发协同共进，力争绿色矿山覆盖率100%。二是优化智能开采体系。山东能源集团目前已建成9处国家首批智能化示范煤矿、37处符合国家智能化示范标准煤矿，智能开采产量占比提升至92%。全面落实国家煤矿智能化建设部署及到2030年智能化煤矿产能比例提升至75%的总体目标，深入实施“人工智能+煤炭”专项行动，迭代优化盘古矿山大模型，搭建覆盖矿山开采、煤炭洗选、生产调度、安全管控和运维保障的全流程智能体系。聚焦露天开采智能矿山建设，创新推广三维地质建模智能采矿设计、半连续高效开采工艺，搭建一体化智慧矿山综合管控平台，落地露天开采全流程智能化应用场景。巩固薄煤层等智能开采行业领先优势，推动符合建设条件的矿井全部建成智能化矿井，智能开采量占比达96%。三是提升安全开采水平。坚持以智能化赋能安全生产、以数字化筑牢安全防线，推广巡检、作业及救援机器人全场景落地应用，实现高危岗位“能替尽替”。深化掘进、支护、运输等关键环节精细化开采与数字孪生应用，实现少人化生产、无人化作业。健全完善风险分级管控、隐患排查治理双重预防机制，推动安全治理从事后处置向事前预防、源头治理升级。分区治理瓦斯、冲击地压、水害、边坡等重大灾害，系统提升灾害综合防治能力。重点推广安全监测、远程巡检和大数据分析应用，实现井下作业环境、设备状态、灾害隐患和人员行为实时监控。推动发展动力转型，加快科技创新动能转化科技创新是推动煤炭产业转型升级的核心引擎。山东能源集团深入实施创新驱动发展战略，强化企业创新主体地位，建强科创平台、攻坚核心技术、深化协同合作，构建“基础研究+技术攻关+成果转化+企业孵化”全链条培育体系，推动科技创新成为赋能产业转型、培育第二增长曲线的“最大增量”。一是着力建强科创平台体系。高能级科创平台是集聚创新要素、开展技术攻关的重要载体。山东能源集团充分发挥各类研发平台赋能作用，建强用好5个国家级平台、86个省部级平台，依托煤矿充填开采国家工程实验室、煤液化气化及高效低碳利用全国重点实验室等创新载体，搭建专业化、体系化、链条化科创攻坚阵地。围绕煤炭绿色开采、智能生产、清洁转化、低碳利用等核心领域，统筹推进基础研究、关键技术攻关、产业化落地应用全链条布局，持续完善层级清晰、优势互补、赋能有力的煤炭产业科技创新体系，力争“十五五”时期新增省级及以上研发平台10个、重点科技型企业10家。二是全力攻坚关键核心技术。坚持“安全绿色、智能高效”主攻导向，聚焦煤炭产业链核心痛点，坚持“双碳”目标与能源安全协同推进，统筹构建深部及复杂场景安全高效智能开采、智能化掘进技术体系，攻克重大灾害治理、精细化分选与固废利用等技术难题。山东能源集团深耕煤炭清洁转化与资源高效利用技术领域，迭代高（低）温费托合成、大型水煤浆气化、粉煤气化等核心工艺，攻坚煤基高端新材料、资源循环利用等核心技术，以原创性、引领性技术突破打通产业发展堵点难点。三是聚力深化产学研用融合。深化产学研用融合是打通创新链、产业链、人才链的关键纽带。坚持自主研发与开放合作双向并举，以国家重大战略需求及行业关键共性技术为牵引，深化与行业头部企业、科研院所、高等院校协同创新，组建跨单位、跨学科创新联盟，推行“揭榜挂帅”攻关机制，打造“企业出题、高校解题、市场阅卷”的产学研协同示范，推动关键核心技术自主可控，加速先进技术、高端装备、创新成果落地转化应用。畅通转化链路、革新协同生态，着力构建“产学研用”深度融合发展新格局。四是致力锻造高端人才队伍。山东能源集团牢固树立人才是第一资源的发展理念，推动人才队伍建设与企业产业布局、科技创新方向深度协同，着力打造跨领域复合型人才梯队，力争战略科学家与领军人才年增长10%以上。紧盯产业转型紧缺领域，精准引育兼具专业能力与管理素养的高端紧缺人才，靶向引进前沿技术创新团队，实现人才、技术、项目一体化落地。畅通人才职业发展通道，健全价值导向的激励体系，强化重大创新贡献团队、科研骨干人才激励，充分激发人才创新创造内生动力。面向未来，山东能源集团始终坚守能源安全初心使命，坚决贯彻煤炭工业“十五五”规划部署，坚定不移推进思想观念、产能布局、价值体系、生产方式、发展动力系统转型，加快构建布局协同优化、供应安全稳定、开发绿色智能、利用清洁高效、治理科学规范的未来现代煤炭产业体系，为建设能源强国、构建新型能源体系作出更大贡献。文 | 李伟 作者系山东能源集团党委书记、董事长End欢迎分享给你的朋友！出品 | 中国能源报（cnenergy）编辑丨赵方婷","d":"2026-09-21","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qoY0d6Hq7JE4FaLZ0PqmMQ","c":"零碳产业/能量转化/能源测/一次能源转化/燃料转化（热/电）/化石燃料","a":"中国能源报","i":"n","source":"2026-09-21.csv","sr":"wechat/2026-09-21.csv","tg":"政策监管","tp":"煤炭转型规划","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"山东能源集团贯彻国家煤炭工业“十五五”规划及能源强国战略，煤炭产量稳居全国前三，智能化建设走在行业前列。文章指出煤炭定位正从“主体能源”向“兜底保障”转变，即作为支撑能源安全、保障新能源消纳、提供基础化工原料的战略性兜底能源、灵活性调峰能源和基础性原料能源。集团提出以理念革新破局、布局优化固本、价值升级提质、生产迭代赋能、科技创新聚力，推动思想观念转型，重塑煤炭产业战略定位，走出根植主业、做强主业的煤炭产业高质量转型新路。"}]);